<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Uchokholha</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikitabu yo Uchokholha</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uchokholha</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uchk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikitabu yo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uchokholha</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uhoolhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Uchokholha phi “upachera” wo ittu iriyoothe. Ikitabu yo Uchokholha ilha phi nohimiacha mwaha wo wuupiya wo ilhapo ni machokholhelho a ntu. Tho, malhove anohoolha ayo anonihimiachera uwonya wa ntu chenre aya wo uchokholha, Nlhuku chenre awe wo uwehaweha ni ntwarusho nawe vachulhu wo wowo uwonya uwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo Uchokholha inomianihiya velhi. 1. Milhako cho 1-11 chinonhimiacha Nlhuku chenre awe wo wuupa ilhapo ni wuupiya wa ntu ni wuupiya wo chittu chonkhaye. Mwommo phi neewa ihu mwaha wa apwiiya Adamu ni ahanu aya Ahawa, ni achishaana aya, Nakaini ni Nahabilu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwaha wa Anuhu ni iyari aya, uchara wo maashi o niwambwe velhaponi ni mwaha wo uthekiya wo ishanja yo Ubabeli. 2. Milhako cho 12-50 phi mwaha wa manyaapwiiya o khalhayi o Israeli. Anochokholha uhimiachiya phi Aburahimu aachuwanelhe wo nrima waya ni uvarechesha waya mitheko cha Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwaha unttwara uri wa anaaya, Naisaka ni iyari aya, mwaha wa Nayakhobo anaaya Naisaka, nchina no Israeli ni mwaha unaacha achishaana aya khumi ni elhi, aari machokholhelho o makosho khumi ni meelhi o Israeli. Tho unoohimiya mwaha u Nayusufu anaaya Nayakhobo ni mwaha waakhumelhenlhe aya vamoka ni achishaana aya wo urwaa ukhalhani Umisri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhina ikitabu yonkhaye Nlhuku phi nohimiya, toka wuupiya wo ilhapo, uwonya wa attu, ntwarusho, mitheko chawe cho waalhoha ni waakavihera attu awe ni malhehano aapanga awe wa attu yaavahera awe ibarakha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tho, chiicho ilha ikitabu yo ithelhi cho khalhayi ilha ihosungeha mwaha waahimia mirima chaarina aya attu ni ushungehiya wo chechiyo mirima chiyo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">1. Nlhuku nowuupa ilhapo, nomuupa ntu ni chittu chonkhaye 1:1-2:25</para>
  <para style="io">Uwonya wa ntu chenre aya wo uchokholha ni ntwarusho 3:1-24</para>
  <para style="io">Adamu mpaka Anuhu 4:1-5:32</para>
  <para style="io">Ikatema ya Anuhu ni uchara maashi o niwambwe 6:1-10:32</para>
  <para style="io">Uthekiya ishanja yo Ubabeli 11:1-9</para>
  <para style="io">Nashemu mpaka Naabramu 11:10-32</para>
  <para style="io">Manyaapwiiya Aburahimu, Naisaka ni Nayakhobo 12:1-35:29</para>
  <para style="io">Iyari i Naesau 36:1-43</para>
  <para style="io">Mwaha wa Nayusufu ni manyonnaya 37:1-45:28</para>
  <para style="io">Aisraeli vaari aya Umisri 46:1-50:26</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Wuupiya wo ilhapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Wo uchokholha vawo Nlhuku ahoupa irimu ni ilhapo. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Ilhapo yaari wo uhichuwania chiri aya, wo uhikhalha ni ittu nhina. Tho, ipiphi yaari vachulhu maashi o wiisha, ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku aari nakhunenlhe vachulhu waya, eetakachaka vachulhu maashi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Nlhuku nkeera “Waarie, ukhalhe nkwee.” Nkawaaria, nkawaakhalha nkwee. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Nlhuku nkaachivelhiya waaria uwo. Nkaamwalhaaniha waaria ni ipiphi, <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />nkeehana waaria uwo “Uthana” ni ipiphi iyo nkeehana “Uhiyu.” Nkaweelha, nkawaasha, nenno naari nihuku no upacha.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Nlhuku nkeera, “Ikhalhe ittu variyari maashi, imianihe maashi mipata miilhi, uno ni uno.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Paahi etu Nlhuku nkoupa ittu yo umianiha maashi o uchulhu ni maashi arii vathi. Nkayeeria chiicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Nkeehana ittu yaamianihilhe maashi iyo, “Irimu.” Nkaweelha, nkawaasha nihuku no neyelhi.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Nlhuku nkeera, “Maashi ari wuuthi irimu athukumaaneke vamoka ni vakittu voomilhe vakhumelhelhe.” Nkayeeria chiichammo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Nkeehana voomilhe vawo, “Ilhapo” ni maashi aathukumanne vamoka nkeehana “Ibahari.” Nlhuku nkoona wiira vahorera.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Tho nkaalhehera wiira, “Ilhapo imelhe mikoko cho uyara imbeyu ni miri chinoyara imbeyu cho kila nikosho.” Nkayeeria chiicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Paahi, ilhapo nkayaamelha mikoko cho kila nikosho, ni miri chinemma maphepu o imbeyu cho kila nikosho. Nlhuku nkoona wiira vahorera. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Nkaweelha, nkawaasha, nenno nihuku no neraru.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Nlhuku nkeera, “Chikhalhe mithuko uchulhu, chimwalhie ni umwalhaaniha uthana ni uhiyu, ikhalhe phi iphiro yo uchuwelhiha ikatema, nlhalha, mahuku ni iyaakha, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />chikhalhe mithuko chinopharelha uchulhu wiirimu, chimwalhelhe ilhapo.” Nkayeeria chiicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Paahi Nlhuku nkoupa mithuko miilhi chulhupalhe, yaani nchuwa no utawara uthana ni mweeri wo utawara uhiyu, tho, nkoupa ni ittotwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Nkeesha mithuko chiyo wiirimu wiira chimwalhelhe ilhapo, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />chitaware uthana ni uhiyu, nkamwalhaaniha waaria ni ipiphi. Nlhuku nkoona wiira vahorera. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Nkaweelha, nkawaasha, nenno naari nihuku no necheshe.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Tho Nlhuku nkeera, “Maashi achareke makosho o cho wuupiya chikumi, ni ashinuni achareke wiirimu.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Paahi Nlhuku nkoupa ashinama olhupalhe chinene o ubaharini onkhaye, ni kila nikosho ninokhalha mmaashini ni kila nikosho no ashinuni. Nlhuku nkoona wiira vahorera. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Nlhuku nkaavahacha ibarakha ashinama onkhaye o mmaashini eeraka, “Mwayaraanacheke, mwonchererieke, mwachare mbaharini, ni ashinuni oncheriacheke velhaponi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Nkaweelha, nkawaasha, nenno naari nihuku no nethanu.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Tho Nlhuku nkeera, “Ilhapo ichare kila nikosho no cho wuupiya chikumi cho kila nikosho, ashinama o uhuwiya, ashimweettu o wiipurulha ni ashinama o mwiithuphini o kila nikosho.” Nkayeeria chiicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Paahi Nlhuku nkoupacha makosho onkhaye o ashinama o mwiithuphini, o uhuwiya o kila nikosho, ni o wiipurulha o kila nikosho. Nlhuku nkoona wiira vahorera.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Chiichammo tho Nlhuku nkeera, “Vano nimuupeke ntu, o ulhikaana ni hii, o ikhove ihu, ataware ihopa cho mbaharini, ashinuni o wiirimu, ashinama o velhaponi onkhaye ni ashimweettu o wiipurulha onkhaye.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Paahi Nlhuku ahomwuupa ntu wo ulhikaana ni mwanene Nlhuku. Eiyo, wo ulhikaana ni mwanene Nlhuku, ahomuupa ntu. Ahoupa nlhopwana ni nthiyana. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Nlhuku nkaavahacha ibarakha ni weerelha, “Mwayaraaneke munchererieke, mwacharihe ilhapo ni utawara kila ittu. Kinouvahani ikuru yo utawara ihopa ni ashinuni ni ashinama onkhaye arii velhaponi.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Yamalheke vavawo, Nlhuku nkeerelhacha, “Kinouvahani kila nikosho no ntepo ninemma ni kila mwiri unoyara maphepu o imbeyu, wiira imbeyu chiyo ama maphepu aya ayo akhalheke phi yolhia inyu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Nansho ashinama onkhaye o velhaponi ni ashinuni onkhaye ni ashimweettu aneepurulha, eiyo, kila yowuupiya ikumi kihaavaha manyashi ni mathaakhuru aya o ulhia.” Nkayeeria chiicho. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Nlhuku nkaaweha chittu chonkhaye chuupilhe awe, nkoona chihokhalha chorera chinene. Nkaweelha, nkawaasha, nenno nihuku no sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Paahi wuupiya wo irimu, ilhapo ni chittu chonkhaye phi enre aya wo utimira. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Nihuku no saba Nlhuku aheettuwa baada yo umalhiha ntheko wonkhaye waapanga awe. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Nlhuku nkaahelha ibarakha nenno nihuku no saba nno ukhalha nihuku nitakatifu, ukhalhawaya nenno nihuku nno aheettuwa ntheko wo wuupa waapanga awe. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Phi chiichammo etu irimu ni ilhapo chenre aya wo wuupiya.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 2:4">Imata yo Adeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Apwiiya Nlhuku voupilhe aya irimu ni ilhapo, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />khawaariwo ntepo uriyoothe mena imbeyu yaamenlhe ukhalhawaya aari ahinarupelha ipulha, mena khaariwo ntu o ulhima velhaponi, <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />nansho maashi nkayaakhuma vattayani nkayaatapwiha ilhapo yonkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaamupa ntu nlhopwana wo ntukurukhu no vattayani, nkayammuchelhelha iphumu yo ukumi mphulhani mwawe ni ntu nlhopwana uyo nkaakhalha nkumi.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Tho Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeesha imata yo Adeni, nthelha unosha nchuwa ni mwommo nkayaamweesha ntu nlhopwana aamupilhe aya uyo. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaamelhiha vattayani makosho onkhaye o mitepo chorera mmiithoni ni wimmiha maphepu orera ulhia. Variyari imata vawo ahomelhiha mwiri wo maphepu anowiiha ukumi, ni mwiri unommaha ntu irusho cho uchuwelha chittu choombone ni chittu cho uhilhokalhoka.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Mwolhoko wo maashi wahophatuwa nkawaakhoolha mmatani Uadeni, nkawaamichera imata iyo, uthama wowo waheemianiha miolhoko micheshe. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Mwolhoko wo upachera weehaniya Pishoni, unorukureriacha ilhapo yo Uhavira, urii idhahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Idhahabu yo wowo yorera chinene. Tho, wowo phi nophwanyiya makhura o nukhelha aneehaniya bedola ni malhuku o upharelha aneehaniya shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Mwolhoko wo nayelhi uneehaniya Gihoni, unokhoolha ilhapo yo Ukushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Mwolhoko wo neraru phi Tigrisi, unokhoolha nthelha unosha nchuwa ilhapo yo Uashuru, ni wo necheshe phi Yufrati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Paahi amalhihekeru, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahomweesha ntu uyo umatani Uadeni, wiira alhime ni ushunga imata. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaamwiirelha ntu, “Unowooria ulhia maphepu o mwiri uriyoothe uri mmatani, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />nansho uhilhie maphepu o mwiri wo variyari ummwiiha irusho cho uchuwelhiha chittu choombone ni chittu cho uhilhokalhoka. Walhiakaru, wo ikekhiaye unookhwa nenno nihuku.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Kaanyuma, Apwiiya Nlhuku aheera, “Khavalhonke unhiya ntu ulha vekha awe. Paahi etu kinomuupa nkhunanawe o unkaviha, o umphwanelha.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakusha ittaya, nkoopacha ashinama onkhaye o mwiithuphini ni ashinuni onkhaye anovavacha uchulhu. Nkaawiihacha wa ntu oone chinohalha awe waavaha machina, kila mwannama nkaavahiya nchina nawe. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Paahi ntu nkaavahacha machina ashinama onkhaye o uhuwiya ni o mwiithuphini, vamoka ni ashinuni onkhaye, nansho inakhalhaka chiicho khaariwo nkhunanawe o umphwanelha.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayanhelha ntu ulhe ikhove yo uhichuwelha ittu, nkaarupa. Ni vavawo vaarumpe awe vawo, Nlhuku ahotholholha niparari nimoka na ntu uyo, nkaakhunelha ithayi tho vakittu vawo. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaamuupa nthiyana ukhuma nnipararini ni ummwiiha wa nlhopwana. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Paahi ntu nkeera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Wo ikekhiaye, vano etu ulha phi nokiphwanelha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">nikhuva nikushiye mmakhuvani mwaka, ni iruttu ikhumme mwiiruttuni mwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">‘Nthiyana’ phi nchina nawe ukhalhawaya oupiye ukhuma wa nlhopwana.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Phi nlhatu etu no nlhopwana waahiya athumwanawe ni anumwanawe, ni ulhutaana ni ahanu awe ni ukhalha iruttu imoka.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Nlhopwana ni nthiyana o yelhi aari pwithipwithi, nansho khayoonne ishoni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uwonya wa attu o upacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Vavawo inwaa yaari phi mwannama o upenya waapwaha ashinama onkhaye o mwiithuphini oupiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Paahi inwaa nkayankoha nthiyana, “Eti Nlhuku heera wiira nhilhie niphepu niriyoothe mmatani mu?” <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Nthiyana nkaakhulha, “Niirelhiye wiira nilhieke maphepu o mwiri uriyoothe urii mmatani, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />nansho Nlhuku enre, ‘Nhilhie niphepu no mwiri wo variyari, mena nhaatamerie mwiri uyo, mwalhiakaru, nnookhwa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Inwaa nkayamwaakhulha nthiyana, “Woothiya, khannokhwa mena! <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Nlhuku enre chiicho ukhalhawaya hochuwelha wiira mwalhiakaru tu nnoopatakulhiya miitho inyu, nnothathuwa ukhalha thoko Nlhuku, nnoochuwelha phivi iri yoombone ni phivi ihinolhoka.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Paahi nthiyana vonne awe wiira mwiri uyo waari worera ulhiya, worera mmiithoni, ni worera upatta irusho, ahorukulha niphepu naya nkhaalhia, nkaavaha owannyawe ni ayo nkayaalhia. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Vaalhilhie aya tu, miitho aya ahopatakuwa nkayaachuwelha wiira aari pwithipwithi, paahi nkayaatotta mathaakhuru o mwiri wo nkhuyu nkayaawara nnyununi, nkayeetiyelhelhacha.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Uchechilho, Apwiiya Nlhuku veetakachaka aya mmatani, ntu uyo ni ahanu awe yaheewa ikhito, nkayeevithacha mmaphumbulhuni, wiira Nlhuku hoone. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku ahomwiihana nlhopwana, “Ana nri vayi?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Kihowiiwani veetakacha inyu mmatani, ni mii nkakoova nkakeevitha, ukhalhawaya kaari pwithipwithi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Nlhuku nkaakoha, “Apani owirenlheni wiira nri pwithipwithi? Chani nholhia niphepu no mwiri koochichinheakani wiira nhilhie?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Nlhopwana uyo nkaakhulha, “Nthiyana nkivahilhe inyu wiira kinkhalhane uyo phi kivanhe niphepu ni mii nkakaalhia.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayankoha nthiyana, “Mpanngeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Nthiyana nkaakhulha, “Inwaa phi kithepianche ni mii nkakaalhia.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku noohimiacha ntwarusho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkeerelha inwaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">“Ukhalhawaya uhopanga chiicho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">Kihoulhava uwe waapwaha ashinama onkhaye o uhuwiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ni waapwaha ashinama onkhaye o mwiithuphini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">Unoweeta wo wiipurulha wo nthunkwa nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ni ulhia ntukurukhu ukumi awo wonkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha inwaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">Kinoweesha umalhaponi variyari awo ni nthiyana uyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">variyari iyari awo ni iyari awe, nnoowa mwaavenganacha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">Iyari yo nthiyana iyo inowa uunyakatha muru awo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">ni uwe unoowa wanlhuma ikotokotto.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Tho Nlhuku nkaamwiirelha nthiyana uyo, “Kinowuncherera uweria wo nkuri ikatema awo yo uyara, unowa waayara wo uweria chinene. Inakhalhaka chiicho, unookhalha ni nrima wo waattuna owannyao, ni ayo anoutawara.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Nkaamwiirelha nlhopwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">“Ukhalhawaya uhewelhelha ahanu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">nkawaalhia niphepu kenre aka wiira nhilhie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">paahi etu, kiholhava ittaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">wo nlhatu wao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">Unoopanga ntheko wo machiri wiira upatte yolhia awo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">ulhokelha wao wonkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Ittaya inoomelha miiwa ni mahichi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">ni uwe unoolhia mikoko cho mmatani.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Unohalha upatta yolhia awo wo ukhuma ntukutta nao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">mpaka nihuku no uwuhelhiya muntukurukhuni ukhumme awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">ukhalhawaya uwe ukhumme muntukurukhuni, muntukurukhuni unoohokolhia.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu nkammaha nchina nhanu awe, nkaamwiihana Hawa, maana aya “ukumi,” ukhalhawaya phi anumwanaya attu onkhaye ayariye. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakorosha ikuwo cho marapalha a ashinama, waatottelha Adamu ni ahanu awe, nkaawarihacha.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu ni Ahawa anowoomolhiya umatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, “Vano ntu ri thoko hii, hochuwelha vano phivi iri yoombone ni phivi ihinolhoka. Hihiyereriye ukusha niphepu no mwiri wo ukumi wiira alhie, ukhalhawaya alhiaka, noolhokelha wo uhikhwa wo mahuku o uhimalha.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Paahi etu Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayoomolhacha umatani Uadeni, nkanrweeha Adamu arwee alhime nttayani mwaakhumme awe. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Baada yo woomolhacha, Apwiiya Nlhuku aheeshacha makerubi unosha nchuwa, umatani Uadeni, yaavarenlhe uphanga wo mooro waarukunuwa uno ni uno, o ulhitelhelha iphiro yo ukelha urii mwiri wo ukumi.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kaini ni Habilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Paahi Adamu nkaayaarupa ni ahanu aya Ahawa, ni ayo nkayaarupalha irukulhu, nkayannyara Kaini. Ahawa nkayeera, “Wo ukaviheriya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, kihompatta mwaana mwanlhopwana.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Tho ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana nkina amwiihanne aya Habilu. Habilu aari ntu o uhuwa ikhondoro, uno Kaini aari ntu o ulhima. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Baada yo uvira mahuku, Kaini ahokusha mahalhahalha o choolhia chaaruwenrie awe umatani, urweeha isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Habilu ni uyo nkaawiha isadaka yo mattara o ikhondoro chawe ni inama yo ununa. Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayanrumelhelha Habilu ni isadaka awe, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />nansho isadaka ya Kaini khayarumelhelhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Kaini nkaathunalha chinene. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaamwiirelha Kaini, “Unothunalhani? Unottukani wiitho? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Chani wakaakivanhe ittu yoombone, khawathaathelha? Nansho ukhalhawaya uhopanga ittu yo unanara, uwonya wao unowiithelha vanlhakoni wao, unothanana uwulhusha. Nansho ni uwe unothananiya wiira ukottolheke.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Paahi etu baada yo vavawo, Kaini ahomwiirelha nhima awe, “Nngwee umatani.” Vaari aya umatani uwo, Kaini ahonthuphelha nhima awe nkaamwiiva.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayankoha Kaini, “Nhima awo Habilu ri vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kaini nkaakhulha, “Akichuwenlhe mii. Chani kwaani phi mii kinommwehaweha nhima aka?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, “Upanngeni? Iphome yo mwanhima awo inookunlhelha ukhuma vattayani, thoko nlhove ninonlhelha malhivo o uhokolhoshera. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Vano kihoulhava uwe, khunooria mena tho ulhima ittaya. Ukhalhawaya ittaya ihaathama thoko malhaku, ihowuria iphome awe vaamwiivilhe inyu. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Walhimaka, khunowa waaruweria ittu. Unowa ukhalha ntu o uthemwathemwa, hirini mapuro velhaponi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini nkaakhulha Apwiiya Nlhuku, “Nenna ntwarusho nna, niri nolhemelha kihinooriaka uchisha. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Lhelho, nhokoomolha velhaponi ni ukoomolha umihoolho winyu. Kihokhalha ntu hiri ni mapuro velhaponi ni ntu riyoothe nohalha ukoona, nookiiva.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha, “Mena! Ntu riyoothe nohalha uwiiva, nootwarushiya mikwaha saba, uupwaha uwe.” Paahi etu Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayanttuma Kaini inepo vayuchi, wooniha wiira ntu riyoothe nohalha unkumaana himwiive. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Kaini nkaathama vaari aya Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaarwaa uukhalhani ilhapo yo Unodi, unosha nchuwa imata yo Adeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyari ya Nakaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Nakaini nkayaarupa ni ahanu aya nkayampatta mwaana mwanlhopwana amwihanne aya Enoko. Nakaini nkayaachokholha utheka iwani yeehanne aya wo nchina no mwaamwanaya uyo. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Naenoko nkayannyara Yiradi, ni Yiradi nkannyara Mehuyaeli. Mehuyaeli ahonnyara Methushaeli, ni Methushaeli uyo ahonnyara Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Nalameki nkaaveka manyoopaani elhi, Aida ni Azila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Aida ahaayara Nayaabali, yayo phi athumwanaya attu onkhaye anohuwa mihuwo ni ukhalha mmahemani. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Ahima aya Nayaabali aari Nayubali, athumwanaya attu onkhaye anomoopa chikwesha ni attu anomoopa mpeta. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Azila ahaayara Natubali Kaini, aari ntu o chipara, aahana kila nikosho no ikaruma cho shaba ni iyuuma. Arokoraya Natubali yaari Nanaama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Nalameki nkeerelhacha manyaahanu aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Aida ni Azila nkakiiweni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">mwaatti manyaahanu a Nalameki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Kihomwiiva ntu wo nlhatu no ukirakalhiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Eiyo, kihomwiiva mmirawo wo nlhatu no ukithuria.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Nakaini alhiviheriyaka mikwaha saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">wo ikekhiaye Nalameki anolhiviheriya mikwaha makhumi saba ni saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naseti ni Naenoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu nkayaarupa tho ni ahanu aya Ahawa. Ahawa nkayampatta mwaana mwanlhopwana nkina nkayammaha nchina nawe Seti. Paahi nkayeera, “Nlhuku hokivaha mwaana nkina o ulhivelhelhiha vakittu va Habilu eeviye ni Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Naseti nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana yammanhe aya nchina Enoshi. Vavawo attu phi achokhonlhe aya ulhapelha wo uromolha nchina na Apwiiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Iyari ya Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Alha phi machina o iyari ya Adamu. Ikatema Nlhuku vaamupilhe awe ntu, aamupilhe wo ulhikaana ni Nlhuku mwanene. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Oupilhe nlhopwana ni nthiyana, nkaavaha ibarakha, ni weehana “Attu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu vaari aya ntu o iyaakha mia ni makhumi mararu, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana alhikanne aya, nkaamwiihana nchina nawe Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Baada yo unnyara Seti, Adamu nkayaakhalha iyaakha chikina mia nane, nkayaapatta achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adamu nkayaakhwa anari ni iyaakha mia tisa ni makhumi mararu.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Naseti vaari aya ni iyaakha mia ni nthanu, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, Enoshi, <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha mia nane ni saba. Nkaayaracha achishaana ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha mia tisa khumi na mbili, nkayaarimelha.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Naenoshi vaari aya ni iyaakha tisaini, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, Kenani, <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha chikina mia nane ni khumi na tano. Nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha mia tisa ni nthanu, nkayaarimelha.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Nakenani vaari aya ni iyaakha sabini, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, Mahalaleli, <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha chikina mia nane arubaini. Nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha mia tisa ni khumi, nkayaarimelha.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Namahalaleli vaari aya ni iyaakha sitini ni nthanu, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, Yaredi, <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha chikina mia nane ni makhumi mararu. Nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha mia nane tisaini ni nthanu, nkayaarimelha.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Nayaredi vaapihilhe aya iyaakha imia imoka ni sitini ni mbili, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, Enoko, <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha chikina mia nane. Nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha mia tisa sitini na mbili, nkayaarimelha.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Naenoko vaari aya ni iyaakha sitini ni nthanu ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Yamalheke vavawo, Naenoko ahokhalha makhalhelho oombone ni unteelhiha Nlhuku. Baada yo unnyara Metusela, aholhokelha iyaakha imia ttarua nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Naenoko nkayaalhokelha iyaakha mia tatu sitini ni nthanu. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Ukumi waya wonkhaye Naenoko ahokhalha makhalhelho oombone ni unteelhiha Nlhuku. Nkayaapotera wo uhoonia, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ahaakusha.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Nametusela vaari aya ni iyaakha imia imoka ni themanini ni saba, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, Lameki, <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />nkayaalhokelha iyaakha chikina mia saba themanini na mbili, nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Nkayaarimelha vaari aya ni iyaakha mia tisa sitini ni tisa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Nalameki vaari aya ni iyaakha imia imoka ni themanini na mbili, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />nkayammaha nchina nawe Nuhu, yeeraka, “Ukhuma vattayani mwaalhaviye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, ulha mwaana ulha noniwiihera mpuha wo unittuwiha ntheko ihu mulhupalhe.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Nalameki nkayaalhokelha iyaakha imia nthanu tisaini ni nthanu. Nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Nkayaarimelha vaari aya ni iyaakha mia saba sabini ni saba.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Anuhu vaari aya ni iyaakha imia nthanu, ahaayaracha achishaana araru, Shemu, Hamu ni Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Uwonya wa attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Attu vaachokholha aya wunchereria velhaponi ni achishaana ashithiyana ayaariachaka, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />ashaana ashilhopwana o wiirimu yahoona wiira yayo achishaana ashithiyana ayo aari oreracha, nkaayaakushacha alhe yaattuna aya ukhalha manyaahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, “Akinaahiyerera attu wiira alhokelhe wo mahuku o uhimalha, ukhalhawaya ari o ukhwa. Paahi khanolhokelha ukumi umpwaha iyaakha mia imoka ni makhumi melhi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Yayo mahuku ayo, tho ni upwaha vavawo, ahokhalhacha attu o machusha molhupalhe chinene velhaponi, yeehaniya Anefili. Yaari iyari yo minepa o wiirimu ni manyaathiyana o velhaponi. Yayo phi aari attu o machiri, aashipiya mahuku menchi avinre ayo.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Apwiiya Nlhuku vonne aya attu o velhaponi cheera aya wo uwonya ni chittu chinoopuwelha aya chikhalhaka cho uhilhoka mahuku onkhaye, <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />ahochukulha munrimani chinene oonaka mbaya ahikoopilhe velhaponi va. Nkayeera, <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />“Kinowaalhakalhiha attu koupilhe aka ukhuma velhaponi va, kinowaakukhulhacha attu vamoka ni ashinama, ashimweettu aneeta wo wiipurulha ni ashinuni o wiirimu. Ukhalhawaya kihochukulha wiira mbaya kihikoupilhe.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Nansho Anuhu ahorumelhelhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anuhu anokoorosha isafina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ulha phi mwaha unaacha Anuhu, ntu aatelhinhe Apwiiya Nlhuku, ntu o uhikhuwachiya o vekha awe o yayo mahuku ayo, tho aari ntu anthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Anuhu yaari ni achishaana araru ashilhopwana, Nashemu ni Nahamu ni Nayafeti. Anuhu aari ntu o uhinanarihiya ni uwonya uriwoothe o yayo mahuku ayo. Aari analhutanne ni Nlhuku <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />nansho attu akina ayo aari o uwonya umihoolho wa Nlhuku ni uhilhoka waari unawanenlhe mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Nlhuku ahoona ilhapo chenre aya wo unanara, attu awonyaka vahinlhoka.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Nlhuku nkeerelha Anuhu, “Kiholhakelha waamalhiha attu ni iyari aya yonkhaye, ukhalhawaya ilhapo ihochara mitheko cho injarare yo unanara chinopangacha aya. Eiyo, kinowaamalhamalhiha vamoka ni ilhapo. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Nkoorosheke etu isafina yo miri cho mpande. Mwommo nthekeke ichuumba ni uhikahika ilami wo nhina ni vathe. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Yunnuweke imeta imia imoka ni makhumi mararu ni tisa, ikhanuweke imeta makhumi melhi ni nthanu, irekameke imeta khumi ni nthanu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Ikhalheke yo igorofa ttaaru ni nlhako vathetho. Nkoorosheke nivatho, nihiyaneke iinchi khumi ni nane nivatho ni iruttu yo isafina inene iyo. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Kinoowiha niwambwe velhaponi no wiiva kila ittu iri ikumi. Kila ittu iri ikumi velhaponi va inookhwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Nansho kinowa keesha malhehano ni inyuva. Nkelheke nsafinani mmo inyuva mwaanene ni ahanu inyu ni achishaana inyu ni manyaahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Nsafinani mmo, mwaakusheke ashinama kila nikosho, elhi elhi, alhopwana ni athiyana, mwaashunge akhalhe akumi vamoka ni inyu.”<verse eid="GEN 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />“Mwaakusheke ashinuni o kila nikosho, ashinama o kila nikosho ni ashimweettu o wiipurulha o kila nikosho, elhi elhi, alhopwana ni ashithiyana, mwaashunge akhalhe akumi vamoka ni inyu. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Tho nkusheke ni kila nikosho no choolhia chinolhiya, nshungeke. Choolhia cho ulhia mwaanene ni cho waalhiha ashinama ayo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Anuhu nkayaapanga kila ittu thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Nlhuku.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Niwambwe ninookhumelhelha velhaponi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Anuhu wiira, “Nkelheke nsafinani ni iwani inyu yonkhaye, ukhalhawaya munlhokoni mwa attu onkhaye arii velhaponi va, inyu vekha inyu phi nopanga moorera. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Mwaakusheke ashinama anolhoka ukumihiya isadaka o kila nikosho, nthiyana ni nlhopwana saba saba. Nansho ahinolhoka ukumihiya isadaka ayo mwaakusheke elhi elhi, nthiyana ni nlhopwana o kila nikosho. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Tho mwaakusheke ashinuni nlhopwana ni nthiyana o kila nikosho saba saba. Mpangeke chiicho wiira mwaashungehe akhalhe akumi velhaponi va. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Ukhalhawaya aviraka mahuku saba uchokholha lhelho va, kinowa kaarupiha ipulha mahuku makhumi macheshe wo uhitondova uthana ni uhiyu, kilhakalhihe ittu ikumi kuupilhe aka.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Anuhu nkayaapanga kila ittu thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Anuhu aari ntu o malhipa o iyaakha mia sita niwambwe vaakhumelhenlhe aya velhaponi va. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Anuhu anene vamoka ni ahanu aya ni achishaana aya ni manyaahanu aya yahokelhacha nsafinani wiichookholha niwambwe. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Tho ashinama anolhoka ukumihiya isadaka ni ahinolhoka ukumihiya isadaka ni ashinuni ni ashimweettu o wiipurulha, o kila nikosho, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />ahokushachiya nsafinani mwa Anuhu, elhi elhi thoko Nlhuku chaalhehenre awe. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Mahuku saba avireke, maashi o niwambwe nkayaawa velhaponi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Anuhu vaari aya ni iyaakha imia sita, nihuku no khumi ni saba no mweeri wo nayelhi, nenno nihuku nno, milhiwi chonkhaye cho maashi o wuuthi ilhapo chahotiuwa, irimu nkayaattukuwa, <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />ipulha nkayaarupa velhaponi wo mahuku makhumi macheshe, uthana ni uhiyu. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Nenno nihuku vaarupa aya ipulha nno, Anuhu ni ahanu aya ni achishaana aya araru Nashemu, Nahamu ni Ayafeti ni manyaahanu aya, yahokelha nsafinani. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Ahokelha ashinene ayo vamoka ni kila nikosho no ashinama anohuwiya ni o mwiithuphini, ashimweettu o wiipurulha ni ashinuni o kila nikosho. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />O wuupiya elhi elhi o kila nikosho aari ni iphumu yo ukumi, ahokelha nsafinani mwa Anuhu, <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />nlhopwana ni nthiyana thoko Nlhuku chaalhehenre awe Anuhu. Apwiiya nkayaattia nlhako wo isafina Anuhu vaakenlhe aya.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Niwambwe nkanaalhokelha mahuku makhumi macheshe ni maashi nkaachara ni uphembiha isafina vachulhu maashi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Maashi nkaathepa uchara chinene velhaponi, isafina nkayaaphemba vachulhu chinene. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Maashi ayo aari menchi chinene velhaponi, nkayaakhuneelha miako cho urekama chonkhaye cho velhaponi va, <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />eiyo, mpaka vachulhu miako, imeta saba ni nusu vachulhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Kila ittu ikumi velhaponi va yahokhwa. Ashinuni, ashinama o uhuwiya, ashinama o mwiithuphini, kila yo wiipurulha vamoka ni attu onkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Eiyo, kila ittu ikumi vachulhu ilhapo va yahokhwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Apwiiya yaheeva kila ittu ikumi vachulhu ilhapo, attu ni ashinama ni ashinuni. Aahanlhe aari Anuhu ni onkhaye aari vamoka ni ayo nsafinani. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Maashi ayo ahoolhokelha wo uhiwelhelha, wo mahuku imia imoka ni makhumi nthanu.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Utondova wo niwambwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Yamalheke, Nlhuku ahoopuwelha Anuhu ni ashinama onkhaye o mwiithuphini ni o uhuwiya yaakushilhe aya nsafinani. Nkaawukiha iphioo, maashi nkaachokholha uwelhelha. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Vavawo, milhiwi cho maashi cho wuuthi ilhapo ni irimu chahottukiya. Ipulha nkayaamaalhihiya, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />maashi nkaawukuwa vakani vakani velhaponi. Avireke mahuku imia imoka ni makhumi nthanu, maashi nkaawukuwa chinene. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Nihuku no khumi ni saba mweri wo saba isafina nkayeemelha vachulhu mwaako wo Ararati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Maashi nkaathepa uwelhelha chinene mpaka mweri wo khumi, ni nihuku no upacha no mweri wo khumi, miako chahochokholha woonia vachulhu.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Avireke mahuku makhumi macheshe, Anuhu ahohulha ndirisha naatemunlhe aya vasafinani, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />nkayankumiha nakhuku vathe, ni uyo vaavanve awe khaahokolhelhe, nansho aari avavaka uwo ni uwo mpaka maashi vaawelhenlhe aya vachulhu ilhapo. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Anuhu nkayaakumiha ikhunda wiira achuwelhe yakhalhaka maashi ahowelhelha velhaponi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Nansho ukhalhawaya maashi aari bado anakhunenlhe ilhapo yonkhaye, ikhunda ilhe khayaakorenlhe vakittu, nkayaahokolhia wa Anuhu nsafinani. Anuhu nkayaakumiha moono nkayaavara ni uhokolhosha nsafinani. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Anuhu nkayaaweherera mahuku saba makina, nkaavaviha tho ikhunda ilhe. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Nkayaahokolhia uchechilho inalhumme nthakhuru nikithi no mwiri wo izeituni umalhakuni. Anuhu nkayaachuwelha wiira, maashi ahowukuwa velhaponi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Nkayaaweherera wo mahuku makina saba, nkaavaviha tho ikhunda ilhe, nansho ulha nkwaha ulha khayaahokolhelhe tho.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Anuhu vaari aya o iyaakha mia sita ni iyaakha imoka, nihuku no upacha no mweri wo upacha, maashi aari anawelhenlhe vachulhu ilhapo. Anuhu nkayaapatakulha nlhako wo vachulhu isafina, vaawenhe aya, nkayoona wiira ilhapo ihooma. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Nihuku no makhumi melhi ni saba no mweri wo nayelhi, ilhapo aari inoomilhe kabisaa.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Vavawo Nlhuku nkeerelha Anuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Nkhumeke nsafinani mmo vamoka ni ahanu inyu ni achishaana inyu ni manyaahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Mwaakumiheke ni ashinama onkhaye akumi arii vamoka ni inyu ayo, ashinuni ni ashinama ni kila ikumi ineepurulha, chirwee chayaraanache chinene velhaponi, chonchererie ni uwanelha mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Paahi Anuhu nkayaakhuma nsafinani vamoka ni ahanu aya ni achishaana aya ni manyaahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Ashinama onkhaye ni ashinuni nkayaakhuma anari mmakoshoni mwaya, ashinama onkhaye o mwiithuphini, ashinama aneepurulha, ashinuni onkhaye ni ashinama onkhaye akumi o velhaponi.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anuhu anowaavaha Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Anuhu nkayaathatha malhuku nkayaathekelha madhubahu Apwiiya, nkayankusha mwanamma mmoka mmoka wo kila nikosho no ashinama ni ashinuni anolhoka ukumihiya isadaka, nkaapaha onkhaye ikhalhe isadaka yo upahiya vamadhubahuni. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Vaapaha aya isadaka vawo, nihiriri no unukhelha no isadaka iyo, nahaateelhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkayeecherelha, “Mena, akinowa kaalhava ilhapo tho wo nlhatu no uwonya wa ntu, kihochuwelha wiira irusho chawe chiri cho uwonya toka vanoyaria awe. Ni wala akinowa kaalhakalhiha tho chittu chikumi chonkhaye, thoko chinre aka chi. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Ilhapo chinohalha aya ulhokelha, nlhalha wo waalha imbeyu ni ukhungura, wo ntukutta ni wo uririya, iyiitha ni ilhimwe, uthana ni uhiyu, khachinowa chaamalha.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku noweesha malhehano ni Anuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Nlhuku nkaavaha ibarakha Anuhu ni achishaana aya, eerelhaka, “Mwayaraaneke, munchereriane, nchareke velhaponi. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Ashinama onkhaye o velhaponi, ashinuni onkhaye o wiirimu, kila mwannama neepurulha ni ihopa chonkhaye, ari mmathathani mwinyu, ni ayo anoowa yoowovani. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Kila ittu ikumi ineeta phi yolhia inyu. Thoko chenre aka wo uvahani mitepo, vano etu kinouvahani kila ittu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Nansho mena nhikhure inama ihikhumme iphome, Kinouchiichihani ukhalhawaya ukumi uri mphomeni. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Ntu nomwiiva ntu nanawe, noowa aatwarushiya. Mwannama riyoothe nohalha umwiiva ntu, kinomwiiva. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Paahi etu ntu riyoothe nomwiiva ntu nkina, ni uyo nowiiviya ni ntu nkina. Ukhalhawaya ntu oupiye wo ulhikaana ni Nlhuku mwanene.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Nnyaraaneke, munchererieke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:7">nnyaraaneke chinene, munchererieke mwiilhaponi mu.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nikhwii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Yamalhekeru, Nlhuku nkeerelha Anuhu ni achishaana aya wiira, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Kinoweesha malhehano aka ni inyu ni iyari inyu inowa <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ni cho wuupiya chikumi chonkhaye, ni ashinuni ni ashinama o uhuwiya ni o mwiithuphini onkhaye aakhumme nsafinani vamoka ni inyu. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Kinoopanga malhehano aka ni inyu wiira, mena cho wuupiya chonkhaye khachinowa cheeviya ni niwambwe, mena khinowa yaakhumelhelha tho niwambwe no ulhakalhiha ilhapo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Tho, Nlhuku aheera, “Nna phi nthonyero no malhehano anopanga aka variyari ihu ni kila yo wuupiya irii ikumi vamoka ni inyu mwaatti, ni wo iyari chinyu chinowa chonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Kiheesha nikhwii naka umahuteni ninohalha ukhalha phi nthonyero no malhehano variyari aka ni ilhapo. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Kila vanohalha aka ukhunelha mahute vachulhu ilhapo, ni nikhwii nno nooniaka umahuteni, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />kinoowa koopuwelha malhehano kipangilhe aka ni inyu mwaatti ni cho wuupiya chikumi chonkhaye. Mena maashi khanowa aakhalha tho niwambwe no wiivakacha cho wuupiya chikumi chonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Nikhwii nno vanohalha aya ukhumelhelha umahuteni, kinoowa koona, ni wuupuwelha malhehano aka o mahuku o uhimalha variyari aka ni cho wuupiya chikumi chonkhaye velhaponi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Nlhuku nkeerelha Anuhu, “Nna phi nthonyero no malhehano kipangilhe aka ni cho wuupiya chikumi chonkhaye cho velhaponi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Achishaana a Anuhu yaakhumme nsafinani aari, Nashemu ni Nahamu ni Nayafethi. Nahamu phi ari athumwanaya Nakanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Yayo phi achishaana araru a Anuhu aayanre attu awanenlhe velhaponi wonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Anuhu phi ari anamalhima o upacha waalha izabibu. Umatani waya yaanlhe mirayi cho izabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Nihuku nimoka ahowuria idivai yo uchasha nkayaahapalhiya, nkayaarupa pwithipwithi nnihemani mwaya. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Nahamu athumwanaya Nakanaani yahoona iruttu ya athumwanaya anari pwithipwithi, nkayaakhuma vathe ni waahimiachera manyonnaya elhi alhe. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Nansho Nashemu ni Nayafeti yahokusha ishuka, nkayeekhunelhacha mmakhathani mwaya, nkayaarwaa utulhitulhi ni ukhunelha iruttu ya athumwanaya uno awehaka uchereshere wo uhoona athumwanaya varupilhe aya pwithipwithi vawo. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Anuhu vonkwilhe aya, uhapalhiya waathameke, ni vaachuwenlhe aya mwaha upangelhiye aya ni mwaamwanaya mwankani uyo, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />yaheera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Alhaviye Kanaani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Yoyo nowa ukhalha ipotta yo ipotta cho waakavihera manyonnawe mitheko.” <verse eid="GEN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Tho nkayeera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">“Shemu, avaheriyeke ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku aka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani akhalheke phi ipotta awe. <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Nlhuku amunnuwihe Yafethi, alhokelheke nnihemani mwa Shemu, Kanaani akhalheke phi ipotta awe.” <verse eid="GEN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Baada yo utondova niwambwe Anuhu ahokhalha iyaakha imia ttaru ni makhumi nthanu, <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />nkayaarimelha vaari aya o iyaakha imia tisa ni makhumi nthanu.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Iyari ya Anuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Baada yo uvira niwambwe, achishaana a Anuhu yaani Nashemu, Nahamu ni Nayafethi ahaayaracha achishaana ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. Alha phi machina aya, <verse eid="GEN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Achishaana a Nayafethi aari, Gomeri, Magogu, Madai, Yavani, Tubali, Meshaki ni Tirasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Achishaana a Nagomeri aari, Ashkenazi, Rifathi ni Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Achishaana a Nayavani aari, Elisha, Tarshishi, Kitimu ni Rodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Alha phi aari machokholhelho a attu awanenlhe ilhapo cho umbwaani, kila attu wo nikosho naya ni wo nihimo naya wo ulhikaana ni moolhumo aya. <verse eid="GEN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Achishaana a Nahamu aari Kushi ni Misri ni Puti ni Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Achishaana a Nakushi aari Seba, Hawila, Sabta, Raama ni Sabteka. Achishaana a Naraama aari Sheba ni Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Nakushi phi athumwanaya Nanimrodi ntu aari okhomaalha chinene o upachera velhaponi va. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Yayo aari phi ntu aapangiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku ukhalha ntu o ulhupatta mulhupalhe, ukhalhaka phi nlhatu no nuulhumo nineera, “Apwiiya Nlhuku opangekeni o ulhupatta mulhupalhe thoko Nimrodi.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Ilhapo chaapachenre awe utawara chaari, Ubabiloni ni Uereki ni Uakadi ni ilhapo yo Ushinari. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Uthama wo wowo, Nanimrodi yaarweelhe Uashuru nkayaatheka iwani cho Uninavi ni Urehobothiri ni Ukaala ni <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />Ureseni iwani irii iriyari yo Uninavi ni iwani yulhupalhe yo Ukaala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Namisri aari phi athumwanaya attu o Uludi ni attu o Uanamu ni attu o Ulehabi ni attu o Unaftuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />attu o Upathrusi ni attu o Ukasluhi, arii phi machokholhelho a Afilisti ni Akaftori. <verse eid="GEN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Nakanaani aari phi athumwanaya Nasidoni, nttara naya, ni Hethi, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />ni tho aari athumwanaya attu o Uyebusi ni Aamori ni attun o Ugirgashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />attu o Uhivi ni attu o Uarki ni attu o Uasini <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />ni attu o Uarvadi ni attu o Usemari ni attu o Uhamathi. Kaanyuma aya attu o nlhoko wo ashi Kanaani yahomwariacha, <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />ata ilhapo aya nkayaawanelha toka Usidoni uweha uchawa mpaka Ugerari, Ugaza ni unosha nchuwa mpaka Usodoma ni Ugomora, Uadma ni Useboimu mpaka Ulaasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Yayo phi aari iyari ya Nahamu wo ulhikaana ni nikosho naya, moolhumo aya, ilhapo chaya ni makosho aya.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Nashemu onnaya Nayafethi aari phi athumwanaya attu o Uebraniya onkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Ashaana a Nashemu aari, Elamu, Ashuru, Arfaksadi, Ludi ni Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Ashaana a Naaramu aari, Usi, Huli, Getheri ni Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Naarfaksadi annyanre Shela. Ni Shela annyanre Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Naeberi aari ni ashaana elhi, o nttara aari Pelegi ukhalhawaya attu aari anamwarelhe velhaponi yeyo ikatema iyo. O nayelhi uyo amwiihanne nchina nawe Yoktani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoktani phi aari athumwanaya ashi Almodadi, Shelefu, Hasarmawethi, Yera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoramu, Uzali, Dikla, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali, Abimaeli, Sheba <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofiri, Hawila ni Yobabu. Yayo onkhaye ayo phi aari ashaana a Yoktani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Ilhapo yaakhanlhe aya yaawanenlhe toka Umesha mpaka Usefari umiakoni nthelha unosha nchuwa uwo. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Yayo phi aari iyari ya Nashemu wo ulhikaana ni iwani chaya, moolhumo aya, ilhapo chaya ni makosho aya. <verse eid="GEN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Yayo phi nlhoko wa Anuhu wo ulhikaana iyari chaya ni makosho aya. Wo ukhuma yayo makosho ayo, makosho onkhaye o velhaponi va, phi enre aya wo uwanelha baada yo utondova niwambwe.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ishanja yo Ubabeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Wo upacha, attu onkhaye velhaponi aari olhumachaka nuulhumo nimoka, olhumachaka malhove o ulhikaana. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Paahi etu attu veetakanche aya toka unosha nchuwa yahophiya ilhapo yo nikoote no Ushinari, nkayaakhalha wowo. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Paahi nkayeerelhana ashineneru, “Haya! Nkangwee etu nikooroshe matofali, nipaheke mooro rata.” Attu aari ni matofali badala yo malhuku, ni ilami badala yo chokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Nkayeeracha, “Ngwee nitheke iwani ni ishanja aya iphiyeke wiirimu wiira nchina nihu nirume, nihiwe naamwaariacha velhaponi wonkhaye.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Phi vavawo Apwiiya Nlhuku vaakhuruwilhe aya vathi uwa uwehani yeyo iwani iyo ni ishanja yaatheka aya attu iyo. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, “Mmweheke, alha attu alha phi o nikosho nimoka ni onkhaye ayo anoolhumacha nuulhumo nimoka, ni ilha phi uchokholha tu wo alhe anowa aya upangacha. Ittu iriyoothe inolhakelha aya, anoowooria upanga. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Haya, ngwee nikhuruwe vathi navirikanihe nuulhumo naya ahiiwanane ashineneru.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Paahi etu Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaamwarushacha velhaponi wonkhaye, ni ayo nkayaahiyacha utheka iwani ilhe. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Iwani iyo nkayeehaniya Babeli maana aya “uvirikaniha,” ukhalhawaya phi wowo Apwiiya Nlhuku waavirikanihilhe aya nuulhumo no ilhapo yonkhaye, nkamwaarushacha attu mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyari ya Nashemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Anottwara alha phi iyari ya Nashemu. Iyaakha piilhi natondovekeru niwambwe nne, Nashemu vaari aya ni iyaakha imia imoka, ahonnyara Arfaksadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Baada yo unnyara Arfaksadi, Nashemu yaholhokelha iyaakha imia nthanu nkayaapatta achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Naarfaksadi vaari aya o iyaakha makhumi mararu ni nthanu ahonnyara Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Baada yo unnyara Shela, Naarfaksadi aholhokelha iyaakha imia ncheshe ni iyaakha ttaru nkayaayara achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Nashela vaari aya ni iyaakha makhumi mararu ahonnyara Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Baada yo unnyara Eberi, Nashela yaholhokelha iyaakha imia ncheshe ni iyaakha ttaru nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Naeberi vaari aya o iyaakha makhumi mararu ni ncheshe, ahonnyara Peregi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Baada yo unnyara Peregi, Naeberi aholhokelha iyaakha imia ncheshe ni makhumi mararu nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Naperegi vaari aya o iyaakha makhumi mararu, ahonnyara Reu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Baada yo unnyara Reu, Naperegi aholhokelha iyaakha imia piilhi ni tisa nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Nareu vaari aya ni iyaakha makhumi mararu ni iyaakha piilhi, ahonnyara Serugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Baada yo unnyara Serugi, Nareu aholhokelha iyaakha imia piilhi ni saba nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Naserugi vaari aya o iyaakha makhumi mararu ahonnyara Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Baada yo unnyara Nahori, Naserugi aholhokelha iyaakha imia piilhi nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nanahori vaari aya o iyaakha makhumi melhi ni tisa, ahonnyara Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Baada yo unnyara Tera, Nanahori aholhokelha iyaakha imia imoka ni khumi ni tisa, nkaayaracha achishaana akina ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Natera vaari aya ni iyaakha makhumi saba, ahonnyara Abramu ni Nahori ni Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyari i Natera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Alha phi achishaana a Natera. O nttara, Abramu, akina aari Nahori ni Harani. Naharani phi aari athumwanaya Nalutu, <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />ni ayo aarimenlhe ikatema Natera, athumwanaya, vaari aya akhalhaka Uuri ilhapo waayarelhe aya. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Naabramu ni Nanahori yahaaveka manyoopani. Ahanu a Naabramu yeeehaniya Sarai ni ahanu a Nanahori yeeehaniya Milka, anaaya Naharani. Naharani ayo tho aari phi athumwanaya Naiska. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Asarai khaaari ni ashaana ukhalhawaya aari o uhiyara.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Natera nkayaakusha Naabramu, anaya, Nalutu uchuulhu aya, yaani anaaya Naharani ni Asarai ahanu a Naabramu, nkayaathamacha vamoka Uuri iwani ya Akaldayo, nkayaarwa ilhapo yo Ukanaani. Nansho vaaphilhe aya Uharani yahokhalha wowo. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Natera aarimenlhe Uharani uwo vaari aya o iyaakha imia piilhi ni nthanu.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku noweehana Naabramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Naabramu, “Nthameke wiilhaponi winyu, mwaahiyeke ashilhoko inyu ni iwani ya athumwaninyu, nrweeke ilhapo inohalha aka uwoonihani. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Kinokoupangani inyuva ukhalha nikosho no attu enchi, kinokouvahani ibarakha ni urumiha nchina ninyu ni inyu nnookhalha ibarakha.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Nohalha uvahani ibarakha, kinommaha ibarakha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">nohalha uulhavani, kinonlhava.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Wo iphiro inyu kinowaavaha ibarakha makosho onkhaye o velhaponi.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Paahi etu, Naabramu yahothama thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chenre aya wo waalhehera, ni Nalutu yahorwaa vamoka ni ayo. Naabramu aari ntu o iyaakha makhumi saba ni nthanu ikatema vaathamme aya Uharani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Naabramu yahaakusha Asarai, ahanu aya, ni Nalutu mwaamwana a ahima aya, ni nhakhu waya wonkhaye ni attu onkhaye yaapantte aya Uharani uwo, nkayaathamacha nkayaarwaa ilhapo yo Ukanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Vaakelha aya ilhapo yo Ukanaani vawo, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Naabramu ahovira iriyari yo ilhapo mpaka Ushekemu, ilhapo itakatifu, vari miri cho More. Yeyo ikatema iyo Akanaani phi aari anenchi o yeyo ilhapo iyo. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Phi vavawo Apwiiya Nlhuku vaakhumelhenlhe aya Naabramu, nkayeerelha, “Iyari inyu phi nohalha aka waavaha ilha ilhapo ilha.” Paahi, Naabramu yahothatha malhuku utheka madhubahu, waathekelha Apwiiya Nlhuku yaakhumelhenlhe. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Kaanyuma aya Naabramu yahothama nkayaarwa umiakoni unosha nchuwa Ubetheli, nkayaatheka nihema variyari, iwani yo Ubetheli nthelha uneelha nchuwa, ni iwani yo Uayi unosha nchuwa. Vavawo tho yahothaha malhuku waathekelha Apwiiya Nlhuku madhubahu ni waalhepelha wo nchina naya. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Yamalhekeru, Naabramu yahothepa urwaa nkwaha aya alhukamaka ilhapo cho Unegebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naabramu Umisri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, ikuruna yahokhuruwa velhaponi. Yeyo ikuruna iyo aari yulhupalhe, paahi etu Naabramu aholhakelha urwaa Umisri ukhalhani wowo wo ikatema vakani. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Vaatameria aya uphiya Umisri, Naabramu yaheerelha ahanu aya, Asarai, “Kihochuwelha inyuva opaani orera ni o uchivelhiha mirima cha attu. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Attu o Umisri vanohalha aya uwoonani vawo, anoowa yeera, ‘Alha phi ahanu aya.’ Anowa ukiiva nansho inyuva khanowa mweeviya. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Paahi etu mweereke wiira, inyuva kanhiwe ahanu aka nansho mwanrokoraka, ni mii chittu chikeetelhe rata, paahi chommo khanowa yaakiva.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Paahi Naabramu vaaphilhe aya Umisri, anenchi o wowo ayo yahoona Asarai wiira aari oopani orera chinene. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Anamitheko a Nafarao vonne aya Asarai, yahaashipa wa Nafarao. Paahi Asarai ahorwehiya unupani wa Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Paahi wo nlhatu wa Asarai, Nafarao ahaapangelha moombone Naabramu, nkayaavaha ikhondoro, ing'ope, iphuta, anamitheko ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana ni ingamiya.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaatwarusha Nafarao ni attu onkhaye o unupani waya wo waahelha mareta o uweria chinene, wo nlhatu no Asarai, ahanu a Naabramu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Nafarao nkayeehana Naabramu, nkayaakoha, “Ama! Phi ittu yaani yelha nkipangenlhe inyu ilha? Chani mbona khamwaakihimenrie wiira Asarai ayo phi ahanu inyu? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Nlhatu waani etu no wiira yayo arokorinyu, ni mii nkakaakusha ukhalha ahanu aka? Paahi etu ahanu inyu ayo vawo, mwaakusheke nrweeke!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Yamalhekeru, Nafarao yahaalhehera anamitheko aya wiira yaavelhelhe Naabramu ni ahanu aya, ni nhakhu waya wonkhaye. Ni ayo yahothama.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Naabramu ni Nalutu unomwalhaaniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Naabramu nkayaahokolhia ukhuma Umisri, nkayaamaka nthelha uneelha nchuwa wo Unegebu. Yaari ni ahanu aya ni nhakhu waya wonkhaye, vamoka ni Nalutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Naabramu aari ntu o nhakhu mwinchi chinene o mihuwo, isiliva ni idhahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Vaathamme aya Unegebu ahothepa weeta nkwaha aya mpaka Ubetheli, nkayaaphiya vakittu vaathenke aya nihema katashi valhe, iriyari yo Ubetheli ni Uayi, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />vakittu vaapachenre aya uthatha malhuku utheka madhubahu. Vavawo Naabramu nkayaalhapelha wo uromolha nchina na Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Tho, Nalutu yaattukanne Naabramu ni ayo yahanaa ikhondoro ni mihuwo chinchi ni maheema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Ihesabu yo mihuwo chaya chiyo aari yulhupalhe chinene, ata ilhapo iyo khayaathonshe Naabramu ni Nalutu wiira ukhalhiye vamoka. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Paahi ashunga a Naabramu ni ashunga a Nalutu yahaanacha indewo. Yeyo ikatema iyo attu o Ukanaani ni attu o Uperizi phi aari anenchi o yeyo ilhapo iyo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Paahi Naabramu nkayeerelha Nalutu, “Uhikhalhe mwaha wo uhiiwanana naashineneru ni mena munlhokoni mwa ashunga aka ni ashunga inyu, ukhalhawaya hii attu o uyaraana. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Mmweheke ilhapo yonkhaye irii uhoolho winyu iyo. Nimwalhaaneke etu. Inyuva mwarwaakaru wiimushi mii kinoorwa wimonono, inyu mwarwaaka wiimonono mii kinoorwa wiimushi.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Nalutu nkayaapathusha miitho aya, nkayoona nikoote nonkhaye no mwolhoko wo Uyorodani, nkayoona wiira naari no maashi menchi kila vakittu thoko imata ya Apwiiya Nlhuku, thoko ilhapo yo Umisri nthelha wo Usoari. Vavawo aari Apwiiya Nlhuku ahinaya ulhakalhiha iwani cho Usodoma ni Ugomora. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Paahi etu Nalutu nkayaathanlha nikoote no mwolhoko wo Uyorodani nonkhaye, nkayaalhukama unosha nchuwa, paahi nkawamwalhaaniya. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Naabramu nkayaahalha Ukanaani ni Nalutu nkayaakhalha waari iwani cho umakoteni, nkayaathamelha Usodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Nansho attu o Usodoma aari attu o uwonya ni attu o upanga chittu cho uhilhoka umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naabramu anowoonihiya ilhapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Baada yo Nalutu umwalhaana ni Naabramu, Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha Naabramu, “Mpathusheke miitho inyu toka vari inyu vawo mmweheke ilhapo yonkhaye, nthelha wo uchulhu ni uchawa, unosha nchuwa ni uneelha nchuwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Kinouvahani inyuva ilhapo yonkhaye inoona inyu iyo, vamoka ni iyari inyu ikhalhe yawinyu mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Kinoowa kaapanga achishaana inyu ukhalha enchi ahinooria waalhakelhiya, thoko chiri aya ntukurukhu no velhaponi chihinooria aya waalhakelhiya. Phi chiichammo etu chinohalha aya ukhalha iyari inyu! <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Paahi etu munkweke, nrweeke mweetakacheke ilhapo ilha yonkhaye, wo makhuvi ni wo urekama, ukhalhawaya phi nohalha aka uvahani inyuva.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Paahi etu Naabramu yahokhulha nihema naya, nkayaarwaa ukhalhani vakhiviru ni miri chulhupalhe cho Mamre, Uhebroni ulhe, wowo nkayaathatha malhuku wathekelha Apwiiya Nlhuku madhubahu.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Naabramu anowookholha Nalutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Ikatema amwene Amrafeli o Ushinari ni amwene Naarioko o Uelasari ni amwene Nakedolaomeri o Uelamu ni amwene Natidali o Ugoiimu vaari aya atawarachaka, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />vamoka yahaatakana ikhoto ni amwene Nabera o Usodoma ni amwene Nabirsha o Ugomora ni amwene Nashinabu o Uadma ni amwene Nashemeberi o Seboimu ni amwene o Ubeela, yaani Usoari. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Yayo manyamwene athanu aromolhiye kaanyuma ayo yaholhutaaniha miphingo chaya unikoote no Usidimu, yaani ibahari yo maakha. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Wo iyaakha khumi ni piilhi chaavinre, aari yeewelhelhaka amwene Nakedolaomeri nansho iyaakha yo khumi ni ttaru yahorukunuwa nkayaakhota utawariya ni ayo. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Vaari aya iyaakha yo khumi ni ncheshe amwene Nakedorlameri ni mamwene ashikhunanaya alhe yahowaacha ni waakottolha attu o Urefaimu, Uashtaroth karnaimu, ni attu o Uzuzi o Uhamu ni attu o Uemi o Ushawe kiriathaimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />ni attu o Uhori umwaakoni waya Useiri uwo, nkayoomolhacha mpaka Uelparani, umwiinano wo uthakoni. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Yamalhihekeru, yahohokolhiacha utulhi mpaka Uenmishpati, yaani Ukadeshi, nkayaavara ilhapo yonkhaye ya Amaaleki ni waakottolha Aamori yaakhalha Uhasason tamari.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Phi vavawo mamwene o Usodoma, o Ugomora, o Uadma, o Useboimu ni o Ubela yaani Usoari, vaarwachilhe aya ni miphingo chaya u nikoote no Usidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />uwaatakanani ikhoto ni mamwene Nakedolaomeri o Uelamu, Natidali o Ugoiimu, Amrafeli o Ushinari ni Naarioko o Uelasari, mamwene acheshe waatakana ni mamwene athanu. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Nikoote no Usidimu naari ninachanre malhikiti o ilami, paahi mamwene o Usodoma ni o Ugomora vaari aya attawaka ikhoto, yahotumbuchiracha mwommo, nansho akina araru ayo yahottawelha umiakoni. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Paahi attu akottonlhe alhe yahovara mateeka nhakhu wonkhaye wa attu o Usodoma ni o Ugomora, tho ni choolhia chaya chonkhaye, nkayaarwaacha. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Nkayaavara mateeka ata Nalutu mwaamwana a nhima aya, Naabramu, yaakhalha Usodoma vamoka ni nhakhu waya, nkayaarwaacha.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Ntu mmoka aakulhupuwilhe ahorwaa uwaahimeriani Naabramu, Muebraniya aakhalha vakhiviru ni miri chulhupalhe cho Mamre, ntu o Uamori ulhe. Mamre aari nhima aya Naeshkoli ni Naaneri. Onkhaye ayo aari attu yaalhutanne ni Naabramu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Naabramu veewilhe aya wiira mwaamwana a nhimaya hokushiya mateeka ni mamwene acheshe alhe, yahokhuma vamoka ni manyaalhopwana o machiri imia ttaru ni khumi ni nane, yaayarelhe wi iwani aya, nkayomolhanihacha mpaka Udani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Uhiyu waphiyeke nkayaamianiha attu aya ayo miphingomiphingo. Nkayaakelhelha amalhaponi ayo ni waakottolha, nkayoomolhacha mpaka Uhooba uchulhu wo ilhapo yo Udameski. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Paahi Naabramu yahookholha nhakhu wonkhaye waavariye mateeka ni amalhaponi ni umwaakiha mwaamwana a nhima aya ni nhakhu awe vamoka ni manyaathiyana ni attu akina yaavarachiye mateeka.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Namelkisedeki anowaavaha ibarakha Naabramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Naabramu vaahokolhelhe aya baada yo waakottolha amwene Nakedorlameri ni ashikhunanaya, amwene o Usodoma ahokhuma urwaa uwekamelhani unikote no Ushawe, yaani nikoote no amwene. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Ni Namelkisedeki, amwene o iwani yo Usalimu, tho akhalhaka opochera ishaani a Nlhuku Mulhupalhe ri uchulhu chinene, yahowiiha nkatte ni idivai, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />nkayaavaha ibarakha Naabramu yiiraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">“Nlhuku Mulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">Upilhe irimu ni ilhapo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">aavahe ibarakha Naabramu! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Ninthimiche Nlhuku Mulhupalhe ri uchulhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:20">okavinheni waanyikalhelha amalhaponi inyu!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Ni ayo Naabramu nkayaavaha Namelkisedeki mpatta wo khumi wo chittu chonkhaye chaarina aya.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Amwene o Usodoma nkayeerelha Naabramu, “Nkivaheke attu ayo, nansho nhakhu wonkhaye uyo mmwieke mwaanene.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Nansho Naabramu nkayeerelha amwene o Usodoma alhe, “Kinoolhupelha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku Mulhupalhe ri uchulhu, oupilhe irimu ni ilhapo, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />wiira akinokusha ittu iriyoothe irii yawinyu inakhalhaka nttoche mena nripwe wo iratu, nhiwe mweera wiira nhokivaha nhakhu. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Paahi etu, akinokusha ittu iriyoothe ihikhalhe ittu yaalhilhie aya ashimirawo aka ni mahalha a attu aari vamoka ni mii, yaani Naaneri, Naeshkoli ni Namamre. Yayo mwaavaheke akusheke.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku noweesha malhehano ni Naabramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Baada yo uvira yoyo mwaha uyo, nlhove na Apwiiya Nlhuku nahaakhuruwelha Naabramu ntorani, “Naabramu! Nhoove! Mii phi owaakihani. Nttuvo ninyu ninowa ukhalha nulhupalhe, wo nlhatu wo ukirumelhelha!”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Nansho Naabramu nkayeera, “Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, nnohalha ukivaha ittu yaani uno kithepaka ukhalha wo uhikhalha ni mwaana, ni o unhiyera nhakhu aka akhalhaka phi Eliezeri o Udameski? <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Nkoonani! Khannakivaha ashaana, ipotta iyarelhe unupani waka phi nowa ukhalha o uhiyeriya nhakhu aka!”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Phi vavawo Apwiiya Nlhuku venre aya, “Ulha khanowa aakhalha o uhiyeriya nhakhu inyu! Mwaamwaninyu o ikekhiaye phi nowa ukhalha o uhiyeriya nhakhu inyu!” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Vavawo Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakumiha Naabramu vathe ni weerelha, “Mmweheke wiirimu uwo! Mwaalhakelheke ittotwa chiyo, yakhalhaka nnnowooria waalhakelha! Phi chiichammo iyari inyu chinohalha aya ukhalha enchi!”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Naabramu nkayaarumelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni ayo Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaalhakelhelha Naabramu ukhalha ntu o uvarechesha ikekhiaye.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Naabramu, “Miyaano phi mii, Apwiiya Nlhuku kuuwihilheni ukhuma Uuri, iwani ya Akaldayo wiira kiwe koovahani ilha ilhapo ilha ikhalhe yawinyu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Nansho Naabramu nkayeera, “Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, kinohalha uchuwelha chani wiira ilhapo ilha inookhalha yawaka?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, “Nkiwiihereke mwaang'ope nthiyana o iyaakha ttaru ni mwaapuri nthiyana o iyaakha ttaru ni ikhondoro ilhopwana yo iyaakha ttaru ni nchiya ni ikhunda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Naabramu nkayaawiiha chechiyo chonkhaye chiyo, nkayammianiha kila mwannama velhi nkayaapanga isafu piilhi, cho uwehana, nansho ashinuni ayo khaamianihilhe velhi. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Iwuku vaawilhe aya vamitemboni vawo wiira athowolhache inama chiyo, Naabramu ahoomolhacha.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Nchuwa veelha aya, Naabramu ahowolhiya ikhove chinene, ipiphi totoro yo woopiha nkayaakhunelha. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Naabramu, “Nchuwelheke wo ikekheene wiira achishaana inyu anowa ukhalha alheto mwiilhaponi nhiri mwawaya, anowa ukhalha ipotta ni uhuvihachiya wo iyaakha imia ncheshe. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Inakhalhaka chiicho etu, kinoowa kaatwarusha attu o nenno nikosho ninohalha waapanga ipotta nno. Ni yamalhaka vavawo, achishaana inyu ayo anowa ukhuma mwommo mwiilhaponi mmo, anari ni nhakhu mwinchi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Nansho inyuva mwaanene va, nnoowa ulhokelha iyaakha chinchi ni nnoowa urimelha wo mpuha ru. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Achishaana inyu anowa uhokolhia uno iyari yo necheshe, ukhalhawaya uwonya wo attu o Uamori khunatimira mpaka vanohalha aka waatwarusha.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Nchuwa venlhe aya ni ipiphi inakenlhe, wo uhipicha ittu thoko nivalhi naatutuma mwiishi ni nthuko waapharelha mooro chahovira variyari isafu yo induri cho inama chilhe. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Nenno nihuku nno Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeesha malhehano ni Naabramu yeeraka, “Kinoowa kaavaha iyari inyu ilha ilhapo ilha, toka mwolhoko wo Naili wo Umisri mpaka mwolhoko muulhupalhe wo Yufrati ulhe, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />yaani ilhapo ya Aakeni, Aakenizi, Akadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Ahiti, Aperizi, Arefai <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Aamori, Akanaani, Agirgashi ni Ayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Hajiri ni Ishmaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Paahi etu Asarai ahanu aya Naabramu aari ahinaayarelha owannyaya mwaana. Nansho ahanaa ipotta ithiyana eeehaniya Hajiri o ukhuma Umisri. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Paahi Asarai nkayeerelha owannyaya, Naabramu, “Nhochuwelha wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku khanakivahera waapatta ashaana. Munrupaneke etu Hajiri, ipotta aka nthiyana ulha, veekinaka kinowaapatta ashaana ukhuma uwannyawe.” Naabramu nkayaarumelhelha nlhove na Asarai nno. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Paahi baada ya Naabramu ukhalha Ukanaani wo iyaakha khumi, Asarai yaavaha Naabramu Hajiri ipotta aya nthiyana Mmisri, wiira akhalhe ahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Naabramu nkayanrupana Hajiri, ni uyo nkaarupalha irukulhu. Nansho Hajiri vonne awe wiira horupalha irukulhu, nkaachokholha waaveeha Asarai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Paahi Asarai nkayeerelha Naabramu, “Inyuva phi nohalha uwehiya wo ulha nlhatu wo uveehiya kinopangelhiya aka ulha. Mii kahoovahani ipotta aka nthiyana, nansho varupanlhe awe irukulhu, mii kihothathuwa ukhalha khaveittu uwannyawe yoyo! Apwiiya Nlhuku anihukumulheke iriyari ihu inyuva ni mii.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Nansho Naabramu nkayeerelha Asarai, “Nlhatu inyu mwaanene. Ipotta inyu nthiyana uyo ri mmathathani mwinyu, mumpangelheke chiriyoothe chinothanana inyu.” Paahi Asarai ahontwarusha Hajiri mpaka nkaattawa.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishmaeli nooyaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkawamphwanya Hajiri vanraponi uthakoni, nrapo niri iphiro inokelha Ushuri. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Nnepa nkawaakoha, “Hajiri, ipotta ya Asarai, unokhuma vayi unokelha vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hajiri nkaakhulha, “Kinaattawa apwiiya Asarai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ulhe nkaweera, “Uhokolhie wa apwiiya awo Asarai, wewelhelheke.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Wo uthepa vavawo, nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkawaamwiirelha Hajiri, “Kinowoncherera achishaana awo, anowa winchiva vahinooriya waalhakelhiya. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Ukhalhawaya uwe uri veruttuni, unowa wiithaphulha mwaana mwanlhopwana, unohalha awo umwiihana nchina nawe Ishmaeli, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoona chineera awo wo utwaruwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Nansho mwaamwanao, Ishmaeli, nowa ukhalha thoko iphuta yo mwiithuphini, nowa uvengiya ni kila ntu ni kila ntu nowa unvenga. Khanowa aakhalha rata ni ashilhoko awe.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Paahi Hajiri nkaavaha nchina Apwiiya Nlhuku olhumanne awe wowo ayo, “Uweva phi Nlhuku Noona,” ukhalhawaya oopuwelha wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye, kihoona ayo anokoona ayo!” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Phi nlhatu etu ilhushi ilhe ineehaniya Beer lahai roi, maana aya, “Ilhushi ya Nkumi Noona.” Yeyo ilhushi iyo iri iriyari yo Ukadeshi ni Uberedi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hajiri nkaayarelha Naabramu mwaana mwanlhopwana. Naabramu nkayammaha yoyo mwaana uyo nchina na Ishmaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Naabramu aari ntu o iyaakha themanini ni sita, Hajiri vannyanre awe Ishmaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Malhehano o wiinelhiya unyawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Naabramu vaari aya ni iyaakha tisaini ni tisa Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaakhumelhelha nkayeerelha, “Miyaano phi Nlhuku Nooria. Nttwareke malheheriyo aka ni ukhalha wo uhikhuwachiya. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ni mii kinoowa keesha malhehano ni inyu ni wuncherera iyari inyu chinene.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Vavawo Naabramu nkayaawulhuwa makukhu. Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Alha phi malhehano aneesha aka ni inyu. Nnowa ukhalha athumwanaya attu o makosho menchi, <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />ni toka vano nna, khanneehaniya tho Abramu nansho nnohalha wiihaniya, Aburahimu. Ukhalhawaya kihoopangani ukhalha athumwanaya attu o makosho menchi. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Kinouvahani iyari yinchi chinene, uwaninyu anowa ukhuma makosho menchi ni akina anowa ukhalha mamwene.”<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />“Kinooshunga malhehano aka ukhalha o mahuku o uhimalha, iyari inyu ni iyari chaya chonkhaye, tho kinookhalha Nlhuku inyu ni Nlhuku o iyari chinyu mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Kinouvahani inyuva ni iyari inyu, ilha ilhapo inokhalha inyu thoko nlheto ilha, yaani ilhapo yo Kanaani ikhalhe yawinyu mahuku o uhimalha. Ni mii kinookhalha Nlhuku aya.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Yamalhekeru, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Aburahimu, “Ni inyu, nnoovarelha malhehano aka mwaanene, iyari inyu ni iyari chaya chonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Malhehano aka, anohalha inyu uvarelha inyuva ni iyari inyu phi alha. Kila nlhopwana munlhokoni mwinyu hothananiya lazima eenelhiye unyawo. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Nnowiinelhiya unyawo ukhalha phi iphiro yo wooniha malhehano variyari aka mii ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kila mwaana mwanlhopwana o ijuma imoka munlhokoni mwinyu, lazima eenelhiye unyawo. Kila nlhopwana mu iyari inyu, akhalhe ipotta yareelhe mmanupani mwinyu, ama nlheto hirii iyari inyu, oopolhiye wo nchurukhu inyu, <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />eiyo, kila mmoka aya yareelhe unupani winyu ni ata oopolhiye wo nchurukhu inyu lazima eenelhiye unyawo. Yeyo phi iphiro yo wooniha malhehano aka mwiiruttuni mwinyu, malhehano o mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Nlhopwana riyoothe hineenelhiya unyawo, noonyaraphiya mwaattuni, kwaani hokhota malhehano aka.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Yamalhekeru, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Aburahimu, “Wo ahanu inyu ayo, nheehane tho Asarai nansho vano mweehaneke Asara. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Kinowaavaha ibarakha ni ayo anouyarelhani mwaana mwanlhopwana. Eiyo, kinowaavaha ibarakha Asara ni ayo anowa ukhalha anumwanaya makosho menchi, ni uwannyaya yayo, anowa ukhuma mamwene o makosho.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Vavawo Aburahimu nkayaawulhuwa makukhu, nkayaathia munrimani mwaya opuwelhaka, “Anaa yeyo inowooriacha, ntu o wulhuvalha, o iyaakha imia imoka unnyara mwaana? Ni vavawo chani, Asara o iyaakha tisaini anowooria umpatta mwaana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Paahi Aburahimu nkayaamwaakhulha Nlhuku, “Yakaari nambaya malhehano inyu ayo yakaakhanlhe a Ishmaeli.”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Nansho Nlhuku nkaakhulha, “Mena! Ahanu inyu Asara anouyarelhani mwaana mwanlhopwana ni ninyu nnoowa umwiihana nchina nawe Isaka. Kinoolhipiha malhehano aka uwannyawe ni wo iyari awe ukhalha malhehano o mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Ni mwaha unomwaacha Ishmaeli kiheewa ulhepelha winyu. Kinommaha ibarakha, kinommaha achishaana enchi ni woncherera chinene. Ishmaeli nowa ukhalha athumwanaya atawara khumi ni elhi ni mii kinompanga ukhalha athumwanaya nikosho nulhupalhe. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Nansho malhehano aka anowa uhimiecheshiya wa Isaka mwaana a Asara, anohalha aya uyarelhani ikatema thoko yelha mwaahiino.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Paahi Nlhuku vaamalhinhe awe wulhumacha, ahaahiya Aburahimu.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Nenno nihuku, Aburahimu nkayaamwiinelha unyawo mwaamwanaya Ishmaeli ni weenelha unyawo ipotta aya onkhaye ashilhopwana ayarelhe unupani waya ni oopolhiye wo nchurukhu waya, thoko Nlhuku chenre awe wo ulhehera. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ikatema veenelhiye aya unyawo, Aburahimu aari o iyaakha tisaini ni tisa, <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />uno Ishmaeli mwaamwanaya uyo, aari o iyaakha khumi ni ttaru. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Onkhaye Aburahimu ni mwaamwanaya, Ishmaeli, yeenelhiye unyawo nihuku nimoka nenno, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />vamoka ni ashilhopwana onkhaye o unupani waya, ipotta onkhaye aayarelhe unupani waya ni oopolhiye wo nchurukhu waya onkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku nowaalheha Aburahimu mwaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhumelhelha Aburahimu vakhiviru ni miri chulhupalhe cho Mamre. Aburahimu aari anakhanlhe vanlhakoni vanihemani waya, eettuwaka uviha wo nchuwa no uthana. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Nkayaapathusha miitho ni woona attu araru aneemenlhe utayi vakani. Vonne aya tu, ahokhuma vanihemani waya vawo, nkayaattimakacha weekamelha. Vaaphiyenlhe aya ahooroma mpaka vathi ni wiira, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />“Chonte, manyaathithi, nhikivire, nansho mwattunaka mmweeke vawannyaka va, mii namitheko inyu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Nnowiiheriya maashi vakani o ukhucha mmietoni, mwiittuweke vanttuchini vawo. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Vaneettuwa inyu vawo, nkihiyeke mii kouterekhelhani yolhia vakani, nlhie, wiira mpatte machiri o uthepa urwaa munkwahani mwinyu mmo, ukhalhawaya nhowa vawannyaka va mii namitheko inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Ni yayo attu ayo nkayeeracha, “Aye! Mpangeke etu thoko chinre inyu wo uhimia chiyo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Aburahimu nkayaahokolhia aakuviaka unihemani, nkayeerelha Asara, “Mwaakuviheke, mmwieke iphepa yoombone ibakuli ttaru, nkandeke, mwaapelheke alheto.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Yamalhekeru vavawo, Aburahimu nkayaarwa wo waakuvia ung'openi, nkayanthanlha mwaang'ope mmoka orera, o uneneva ni ummaha karumiya aya wiira anhithe wo waakuvia ni umwaapia. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Aburahimu nkayaakusha isiyagi ni mapelhe ni inama yaapeiye ilhe, nkaathalhelha vakittu ni waakharibisha alheto alhe yolhia iyo. Aburahimu anene ayo nkayeemelha kharibu ni alheto ayo waalhitelhelha vaalhiacha aya vanttuchini vawo.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Alheto alhe nkayaakoha Aburahimu, “Ari uuyi ahanu inyu Asara?” Aburahimu nkayaakhulha, “Arii unihemani.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Mmoka aya nkeera, “Wo ikekhiaye kinouhokolhelhani ikatema thoko yelha mwaahiino ni ahanu inyu ayo anowa annyara mwaana mwanlhopwana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Voolhumacha aya chiicho, Asara aari eewelhelhaka utulhi nlhako unihemani uwo. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Aburahimu ni Asara aari attu o wuulhuvalha chinene, ni Asara ayo aari aneemenlhe woona iphiro inoviriya ni manyoopani toka katashiru. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Paahi etu Asara yahothia aneneru munrimani yiiraka, “Mii kihoolhuvalha ni owannyaka chiicho ahoolhuvalha. Chani, kinoolhuvanlhe thoko cho, kinowooria uteelhiya ni waayara ashaana?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Vavawo nholhelhi o yayo attu ayo, aari phi Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaakoha Aburahimu, “We ishiyani etu Asara anothia ni wiikoha wiira wo ikekhiaye kinoolhuvanlhe thoko cho, inowooria umpatta mwaana? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Chani ihaawo ittu iriyoothe ihinooria wa Apwiiya Nlhuku? Kinouhokolhelhani mwaahino, ikatema ilhakelhiye, ikatema thoko yelha, Asara anowa ukhalha ni mwaana mwanlhopwana.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Nansho Asara, yoovaka, yahoruna yiiraka, “Akinathiaa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha, “Mena! Uthia, nhothia.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aburahimu anowaalhapelhelha attu o Usodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Phi vavawo attu alhe vaathamanche aya, nkayaaphiyacha ni woona iwani yo Usodoma, Aburahimu vaavelhelha aya. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayoopuwelha aneneru, “Chani kaavitheke Aburahimu ulha mwaha kilhakenlhe aka upanga ulha? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Ukhalhawaya Aburahimu phi nowa ukhalha athumwanaya attu onkhaye ni attu onkhaye o velhaponi anowa upatta ibarakha wo iphiro aya! <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Kihaathanlha yayo ni iyari aya. Yayo anowa eettuchiha iyari aya uvara iphiro aka, akhalhe attu o upanga moombone ni attu o upanga chittu cho ikekhiaye, ni mii kiwe kaatimiriha malhehano kilhenhe aka wa Aburahimu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, “Kiheewa malhove menchi o uchukulha anochukulha aya attu aka o Usodoma ni o Ugomora. Ni uwonya waya uhonnuwa chinene. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Paahi etu kinookhuruwa kirwee wo yayo attu ayo koone kimwanene, yakhalhaka wo ikekhiaye ahopanga thoko chinre aka wo wiiwa vanochukulha aya vawo. Kinothanana uchuwelha yoyo mwaha uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Uthama vavawo, attu elhi akina alhe ahothama nkayaavara iphiro yo ukelha Usodoma, nansho Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaahalha aneemenlhe vamoka ni Aburahimu.<verse eid="GEN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Paahi Aburahimu nkayaatameria Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkayaakoha, “Chani wo ikekhiaye nnowaalhakalhiha attu oombone vamoka ni attu anopanga cho uhilhoka? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Veekinaka ahaawo attu oombone makhumi nthanu vawani vawo. Chani nnoolhakalhiha iwani yonkhaye wo uhihiya wo nlhatu wo attu anopanga moombone makhumi nthanu arii mwommo ayo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Akinaanyihera wiira nnoopanga chiicho! Weeva attu anopanga moombone vamoka ni attu anopanga chittu cho uhilhoka, attu anopanga moombone upangiya thoko chinopangiya aya attu anopanga chittu cho uhilhoka! Mena! O uhukumulha ilhapo khanohiya uhukumulha chittu wo ikekhiaye!”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera, “Kaaphwanyaka attu anopanga moombone makhumi nthanu, Usodoma uwo, paahi kinoohiya iwani yonkhaye wo uhilhakalhiha wo nlhatu waya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Aburahimu nkayeera tho, “Kiholhikacha woolhumana Apwiiya, mii kirii ntukurukhu ni ituraru va. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Veekinaka anoopatikana attu anopanga moombone makhumi ncheshe ni nthanu badala ya attu makhumi nthanu. Chani anoolhakalhiha iwani yonkhaye wo uwukuwa attu athanu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha, “Akinolhakalhiha iwani iyo yakhalhaka wowo ahaawo attu anopanga moombone makhumi ncheshe ni nthanu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Aburahimu nkayoncherera ukoha, “Veekinaka anokookhalha attu makhumi ncheshe wowo, nnokowiira chani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha, “Wo nlhatu wa attu makhumi ncheshe ayo, akinopanga chiicho.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Aburahimu nkayoncherera tho, “Inyu Pwiiya, kinolhepelha wiira, nhikithunalhelhe, kuulhumache tho. Yakhalhaka ahaawo wowo attu makhumi mararu anopanga moombone, nnokowiira chani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha, “Akinopanga chiicho kaaphwanyaka yayo attu makhumi mararu ayo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Aburahimu nkayeera, “Chonte Pwiiya, nhikithunalhelhe vanothepa aka ukohani. Chani yakhalha anookokhalha attu makhumi melhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha, “Wo nlhatu no yayo attu makhumi melhi ayo, akinolhakalhiha iwani iyo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Wo umalhihera, Aburahimu nkayeera, “Inyu Pwiiya, kinoulhepelhani nhikithunanelhe, nansho kuulhumache tho nkwaha mmoka. Chani akhalhaka ahaawo attu khumi, inowa ukhalha chani vavawo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhulha, “Wo nlhatu wo yayo attu khumi ayo, akinolhakalhiha yeyo iwani iyo.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Apwiiya Nlhuku vaamalhinhe aya woolhumana Aburahimu, ahorwaa, Aburahimu nkayaahokolhia uwannyaya.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Uwonya wa attu o Usodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Minepa elhi alhe nkayaaphiya Usodoma uchechilho. Yeyo ikatema iyo Nalutu aari anakhanlhe vaari nlhako wo iwani yo Usodoma. Vonne aya attu ayo, aheemelha weekamelha, nkayooroma mpaka vathi, waathimicha. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Nkayeera, “Manyaathithi, mii namitheko inyu, kharibu etu uwannyaka, nnookhucha mieto, ni urupa uwannyaka uhiyu wo lhelho ulha. Washaakaru nnowooria urwaa nkwaha inyu.” Nansho, ayo nkayeeracha, “Mena! Hii ninoorupa vapuwani va.” <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Nalutu nkayaapepechacha chinene, nkayaarumelhalhacha, nkayaarukunuwa ni ukelha unupani wa Nalutu. Ni ayo nkayaalhehera anamitheko aya wiira yaaterekhelhe yolhia alheto ayo. Vaayilhe aya, nkayaakhalhacha ni ulhia.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Nansho uhiyu, ahinaya urupa, manyaalhopwana onkhaye o iwani yo Usodoma vawo, ashimirawo ni ashulhupalhe, onkhaye hihalhaka ata ntu mmoka uwani, ahorukureriacha inupa ya Nalutu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Nkayeehana Nalutu ni waakoha, “Ari vayi attu awilhe uchechilho uwaninyu alhe? Mwaakumihacheke vathe, ninothanana waarupana.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Nalutu nkayaakhuma vathe ni uttia nlhako, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />nkayeerelhacha attu ayo, “Manyaamunna, kinoulhepelhani wiira nhipange ittu yo unanara iyo. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Nkoonani etu, mii va kihaana ashimialhi elhi ahinathupha mooro. Nkihiyeke etu kuuvaheni yayo ashimialhi ayo mwaapangelheke thoko chinothanana inyu mwaatti. Nansho nhaapangelhe ittu iriyoothe alha attu alha ukhalhawaya yayo alheto aka.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Nansho yayo manyaattu ayo nkayeeracha, “Nthame uwo! Inyuva mwaawilhe va nlheto ni vano nnepanga ntu o waamulha milhatu! Paahi etu ninoupangelhani ittu yo unanara upwaha chaathanana ihu waapangelha alheto inyu ayo.” Vavawo nkayaakakha Nalutu utulhi, nkayaalhikacha uphomolha nlhako. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Nansho alheto alhe nkayookolha miono chaya nkayaapurulhelha Nalutu mpaani ni uttia nlhako. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Nkayaata ni waahelha uhoona ahoorie woona yayo manyaalhopwana onkhaye ayo, olhupalhe ni ashinkani ata nkayaahalha yaaviaka nlhako ulhe ahoonaka.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nalutu anoothama Usodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Alheto elhi alhe nkayaakoha Nalutu, “Chani nhanaa ntu nkina vaa, veekinaka achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ama ashithiyana, ama attu yaavenke, ama ashilhoko inyu akina anokhalha ilha iwani ilha? Mwaathamihacheke vawani va chitema, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />ukhalhawaya ichuku yinchi ya attu anokhalha va ihaaphiyelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Paahi ahoniruma niwe naahararia.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Paahi Nalutu nkayaarwelha manyaahokohaya yaathenlhe achishaana aya ashithiyana ayo, nkayeerelha, “Mwaatti mwaakuvieke, nthamache va vakittu va, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku anothanana ulhakalhiha iwani ilha!” Nansho yayo manyaattu ayo nkayoona thoko anowiiraka upanga iperwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Wichishuru washeeke, minepa alhe yahaakurumicha Nalutu yiiraka, “Munkweke! Mwaakuvieke mwaakusheke ahanu inyu ni achishaana inyu elhi alha nhiwe mwaapotera iwani ilha vanohalha aya utwarushiya vawo.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Nalutu nkayaakhalha ni ureeshi. Nansho ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku aari oonelhaka ikiriri, minepa chilhe chahaavara miono Nalutu ni ahanu aya ni achishaana aya elhi alhe nkayaakushacha mpaka uchereshere iwani. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Vaakuminhe aya vachereshere iwani, nnepa mmoka nkaweerelha, “Nttaweke, mwiichaakiheke mwaashinene. Nhiwehe utulhi mena nheemelhe variwoothe unikooteni uwo. Nttawelheke umiakoni, nhiwe mwaalhakalhihiya.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Nalutu nkayaakhulha, “Mena thithi! Akinooria. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Wo ikekhiaye mii namitheko inyu va, kihoona ikiriri inyu. Nhookholha ukumi aka, nansho akinooria uttawelha umiakoni uwo. Wowo ulhakalhihiya uwo unowa waakiphwanya kihinaphiya wowo, ni mii kinookhwa etu. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Mwooneke, ulhe ihaawo iwani ikaani kinooria aka uttawelha, iri vakhiviru. Paahi etu nkihiyeke kittawelhe wowo. Ilhe iwani ikani tu, wowo kinokowookhwaa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Nnepa uyo nkawaakhulha, “Aye, kihorumelhelha. Akinolhakalhiha iwani iromonlhe inyu iyo. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Mwaakuviheke! Nttawelheke wowo ni mii akinooria upanga ittu iriyoothe mpaka vanohalha inyu uphiya wowo.” Paahi yeyo iwani iyo nkayeehaniya Soari, maana aya, “Iwani ikani.”<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulhakalhihiya iwani cho Usodoma ni Ugomora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Nchuwa naari nishaaka Nalutu vaaphilhe aya Usoari. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Phi vavawo etu Apwiiya Nlhuku vaakurunshe aya mooro wo upaha wo uka wo ukhuma wiirimu, upaha Usodoma ni Ugomora, <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />nkayaalhakalhiha chechiyo iwani chiyo ni nikoote nonkhaye ni attu yaakhalhacha onkhaye ni kila ittu yaamenlhe yeyo ilhapo iyo. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Nansho ahanu a Nalutu aari utulhi wa Nalutu, ahoweha utulhi, nkayaathathuwa ukhalha nipoto no maakha.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Wichishuru nihuku no neyelhi, Aburahimu ahorwaa vakittu veemenlhe aya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Vaari aya vavawo, ahoweha nthelha wo Usodoma ni Ugomora ni nikoote nonkhaye, nkayaashanga woona mwiishi mwinchi ututumaka thoko wo mooro mulhupalhe. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku vaalhakalhihilhe aya iwani cho umakoteni mwaakhalha aya Nalutu, ahoopuwelha Aburahimu, nkayaathamiha Nalutu yeyo iwani iyo, wiira ahiwe yaakhwa vamoka ni attu o wowo ayo.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nalutu ni achishaana aya ashithiyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Nalutu nkayoova ukhalha Vasoari vawo paahi etu ahothama yeyo iwani iyo vamoka ni achishaana aya ashithiyana elhi alhe, nkayaarwaa uukhalhani unikhukuni umwakoni. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Nihuku nimoka ikatema vaari aya wowo vawo, mwaamwanaya muulhupalhe uyo ahomwiirelha nhima awe, “Athumwanihu alha ahoolhuvalha ni mena khaawo nlhopwana varii ihu va, onithelha wiira naapatte ashaana. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Paahi etu, naavaheke idivai yo uchasha athumwanihu ahapalhiyeke, naarupane wiira ninnuwihe iyari wo waapatta ashaana uwannyaya.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Yoyo uhiyu uyo nkayaavaha idivai yo uchasha athumwanaya, nkayaahapalhiya. Mwalhi muulhupalhe uyo nkaarwaa uwaarupanani. Nansho anarupaka chiicho, athumwanaya khayachuwenlhe ikatema vanrupanne aya mwaamwanaya mena vaathamme awe.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Nihuku no neyelhi, mwalhi muulhupalhe uyo ahomwiirelha nhima awe, “Nchana uhiyu mii kahaarupana athumwanihu, lhelho etu naavaheke idivai yo uchisha ahapalhiyeke ni inyu mwaarupane ninnuwihe iyari wo waapatta ashaana.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Paahi yoyo uhiyu uyo, nkayaavaha tho idivai yo uchasha ni mwaana mwankani ulhe nkaarwaa uwaarupanani athumwanawe. Nansho athumwanaya ayo khaaari achuwelhaka ikatema yaanrupanne aya mena vaathamme awe. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Chiichammo etu, achishaana o yelhi a Nalutu ayo yahorupalha irukulhu wo urupa ni athumwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Mwalhi muulhupalhe uyo nkannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana nkaamwiihana nchina nawe Moabu. Yoyo phi ntepo no attu o nikosho no Amoabu mpaka lhelho nna. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Mwalhi mwankani ulhe ni uyo ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana nkaamwiihana nchina nawe, Ben ammi. Yoyo phi athumwanaya attu o nikosho no Aamoni mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Aburahimu ni Naabimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Paahi Aburahimu ahothama Umamre nkayaalhukama ilhapo yo Unegebu nkayaamaka iriyari yo Ukadeshi ni Ushuri, yamalheke nkayaarwaa ni ukhalha wo mahuku vakani Ugerari. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Vaari aya wowo, Aburahimu aheera wiira ahanu aya Asara ayo arokoraya. Paahi etu amwene Naabimeleki o Ugerari ahaakusha Asara ukhalha ahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Nansho Nlhuku ahaakhumelhelha Naabimeleki ntorani uhiyu, nkeerelha, “Inyu nnookhwa wo nlhatu no athiyana mwaawelhe inyu ayo, ahanaa owannyaya.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Naabimeleki aari ahinarupa ni Asara, paahi nkayaakhulha, “Chani, Pwiiya, nnooweeva attu ahittenke? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Aburahimu anene ayo phi enre wiira alha arokoraya. Tho, ata Asara anene ayo yenre wiira Aburahimu ayo onnaya! Mii kaapannge kipannge aka iyo wo nnikwa woombone ni mena akiwonnye.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Paahi Nlhuku nkeerelha ntorani mmo, “Aye. Kihochuwelha wiira mwaapannge chiicho wo nrima woombone ni mii phi ohinheni wiira nhiwonye ni ukittekelha, phi nlhatu etu akohilheni wiira mwaatamerie yayo athiyana ayo. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Vano etu mwaahokolhosheke athiyana ayo wa owannyaya. Aburahimu ayo, yayo anamilhohi aka, anoulhapelhelhani wiira nhikhwe. Nansho mwaahahokolhosheke, nchuwelheke we ikekhiaye wiira inyuva nnookhwa vamoka ni attu inyu onkhaye.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Paahi Naabimeleki nkayonkwa wichishuru, nkayeehanacha akavihi aya onkhaye ni waahimeria mwaha wonne aya ntorani, ni ayo yahoovacha chinene. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Phi vavawo Naabimeleki vehanne aya Aburahimu, nkayaakoha, “Nnipangenlheni? Kuuttekenlheni ittu yaani, mpaka nkamwaakiwiihera wu uthapana wu, mii ni imwene aka? Nhokipangelha ittu ihinophwanelha upangiya.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Tho Naabimeleki yahothepa waakoha Aburahimu, “Ittu yaani yurummeni wiira mpange chiicho?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Aburahimu nkayaakhulha, “Kaapannge chiicho ukhalhawaya koopuwelha wiira, khaawo ntu nonthimicha Nlhuku va. Ni vavawo mwaanokiiva wiira mwaakushe ahanu aka ayo. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Wo uthepa vavawo tho, wo ikekhiaye yayo mii mwanrokoraka, niyareelhe ni athumwanihu amoka nimwalhaanne unipelheni, paahi etu phi nlhatu no ukhalha ahanu aka. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Ikatema Nlhuku vaakirenlhe awe kithame unupani wa athumwanaka ni ukirweeha wa amalhaponi, kaheerelha ahanu aka, ‘Ukittu uriwoothe unohalha ihu urwaa, mweereke mii mwanrokorinyu!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Naabimeleki nkaahokolhosha Asara ahanu a Aburahimu wa owannyaya, nkaayavaha Aburahimu ikhondoro ni ing'ope ni ipotta chilhopwana ni chithiyana. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Tho Naabimeleki nkayeerelha Aburahimu, “Mwooneke, ilhapo yonkhaye ilha yawaka, paahi etu nthanlheke ukittu Nnothanana inyu, nrweeke mwakhalheke.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Tho, nkayeerelha Asara, “Mwooneke, mii kihaavaha onninyu nchurukhu makhobilhi elufu imoka wo wooniha attu onkhaye ari ni inyu ayo wiira khanttenke, khanrina nlhatu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Baada yo vavawo, Aburahimu nkayanlhepelha Nlhuku, nkookokholha Naabimeleki ni ahanu aya ni ipotta chaya ashithiyana ata nkayooria waapatta ashaana tho. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku aari anaattukilhe manyoopani o unupani wa Naabimeleki wiira ahiyare wo nlhatu wa Asara, ahanu a Aburahimu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Uyaria wa Naisaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoopuwelha Asara, nkayaapangelha thoko chaalhenhe aya. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Paahi Aburahimu anoolhuvanlhe Asara ahorupalha irukulhu nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, ikatema thoko yelhe yaaromolhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Aburahimu nkayammaha yoyo mwaana aya aayariye ni Asara uyo nchina na Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka vaatiminre mahuku nane, Aburahimu ahomwiinelha unyawo thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Aburahimu aari o iyaakha imia imoka ikatema vannyanre aya Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Ni Asara nkayeera, “Nlhuku hokithathelhiha, ntu riyoothe nohalha wiiwa ulha mwaha ulha nowa uthaathelha vamoka ni mii.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Nkayoncherera, “Apani akoonrie weerelha Aburahimu wiira, mii Asara kinowa kaamwiiha ashaana? Tho, kihaayarelha mwaana mwanlhopwana anolhuvanlhe!”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Isaka nkaathepa wunnuwa ni nihuku naahihiye awe nipelhe, Aburahimu ahopanga isikuukuu yulhupalhe.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asara anomwoomolha Hajiri ni mwaamwanawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Nihuku nimoka kaanyuma, Asara ahomwoona Ishmaeli mwaana a Aburahimu yariye ni Hajiri, Mmisri, ampangelhaka ichimwa mwaamwanaya Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Paahi Asara nkayeerelha Aburahimu, “Mwoomolhe uwo ipotta inyu nthiyana uyo ni mwaamwanawe uyo. Khavanooria mena mwaana o nthiyana ipotta uhiyeriya nhakhu vamoka ni mwaamwanaka Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Nenno nlhove nno nahaahelha ihuzuni Aburahimu chinene, ukhalhawaya ni Ishmaeli uyo aari mwaamwanaya chiicho.<verse eid="GEN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Nansho Nlhuku nkeerelha Aburahimu, “Nhikelhiye ihuzuni wo nlhatu no mwaana uyo, mena ipotta inyu nthiyana uyo. Ittu iriyoothe inohalha inyu uhimeriya ni Asara, mpangeke chiicho. Wo ikekhiaye iyari inyu inohalha ukhuma wa Isaka, thoko chinre aka wo ulhehani. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Ni wo yoyo mwaana a ipotta inyu nthiyana uyo, kinompanga ukhalha phi athumwanaya nikosho attu enchi ukhalhawaya ni uyo mwaamwaninyu.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Paahi etu wichishuru washeekeru, Aburahimu ahokusha yolhia ni ntumpa wo maashi, nkayammaha Hajiri ni unthatha vanikhathani, nkayaamwiirelha athame vamoka ni mwaamwanawe. Hajiri nkaathama nkaarwa athemwathemwaka uthakoni Ubeer Sheba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Maashi alhe vaamanlhe aya muntumpani mmwe, Hajiri ahomwaathalhelha mwaamwanawe vathi vaniphumbulhuni. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Nkaarwa uchereshere, nkonkoma, vaaphiya mieto imia imoka cho, ukhalhawaya munrimani eera, “Mbaya kihimwoone mwaamwanaka vanokhwawe.” Ni ikatema vaari awe nakhanlhe vavawo, Hajiri ahonlha.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Nlhuku nkaamwiiwa mwaana vonlha awe ni nnepa wa Nlhuku nkawaamwiihana Hajiri ukhuma wiirimu, nkaweera, “Hajiri, unohuvelhani? Uhoove, Nlhuku heewa nlhove no mwaamwanao vari awe vawo. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Weemelheke, urweeke wankusheke mwaana uyo ummarelheke rata mmathathani mwao, ukhalhawaya kinompanga ukhalha athumwanaya attu enchi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Nlhuku nkampatakulha Hajiri miitho, nkoona ilhushi yo maashi, nkaarwa ni urika maashi, nkaachariha ntumpa awe, nkammuriha mwaamwanawe.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Nlhuku aari vamoka ni yoyo mwaana uyo, ni uyo nkaathepa wunnuwa. Nkaakhalha uthakoni ni ukhalha ntu o wooria ulhupatta ni muura chinene. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Vaari awe akhalhaka uthako wo Uparani anumwanawe ahonvekiha nthiyana o ukhuma Umisri.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhehano a Aburahimu ni Naabimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Naabimeleki vamoka ni Nafikoli, olhupalhe o mphingo wa manyaasikari aya, ahaarweelha Aburahimu, nkayeerelha, “Nlhuku rii vamoka ni inyu wo kila ittu nnopanga inyu. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Paahi etu nkilhupelhelheke wo nchina na Nlhuku wiira khannokithepiacha mii ama achishaana aka ama iyari aka. Thoko chineera aka wo ukhulhuvelhiya uwannyu, chiichammo etu ni inyu kuukhulhuvelhekeni, tho nkhulhuvelhiyeke ni ilha ilhapo inokhalha inyu ilha.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Aburahimu nkayeera, “Kinolhupelha chiicho.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Baada yo vavawo Aburahimu nkayaahimiacha ichuku aari aya aachukulhaka Naabimeleki vachulhu mwaha wo ilhushi yo maashi yaathurulhiye aya ni anamitheko a Naabimeleki. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Naabimeleki nkayeerelha, “Mii akichuwenlhe apani apannge chiicho, inyu khannakihimeria, lhelho phi neewa aka yoyo mwaha uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Paahi etu Aburahimu ikhondoro ni in'gope nkayaavaha Naabimeleki. Ni yayo attu elhi ayo nkayaapanga malhehano o munlhokoni mwaya. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Aburahimu nkayaahaulha ashikhondoro ashithiyana saba. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Naabimeleki nkayaakoha Aburahimu, “Nlhatu waani etu no upanga chiicho?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Aburahimu nkayaakhulha, “Alha ashikhondoro ashithiyana alha, kinoovahani inyuva wo moono aka kimwanene uhimiechesha wiira mii phithimpe ilha ilhushi ilha.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Paahi etu yeyo ilhushi iyo nkayeehaniya Beer Sheba, ukhalhawaya oyelhi aholhupelha vavawo vakittu vawo.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Yamalhihekeru upanga malhehano ayo Ubeer Sheba uwo, Naabimeleki ni Nafikoli, olhupalhe o mphingo aya wo manyaasikari, yahothama ni uhokolhia Ufilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Aburahimu nkayaalha mmwepa Ubeer Sheba uwo nkayanthimicha Nlhuku, Nlhuku o mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Aburahimu yahokhalha mwiilhaponi mwa Afilisti wo mahuku menchi.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Aburahimu anonkumiha isadaka Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Baada yo uvira mahuku, Nlhuku ahaalhikacha Aburahimu. Nlhuku aheehana, “Aburahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Aa, kinouwiwelhelhani Pwiiya.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Nlhuku nkeerelha, “Munkusheke mwaamwaninyu Isaka, mwaamwaninyu o yekhawe nnonttuna inyu, nrweeke mpaka miako cho Umoriya, mwankumiheke isadaka yo upahiya vachulhu mwaako mmoka kinohalha aka uwoonihani.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Paahi, washeekeru, Aburahimu ahonkwa mapikoosha, nkayaathalha ikuwo vachulhu iphuta aya, nkayaakusha anamitheko aya elhi vamoka ni mwaamwanaya Isaka. Nkayaarema ikhuni wo nlhatu no upahera isadaka, nkayaachokholha nkwaha ulhukama vakittu vaahimeriye aya ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Nihuku no neraru Aburahimu ahopathusha miitho, nkayoona toka utayi vavawo vakittu vawo. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Aburahimu nkayeerelhacha anamitheko aya alhe, “Mwaarerieke vava ni iphuta ilha. Mii ni mwaamwanaka ninoorwaa mpaka ulhe, nanthimiche Nlhuku, namalhihaka ninoohokolhia.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Paahi Aburahimu nkayaakusha ikhuni chilhe, nkayanthathiha mwaamwanaya, Isaka. Anene ayo nkayaakusha mooro ni mwaalho mmathathani nkayaathama vamoka. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka nkaakoha athumwanawe, Aburahimu, “Thithi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Aburahimu nkayaakhulha, “Mii vaa, mwaamwanaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka nkaakoha, “Mooro ni ikhuni chi phi chii, vano mwaakhondoro o isadaka yo upahiya uyo ri vayi?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Aburahimu nkayaakhulha, “Mwaamwanaka, Nlhuku mwanene noonivaha mwaakhondoro o unkumiha isadaka.” Paahi nkawaarweiya nkwaha uyo.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Vaaphilhe aya vakittu vaalheheriye aya ni Nlhuku, Aburahimu ahothatha malhuku nkayaatheka madhubahu ni weesha ikhuni chilhe vachulhu vawo. Nkayanttuka mwaamwanaya Isaka ni umwaathalhelha vachulhu ikhuni chiyo vamadhubahuni vawo. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Aburahimu nkayookolha moono aya nkayaakusha mwaalho wiira anhithe mwaamwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Nansho nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaweehana ukhuma wiirimu, “Aburahimu! Aburahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Aa, mii va, kinowiiwelhelhani!”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Nnepa nkaweerelha, “Nhinhithe mwaana mena nhimpangelhe ittu iriyoothe! Vano kihochuwelha wiira nnoomwoova Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya khankithuwilhe ata mwaamwaninyu o yekha awe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Phi vavawo etu Aburahimu vaapathunshe aya miitho, nkayoona ikhondoro ilhopwana inawayilhe inyaka vethuphini. Paahi nkayaarwa nkayaakusha ikhondoro iyo, nkayakumiha isadaka yo upahiya badala yo mwaamwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Paahi etu Aburahimu nkayeehana vavawo vakittu vawo, “Apwiiya Nlhuku anoovaha.” Thoko chineeriya aya mpaka nna wiira, “Vamwaakoni wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, attu anoopatta.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Nnepa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkaweehana Aburahimu wo neyelhi ukhuma wiirimu, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />nkaweerelha, “Apwiiya Nlhuku aneera cho, Kiholhupelha wo uttuna waka wiira, ukhalhawaya nheera chommo, mena khankithuwilhe mwaamwaninyu o yekha awe, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />wo ikekhiaye kinouvahani ibarakha, kinowunnuwiha iyari inyu ni ukhalha thoko ittotwa cho wiirimu, tho thoko nhaava wo umbwaani. Iyari inyu inoowa yaatawara iwani cha amalhaponi inyu. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Wo ukhuma iyari inyu, makosho onkhaye o velhaponi anoovahiya ibarakha ukhalhawaya inyu nhewelhelha malheheriyo aka.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Paahi Aburahimu nkayaahokolhelha anamitheko aya alhe, nkawaathamachiya vamoka nkawaahokolheiya Ubeer Sheba. Aburahimu nkayaakhalha Ubeer Sheba uwo.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Achishaana a Nanahori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Baada yo yoyo mwaha uyo Aburahimu aheewa wiira, Milka chiicho haayarelha Nanahori, yaani mwanhima aya Aburahimu, achishaana ashilhopwana, <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />mwaana o nttara aari Usi, o nayelhi Buuzi, o neraru Kemueli, athumwanaya Naaramu. <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Achishaana akina aari, Kesedi, Haazo, Pildashi, Yidlafu ni Bethueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Bethueli phi ayanre Narabeka. Jumula ya ashaana aayariye ni Milka waayarelha Nanahori ahima aya Aburahimu, aari achishaana nane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Wo uthepa vavawo, Reuma karumiya nthiyana a Nanahori ni uyo ahaayarelha Nanahori achishaana acheshe, Teba, Gahamu, Tahashi ni Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ukhwa wa Asara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Asara yaakhanlhe iyaakha imia imoka ni makhumi melhi ni saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Yaarimelhe Ukiriath arba yaani Uhebroni, ilhapo yo Ukanaani. Aburahimu yahonlhelha ni waapangelha mattanga ahanu aya, Asara. <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Aburahimu nkayaahiya iruttu ya ahanu aya, nkayaarwa wolhumanani Ahiti, nkayeerelha, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Mii va kinokhalha thoko nlheto munlhokoni mwinyu. Nkivaheke etu vakittu wo waavithelha attu, kaavithe ahanu aka.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Ahiti ayo nkayaakhulha Aburahimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Inyu Munna nkaniiweni, inyuva phi ntu o uchuwania chinene munlhokoni mwihu. Mwaavitheke ahanu inyu unihiye nirinoothe nnohalha inyu uthanlha mwaanene nno, khaawo ntu ata mmoka munlhokoni mwihu nohalha uthuwani vakittu wawe, mena uchiichihani wiira nhaavithe ahanu inyu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Vavawo Aburahimu nkayeemelha ni wooroma wo iheshima umihoolho wa attu o Uhiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />nkayeera, “Mwakivahaka etu nipesha no waavitha ahanu aka, chonte, nrweeke mwakilhepelheke wa Naefroni anaaya Nasohari, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />wiira akithumihere nikhuku naya no Umakpela niri mmwiinanoni imata aya. Mwaalhepelheke wiira akithumihere nikhalhe nawaka, akivaheke wo malhivo anothananiya, vavawo mwaatti mwiiwaka.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Naefroni anene ayo aari mmoka a attu munlhokoni mwa Ahiti yaakumana vanlhakoni wo ukelhelha vawani ayo. Paahi Naefroni, Nhiti, nkayaakhulha Aburahimu, Ahiti onkhaye oonaka vanlhakoni vawo, yeeraka, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Munna, chonte nkakiiweni. Mii kinouvahani imata ni nikhuku niri mwommo nno chiicho wo uhikilhiva ittu, kinouvahani alha attu alha yoonaka. Nrweeke mwaavitheke ahanu inyu ayo wowo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Aburahimu nkayooroma tho wo iheshima umihoolho wa anenchi ayo, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />nkayeerelha Naefroni uno attu yeewaka, “Nkiiwelhelheke etu ni mii. Kinoulhivani malhivo anothananiya wo imata inyu iyo. Tho kinoulhepelhani wiira, mpochereke yayo malhivo ayo, koorie waavitha ahanu aka wowo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Naefroni nkayaakhulha Aburahimu, “Munna nkiiweke, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />malhivo o nchurukhu ishekeli imia ncheshe phi ittu yaani uwannyaka mii ni inyu? Mwaavitheke tu ahanu inyu ayo.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Aburahimu nkayewanana ni Naefroni. Nkayaaphimelhiya wo ikiasi yo nchurukhu waaromonlhe aya umihoolho wa Ahiti onkhaye, ishekeli imia ncheshe, thoko chaalhakelhiya aya ni attu o upanga maronda o yeyo ikatema iyo.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Paahi imata i Naefroni irii Umakpela unosha nchuwa vakhiviru ni Umamre ni nikhuku ni miri chaya chaari wowo chiyo, nkachaakhalha cha Aburahimu <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />uno Ahiti ni attu onkhaye yaakumanne vanlhakoni vawo yonecheshaka.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Baada yo vavawo, Aburahimu ahaavitha Asara ahanu aya unikhukuni wi imata yo Umakpela, vakhiviru ni u Namamre yaani Uhebroni, ilhapo yo Ukanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Paahi phi chiichammo Ahiti chaavanhe aya Aburahimu imata ni nikhuku naari mwommo nno, ukhalha vakittu wo waavithelha attu aya vanokhwa aya.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Isaka nooveka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Vano Aburahimu aari anolhuvanlhe chinene, ni Apwiiya Nlhuku aari anaavahilhe ibarakha wo kila iphiro. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Nihuku nimoka Aburahimu ahomwiirelha namitheko aya o wulhuvalha waapwaha akina, eemelhelha inupa aya ni chittu chaya chonkhaye wiira, “Mweesheke moono inyu wuuthi mweto aka, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />kinothanana nkilhupelhelheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku o wiirimu ni Nlhuku o ilhapo wiira, khannonkusha mwanthiyana riyoothe, munlhokoni mwa achishaana ashithiyana a Akanaani kinaakhalha naka alha va, nkamwanthelhiha mwaamwanaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nkilhupelhelheke wiira, nnoorwa mpaka wiilhaponi waka, wa ashilhoko aka, mwamwaavie nthiyana o uthelhiya ni mwaamwanaka Isaka.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Namitheko ulhe nkaakoha, “Keereke chani etu, nthiyana uyo akhotaka uthamelha uno? Chani kinrweheke mwaamwaninyu uyo ilhapo ukhumilhe inyu uwo?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Aburahimu nkayeera, “Mena! Nhiwe mwanhokolhosha mwaamwanaka wowo. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Apwiiya Nlhuku o wiirimu aakithaminhe mii ukhuma inupa ya athumwanaka, nkayakoolhumana mii wiilhaponi waayarelhe aka, nkayaakilhupelha yiiraka, anowaavaha achishaana aka ilha ilhapo ilha, yayo anoruma nnepa aya uhoolhelheni ni inyu nnokompatta nthiyana o umphwanelha mwaamwanaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Ni nthiyana uyo akhotaka uttukanani, naapo naka khaninowa nouttukani, nansho nhinhokolhoshe mwaamwanaka wowo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Paahi namitheko ulhe nkeesha moono nawe nkhaukani mwa Aburahimu nkaalhupelha vachulhu nenno nlhove nno.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Yamalhekeru, namitheko ulhe ahokusha ingamiya khumi cha nkunya awe ayo, nkaarwaa, ukhalhawaya nhakhu wonkhaye wa nkunya awe uyo waari mmathathani mwawe. Nkaathama nkaarwa mpaka Umesopotamiya mpaka iwani yaakhalha Nanahori. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Vaaphilhe awe, ahokhoromiha ingamiya chawe vachereshere ilhushi aari vachereshere iwani. Yaari uchechilho manyoopani vaarwa aya urikani maashi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Nkaalhapelha, “Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a athithi Aburahimu, kinoulhepelhani wiira lhelho nkivahere, kipatte, mwaapangelhe moombone athithi Aburahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Mwooneke, mii kiri va valhushi va vanowaacha aya imialhi o ilha iwani ilha urikani maashi.<verse eid="GEN 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />“Paahi etu mwamwalhi kinohalha aka umwiirelha wiira arulhe mwaapu awe akivahe maashi kiwurie, ni waavaha maashi ingamiya chaka, yoyo akhalheke phi uyo munthanlhenlhe inyu namitheko inyu Isaka. Yeyo inookooniha wiira nhaapangelha moombone athithi Aburahimu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Hinaya umalhiha ulhapelha uwo, ahowa mwalhi, Rabeka, nakunshe mwaapu awe vamuruni. Yoyo aari anaaya Nabethueli, yaani uchuulhu wa Namilka, ahanu a Nanahori, ahima aya Aburahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Yoyo mwalhi uyo aari ni ikhove yorera chinene, mwalhi hinathupha mooro ahokhuruwa valhushi, nkaarika maashi nkaachariha mwaapu awe, nkaakhuma. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Vavawo namitheko ulhe nkaakuvia umwiikamelha, nkaamwiirelha, “Kinoovenda maashi vakani o uwuria o mmwaapuni wao ayo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Mwalhi uyo nkaakhulha, “Haya, mmurieke pwiiya.” Nkaakuvia urulha mwaapu awe, nkaavarelhelha wiira aawurihe. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Vaamalhinhe awe unvaha maashi ntu ulhe, nkeera, “Kinokoorika maashi o waavaha ingamiya chinyu chiicho, mpaka vanohalha aya urupalha.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Paahi, nkaakuviha, nkaamiina maashi o mmwaapuni mwawe uhelha nnikulhani mwaawureria aya ashinama, nkaathupulhuwa urwaa ulhushi urikani maashi tho ni uwuriha ingamiya chiyo chonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Ntu ulhe nkammweha wo miitho melhi mwalhi uyo wo uhulhumacha ittu iriyoothe, wiira achuwelhe yakhalhaka Nlhuku horeriha nkwaha awe ama kuhiwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ingamiya chawurieke maashi nkachaathoshiya, ntu ulhe ahommaha mwalhi uyo ikipuli yo idhahabu yo ulhemelha yo nchurukhu mwinchi yo uwariya vaphulhani, ni ibangili piilhi cho idhahabu cho nchurukhu mwinchi chiicho, nkammwariha mmoononi. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Nkankoha, “Ukihimerie etu, Uweva mwaamwana a apani? Chani tho, vahawo vakittu wo urupa hii uwani uwo?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Rabeka nkaakhulha, “Mii mwaamwana a Nabethueli, mii uchuulhu wa Namilka, ahanu a Nanahori. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Eiyo, vahaawo vakittu wo urupa alheto. Tho, uwanihu uwo ahaawo manyashi menchi o waalhiha ingamiya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Phi vavawo etu ntu ulhe vooromihilhe awe muru, nkaathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />nkeera, “Athimichiye Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a athithi Aburahimu, hilhiyanlhe mitheko chawe choombone ni ukhulhuvelhiya wawe wa athithi. Apwiiya Nlhuku akiholhenlhe mii kimwanene uwa mpaka wa alhoko aya athithi Aburahimu!”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Paahi baada yo vavawo, mwalhi ulhe ahottimakacha urwaa uwaahimeriani amuchi a anumwanawe mwaha wo yoyo ntu uyo. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Rabeka ahanaa arokorawe eehaniya Nalaabani. Nalaabani ahottimakacha etu urwaa unkumaanani ntu ulhe ulhushi uwo, <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />ukhalhawaya Nalaabani aari anoonne ikipuli ilhe ni ibangili chilhe mmiononi mwa mwanrokoraya, ni wiiwa mwaha uhimeriye awe Rabeka ni yoyo ntu uyo. Nalaabani yahomphwanya ntu ulhe neemenlhe vakhiviru ni ingamiya chawe vachereshere ilhushi vawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Nalaabani nkaamwiirelha ntu ulhe, “Chani woonaka nneemelha uchereshere uno? Kharibu uwanihu etu, inyuva nvahiye ibarakha ni Apwiiya Nlhuku va. Mii kiheesha vakittu wo urupa mwaatti ni vakittu wo weesha ingamiya chinyu chilha!”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Paahi namitheko a Aburahimu uyo nkaarwaa vawani. Nalaabani nkaarulha ingamiya mituro chaakushilhe aya ni waavahacha manyashi, nkammaha ntu uyo vamoka ni attu yaattukanne awe, maashi o ukhucha mieto chaya. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Paahi nkayaaterekhelhiya yolhia, nansho uyo nkeera, “Akinolhia mpaka vanohalha aka uhimiacha mwaha unothanana aka wulhumacha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Nalaabani nkayeera, “Haya etu nnihimerieke.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Ntu ulhe nkeera, “Mii namitheko a Aburahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaavaha ibarakha chinchi athithi ayo, ni ayo ahokhalha ntu o uchuwania chinene. Ahaavahera mikutiro chinchi cho ikhondoro ni ing'ope chinchi, chittu chikooroshiye wo isiliva ni idhahabu, anamitheko enchi ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, ingamiya ni iphuta! <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Asara ahanu a athithi Aburahimu, uwulhuvalhani waya ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, ni athithi ayo ahonhiyera yoyo mwaana uyo nhakhu waya wonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Ni athithi ayo ahokilhupelhiha mii yeeraka, ‘Nhinthelhihe mwaamwanaka nthiyana riyoothe munlhokoni mwa ashithiyana o Ukanaani anaakhalhana aka wilhaponi waya va. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Nansho nrweeke mpaka wiilhaponi waka, wa ashilhoko aka, wiira mwamwaaviere mwaamwanaka nthiyana o unveka.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Ni mii nkakerelha, ‘Chani yakhalhaka nthiyana uyo nokookhota ukittukana mii uwa uno?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Nansho ayo nkayeera, ‘Apwiiya Nlhuku kinaarumelhelha aka muukumini mwaka, anowaaruma minepa o wiirimu aya ottukaneni ni uvaherani munkwahani mwinyu mwonkhaye, ni inyu nnokompatta mwalhi o unveka ukhuma wa ashilhoko aka, unupani wa athumwanaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Mwaahivahiyeke mwalhi vanohalha inyu uphiya wa ashilhoko aka uwo, paahi etu, khannowa mwaattukiya ni nna naapo naka nna.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Lhelho vaaphilhe aka valhushi kaholhepelha wiira, ‘Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a athithi Aburahimu, kinoulhepelhani wiira lhelho kipatte munkwahani mwaka, ni mwaapangelhe moombone athithi Aburahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Kiri vachereshere ilhushi va. Mwalhi nohalha uwa urikani maashi, nkakanvekelha maashi o uwuria vakani mmwaapuni mwawe, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />ni uyo nkaakivaha, ni urika maashi o waavaha ingamiya chaka, paahi yoyo akhalheke phi uyo munthanlhe inyu ukhalha ahanu o mwaamwanaya athithi.’<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />“Kihinaya umalhiha ulhapelha munrimani mwaka, Rabeka nkaawa phiyaru nakunshe mwaapu awe vanikhathani uwa urikani maashi. Ni mii nkakaamwiirelha, ‘Ukivahe maashi vakani kiwurie.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Ni uyo ahorulha mwaapu awe chitemachitema, nkeera, ‘Haya, pwiiya mmurieke. Tho kinoorika maashi o waavaha ingamiya chinyu chiyo.’ Paahi nkakaawuria, nkaawuriha ni ingamiya chaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Phi vavawo vankohilhe aka, ‘Uweva mwaamwana a apani?’ Nkakaakhulha, ‘Mii mwaamwana a Nabethueli, uchuulhu wa Namilka, ahanu a Nanahori.’ Phi ikatema vammwarihilhe aka ikipuli vaphulhani ni ibangili mmiononi. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Nkakooromiha muru aka waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkakaathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a athithi Aburahimu, kiholhenlhe mii mpaka wa mwalhi o nihimo naya wo nlhatu wo mwaamwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Paahi etu, mwoonihaka urera wo nrima winyu ni ukhulhuvelhiya winyu, nkihimerieke. Yaahirieke chiicho, nhimieke etu ni mii kinoochuwelha ittu yo upanga.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Baada yo wiiwa yayo, Nalaabani ni Nabethueli nkayaakhulhacha wiira, “Nenna nlhove nna nikhumme wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, hii khaninooria waamulha ittu iriyoothe. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rabeka ulha va, munkusheke munrwaaneke. Akhalheke etu ahanu o mwaamwanaya athithi inyu thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chinre aya wo ulhehera.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Namitheko a Aburahimu veewilhe awe yayo malhove ayo, ahooroma muru awe ni waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Nkaakumiha ikuwo ni chittu chikooroshiye wo isiliva ni idhahabu, nkammaha Rabeka. Tho, nkayaavaha Nalaabani ni anumwanawe Rabeka, mapambo o nchurukhu mwinchi.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Namitheko a Aburahimu ni attu aawanne awe ayo nkayaalhiacha, nkayaawuriacha ni urupa wowo. Wichishu vonkwilhe aya, namitheko ulhe nkeera, “Kinoulhepelhani etu kihokolhie wa athithi Aburahimu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Nansho arokorawe ni anumwanawe Rabeka nkayeera, “Munhiyeke mwalhi ulha akhalhe wo mahuku vakani, mahuku khumi cho, yamalhaka munrwaaneke.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Nansho ayo nkayeera, “Chonte, mwaatti nhikicherewihe, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahomalha ukivahera munkwahani mwaka, kinolhepelha etu wiira, nkihiyeke kihokolhie wa athithi ayo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Paahi, nimwiihaneke mwalhi uyo thoko, ninkoheke.”<verse eid="GEN 24:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Rabeka nkeehaniya ni ukohiya, “Chani nnoorwa ni ntu ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Ni uyo nkaakhula, “Eiyo, Kinoorwa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Paahi Rabeka nkaahiiya wiira arwee vamoka ni amwethi awe, arwee ni namitheko a Aburahimu ulhe vamoka ni attu aattukanne awe. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Rabeka nkaavahiya ibarakha eerelhiyaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Inyu arokorihu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">mwakhalheke anaangoro a attu enchi chinene ahinaalhakelhia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">achishaana inyu avarelheke iwani cha amalhaponi aya!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Paahi Rabeka ni anamitheko awe ashithiyana nkayaawelhacha ingamiya chaya ni unttwara namitheko a Aburahimu uyo, nkayaathamacha.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Naisaka aari anathamme Ubeer lahai roi, akhalhaka ilhapo cho Unegebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Nihuku nimoka uchechilho, Naisaka ahorwaa umamatani uwupuwelhani chittu. Paahi ahoweha, nkayoona ingamiya chiwaachaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Rabeka vaawenhe awe ni umwoona ntu eekamelhaka, ahokhuruwa vathi uhalhawaya aari aanyiheraka wiira phi Naisaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Paahi nkankoha namitheko a Aburahimu, “Phi apani aneeta mmatani alhe anowa unikamelhani alhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Namitheko ulhe nkeera, “Yayo phi athithi aka.” Paahi Rabeka ahokusha ntandiyo awe nkeekhunelha wiitho.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Namitheko ulhe ahaahimiachera Naisaka chittu chonkhaye chaapannge awe. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Paahi Naisaka ahonrweeha Rabeka nnihemani mwaakhalha aya Asara, anumwanaya, vaari aya akumi, nkaakhalha phi ahanu aya. Naisaka ahonttuna chinene Rabeka nkayaapatta mpuha munrimani baada yo ukhwachuni wo nookhwa a anumwanaya.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Achishaana akina a Aburahimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1Ikat 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Aburahimu ahaathelha opani akina, nchina naya eehaniya Naketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Yayo ahaayarelha Aburahimu achishaana, Zimrani, Yokshani, Medani, Midiyani, Ishbaki ni Shuwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokshani ahaayaracha Sheba ni Dedani. Achishaana a Dedani aari attu o Uashuru, o Uletushi ni o Uleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Achishaana a Midiyani aari, Efa, Eferi, Henoki, Abida ni Eldaa. Yayo onkhaye ayo aari uchuulhu wa Aburahimu ni ahanu aya, Naketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Aburahimu ahaahiyera Naisaka nhakhu waya wonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ni ikatema vaari aya bado akumi, ahaavahacha izawadi achishaana aayanre aya ni anamitheko aya ashithiyana. Nkaathamihacha ni waarweha utayi, ilhapo cho unosha nchuwa wiira ahaatamane ni mwaamwanaya, Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urimelha ni uvithiya wa Aburahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Aburahimu yaakhanlhe iyaakha imia imoka ni makhumi saba ni nthanu. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Yaarimelhe baada yo ukhalha akumi iyaakha chinchi cho uvaheriya, nkayaalhutaana ni manyaathumwanaya yaaholhenlhe. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Achishaana aya, Naisaka ni Naishmaeli yahaavitha athumwanaya u nikhuku no Umakpela, unosha nchuwa vakhiviru ni ilhapo yo Mamre waari imata i Naefroni, anaaya Nasohari, Nhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Aburahimu yooponlhe yeyo imata iyo wa Ahiti. Wowo phi uwo waavithiye aya Aburahimu ni ahanu aya, Asara. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Baada yo urimelha wa Aburahimu, Nlhuku ahaavaha ibarakha Naisaka anaaya Aburahimu. Ni ayo nkayaakhalha vakhiviru ni ilhushi yo Beer Lahai Roi, maana aya “Ilhushi ya uyo nkumi noona uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyari i Naishmaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1Ikat 1:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Achishaana a Naishmaeli anaaya Aburahimu aayanre aya wa Hajiri, namitheko nthiyana Mmisri, aari <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Nebayothi, o nttara. Akina aari Kedari, Adbeeli, Mibsamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishma, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi, Tema, Yeturi, Nafishi ni Kadema.<verse eid="GEN 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Yayo phi achishaana ashilhopwana a Naishmaeli, aari phi ahoolhelhi o mahimo khumi ni melhi, iwani ni ittoko chaya chaachuwania wo machina aya. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Naishmaeli yaakhanlhe iyaakha imia imoka ni makhumi mararu ni saba nkaaarimelha, nkayaalhutaana ni manyaapwiiyaya yaaholhenlhe. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Ayari a Naishmaeli yaakhalha ilhapo aari iriyari yo ilhapo cho Uhavira ni Ushuri unosha nchuwa ilhapo yo Umisri, iphiro yo ukelha Uashuru. Yaakhalha wo uhiwaanana ni ayari akina a Aburahimu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyaria u Naesau ni Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Alha phi iyari ya Naisaka anaaya Aburahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Naisaka aari o iyaakha makhumi ncheshe vaathenlhe aya Narabeka, abiti Bethueli, Muaramu o ilhapo yo Padan aramu. Narabeka ayo yaari mwanrokoraya Nalaabani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Narabeka yaari o uhiyara, paahi etu Naisaka ahaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaapochera ulhepelha waya, Narabeka nkayaarupalha irukulhu. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Yeyo irukulhu iyo yaari yo mavata. Ashaana ayo nkayaana ashineneru anari munthunkwani mwa Narabeka, ni ayo nkayeera, “Yakhalhaka chittu chinokhalha thoko chi chineera aya chi, nlhatuni etu no uthepa ukhalha nkumi?” Paahi nkayaarwa uwaakohani Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Mahimo melhi ari munthunkwani mwinyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Ni mahimo melhi anohalha inyu waayara ayo khanowa yeewanana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Nihimo nimoka ninowa ukhalha no machiri upwaha nihimo nikina nno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">mulhupalhe uyo nowa urumiya mitheko ni mwankani uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Mahuku aya o wiithaphulha vaaphilhe aya, Narabeka ahaayara ashaana mavata. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />O upacha uyo aari o ukhwilha, o ikharari iruttu yonkhaye, paahi nkayaamwiihana nchina nawe Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />O nayelhi uyo aayarelhe nammanre Esau uyo ikotokotto, paahi nkayaamwiihana nchina nawe Yakhobo, maana aya “o woothacha.” Ikatema vaayariacha aya ashaana ayo, Naisaka yaari ntu o iyaakha makhumi sita.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau noothumiha uyulhupalhe awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Ashaana ayo ahonnuwacha, Esau nkaakhalha ntu o ulhupatta chinene, ntu o ukhalha mwiithuphini. Yakhobo aari ntu o umaalha, ntu o ukhalha vawani. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Paahi Naisaka ahonttuna chinene Esau wo nlhatu wo ukhuura inama cheeva awe, nansho Narabeka anttuna chinene Yakhobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Nihuku nimoka, Yakhobo vaari awe aapiaka idengu, Esau ahohokolhia ulhupattani nawolhiye ithalha chinene. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Paahi etu nkaamwiirelha Yakhobo, “Kinookhwa ithalha, chonte ukimeelhe yolhia yo ukhwilha iyo kilhie!” Tho, phi nlhatu no wiihaniya Edomu, maana aya yo “ukhwilha.”<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakhobo nkaakhulha, “Ukithumihereke thoko uyulhupalhe wao, wo ukhalha mwaana o nttara uwo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau nkaakhulha, “Aye! Nansho mii kiri kharibu ukhwa, uyulhupalhe wo ukhalha mwaana o nttara urini ifaida yaani uwannyaka?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakhobo nkeera, “Ukilhupelheke etu.” Paahi Esau nkaalhupelha ni unthumihera Yakhobo ibarakha awe yo ukhalha mwaana o nttara. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Phi vavawo Yakhobo vammanhe awe Esau nkatte ni idengu. Esau nkaalhia nka, nkaawureria maashi, nkaathama. Phi chiichammo etu, Esau vaapoterinhe awe uyulhupalhe awe yo ukhalha mwaana o nttara.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Naisaka anoothamelha Ugerari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Kaanyuma nkayaakhumelhelha ikuruna mwommo mwiilhaponi mmo, ikuruna yaapwaha ilhe yaapanche ukhumelhelha khalhayi ilhe, ikatema Aburahimu vaari aya akumi. Naisaka nkayaarwa Ugerari wa Naabimeleki amwene o Ufilisti. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakhumelhelha Naisaka ni weerelha, “Nhirwee Umisri, nansho nkhalheke ilhapo inohalha aka uhimeriani. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Nkhalheke ulhetoni wowo, ni mii kinokhalha ni inyu ni uvahani ibarakha. Kinootimiriha malhehano kaavahilhe aka athumwaninyu Aburahimu, kwaani kinouvahani inyuva ni iyari inyu chi ilhapo chonkhaye chi. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Kinowaapanga achishaana inyu akhalhe enchi thoko ittotwa cho wiirimu ni waavaha chi ilhapo chonkhaye chi. Ukhuma wi iyari inyu, makosho onkhaye o velhaponi va anoovahiya ibarakha. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Kinouvahani ibarakha ukhalhawaya Aburahimu ahokiiwelhelha, nkayaavarechesha iphiro chaka, chittu chaahimenrie aka, ikano chaavahilhe aka, malheheriyo ni malhehero aka.” <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Paahi Naisaka nkayaakhalha Ugerari uwo.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Attu o wowo vaakohilhe aya mwaha wa ahanu aya, ayo yaakhunlhe wiira, “Ulha mwanrokoraka.” Yaari yoovaka uhimia wiira aari ahanu aya, wo nlhatu no woova wiira anenchi ayo aanooria weeva, ukhalhawaya Narabeka yaari nthiyana orera chinene. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Nihuku nimoka, baada yo ukhalha wowo wo mahuku menchi, Naabimeleki amwene o Ufilisti, ahothurumelha vandirishani nkayoona Naisaka anaakumbatinre ahanu aya, Narabeka ayo. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Naabimeleki nkayeehana Naisaka ni weerelha, “Ana kumbe alha ahanu inyu! Mbona mwenre wiira arokorinyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Naisaka nkayaakhulha, “Ukhalhawaya kaanoova wiira kaaneeviya wo nlhatu waya.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Naabimeleki nkayaakoha, “Mpangeni etu? Ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwa attu aka alha, aanooria waarupana ahanu inyu ayo wo uhoova, ni inyu mwannihelha muuwonyani.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Phi vavawo Naabimeleki vaamunke aya attu onkhaye wiira, “Ntu riyoothe nohalha umpangelha chittu cho uhilhoka ulha ntu ulha ama ahanu awe, nowiiviya.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Yeyo iyaakha iyo Naisaka aholhima mwommo mwiilhaponi mmo, nkayaaruweria wo upwaha mikwaha mia, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaavaha ibarakha, <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />nkayaakhalha ntu o nhakhu. Nkayaathepa upatta ni ukhalha ntu o nhakhu mwinchi chinene. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Yahokhalhana mihuwo chinchi, ikhondoro, ing'ope ni ipotta enchi mpaka nkayoonelhiya ihache ni attu o Ufilisti ayo. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Paahi wo yeyo ihache iyo attu o Ufilisti ahowuhelhacha ilhushi chonkhaye chaathipiye ni anamitheko a Aburahimu, athumwanaya, vaari aya akumi. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Phi vavawo Naabimeleki verenlhe aya Naisaka, “Nthameke vawanihu va, ukhalhawaya inyuva nhonipwaha machiri.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Paahi, Naisaka nkayaathama wowo, nkayaamaka u nikoote no Ugerari, nkayaakhalha wowo. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Nkayaawuhulhacha ilhushi chaathipiye ikatema ya Aburahimu, athumwanaya, vaari aya akumi chilhe, ilhushi chaawuhelhiye ni attu o Ufilisti baada yo ukhwa wa Aburahimu. Nkayeehana wo machina yalhe yeehaniye ni athuwanaya alhe.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Nansho anamitheko a Naisaka vaathimpe aya vanikoteni vawo, ni upatta ilhushi yo maashi o uthekhuma <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />attu yaahuwa mihuwo o Ugerari vawo, yahaana indewo ni anamitheko yaachunga mihuwo chi Naisaka yeeraka, “Alha maashi alha awihu.” Paahi Naisaka yaheehana yeyo ilhushi iyo, Eseki, maana aya, “Indewo,” ukhalhawaya yahaanelhaniya.<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Tho yahothipa ilhushi ikina, ni iyo nkayaatakanelhiya, paahi Naisaka nkayeehana yeyo ilhushi iyo Sitna, yaani “Ifitina.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Yamalhekeru, Naisaka yahorwaa vakittu vakina ni uthipa ilhushi ikina. Nansho yeyo khayaatakanelhiye, paahi Naisaka nkayeehana Rehobothi, yaani nipesha no ukhanuwa, yeeraka, “Apwiiya Nlhuku ahonivaha nipesha, ni hii vano ninoochina mwiilhaponi mu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Ukhumelhelha vavawo, Naisaka ahorwaa Ubeer Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Yoyo uhiyu uyo Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaakhumelhelha ni weerelha, “Mii phi Nlhuku a athumwaninyu Aburahimu. Nhoove ukhalhawaya kiri vamoka ni inyu, kinouvahani ibarakha ni wuncherera iyari inyu wo nlhatu wa Aburahimu, namitheko aka.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Paahi etu wowo, Naisaka ahothatha malhuku nkayaatheka madhubahu, nkayaathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nkayaamaka wowo ni anamitheko aya nkayaathipa ilhushi.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naisaka ni Naabimeleki unowiiwananiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Nihuku nimoka amwene Naabimeleki ahothama Ugerari vamoka ni Naahuzathi, ntu aavaha malhove o irusho, tho ni Nafikoli ahoolhelhi aya o mphingo wo manyaasikari, nkayaarwacha u Naisaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Paahi Naisaka nkayaakoha, “Mmwiilhe upangani uwannyaka, woonaka mwaatti mwahokipangelha ichimwa ni ukoomolha uwaninyu?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Yayo manyaattu ayo nkayaakhulha, “Nihoona mwaari wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku ari vamoka ni inyu. Paahi nihoona wiira ihorera hii nilhupelhane ni inyu, nilhehane wiira, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />khannonipangelha ittu yo uhilhoka, ni hii chiicho khaninoupangelhani ittu thoko yeyo. Nahoupangelhani moombone, nkanoohiyani wiira nthame wo uhuthuriani, wo uhupangelhani ittu iriyoothe yo uhilhoka. Ni vano inyu nhovaheriya ibarakha ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Paahi Naisaka ahoterekha yolhia, nkawaalhiya ni uwuriya vamoka. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Waashelhe waya, wahonkwiya wichishuru nkayaalhiya iyamini. Yamalhekeru, Naisaka yahaavelhelha alheto aya ni ulhehana wo ulhapelhelhaniya mpuha.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Nenno nihuku anamitheko a Naisaka yahowa ni waahimeria mwaha wo ilhushi yaathipa aya iyo, yeeraka wiira, “Nihophwanya maashi!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Paahi Naisaka nkayeehana yeyo ilhushi iyo Shiba, yaani “Naapo.” Paahi etu nchina no yeyo iwani iyo no Beer Sheba maana aya, “Ilhushi yo Naapo,” nchina nirii mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manyaahanu alheto a Naesau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Naesau vaari aya ni iyaakha makhumi ncheshe, ahaathelha manyoopani elhi Ahiti, Nayudithi abiti Beeri, ni Nabasemathi abiti Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Nansho yayo manyoopani ayo, yahohelha ichuku mmamirimani mwa Naisaka ni Narabeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s1">Naisaka anowaavaha ibarakha Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Naisaka vaari aya anolhuvanlhe, miitho aya ahoonaka, aheehana Naesau, mwaamwanaya mulhupalhe, ni weerelha, “Mwaamwanaka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Naesau nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo thithi, kinowiiwelhelhani!”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Naisaka nkayeera, “Mii kiholhuvalha, kihichuwelhaka mena nihuku naka no ukhwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Paahi nkusheke ikaruma chinyu cho ulhupattelha, yaani nigonera no miupa ni muura inyu, nrwee wiithuphini mwanlhupatte mwannama, nkiwiihere. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Tho, nkaapelheke yolhia, inokichivelha chinene ilhe, kilhie, kuulhapelhelheni kihinaya ukhwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Kumbe ikatema Naisaka voolhumacha aya vawo, Narabeka aari ewelhelhaka. Paahi etu Naesau vaarweelhe aya wiithuphini ulhupattani, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Narabeka aheerelha anaya Nayakhobo wiira, “Kiheewa athumwaninyu yeerelhaka onninyu Naesau <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />wiira, ‘nrwee mwanlhupatte mwannama, nkaapelheke yolhia inokichivelha ilhe, kilhie, kuulhapelhelheni ibarakha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, kihinaya ukhwa.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Vano etu mwaamwanaka, ukiiwelhelheke, urumelhelheke ittu inohalha aka uhimeria iyo. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Urweeke uri nkutiro wo ipuri wakiwiihere ashipuri elhi o unenevacha, kaaterekhelhe athumwaninyu yolhia yo uchiva, inaachivelha aya chinene. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Yamalhaka waarwehelheke athumwana ayo alhie, olhapelhelhe ibarakha ahinaya ukhwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Nansho Nayakhobo nkayeerelha anumwanaya Narabeka ayo, “Muupuwelheke wiira amunna Naesau, iruttu aya yo mapururu menchi, ni mii akirina. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Veekinaka athumwanaka ayo anokaapaapelha, vavawo mii kinookhalha thoko kinowaathepiacha. Paahi etu kinowiithapaniha badala yo upatta ibarakha.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Anumwanaya ayo nkayeera, “Mwaamwanaka, uthapana wao uwo ukipatteke mii, uwe upangeke chinre aka chiyo, wakiwiihereke ashipuri ayo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaarwa, nkaakusha ashipuri elhi, nkaawiiha wa anumwanaya, ni ayo nkayaapia yolhia yo uchiva, yolhia yaachivelha aya Naisaka, athumwanaya ayo.<verse eid="GEN 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Yamalhekeru, Narabeka ahokusha ikuwo chorera chi Naesau, mwaamwanaya mulhupalhe uyo, chaarina aya vawani vawo, nkayaawariha Nayakhobo mwaamwanaya mwankani uyo.<verse eid="GEN 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Nkayaavilhikelha nrapalha no ashipuri alhe mmiononi ni nshikoni. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Amalhihekeru, nkayaavaha yolhia yo uchiva ilhe ni nkatte waapelhe aya ulhe.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaakelha mpaani waarumpe aya athumwanaya, nkayeehana, “Thithi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Mmmh! Apani inyuva?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Mii, Esau, mwaamwaninyu o nttara. Kihopanga thoko chinre inyu wo ukiruma chiyo. Paahi etu, thithi, munkweke nkhalheke, nkhureke inama kiivilhe aka iyo, nkivahe ibarakha chiyo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Nansho Naisaka nkayaakoha, “Mwinre chani wo wiiva inama wo waakuvia chitema thoko chiicho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu ahokivahera.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Phi vavawo Naisaka verenlhe aya Nayakhobo, “Mwaamwanaka, uchushereke etu kuwaapapelhe kichuwelhe wo ikekhiaye wiira phi uweva mwaamwanaka Esau ama kuhii.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Nayakhobo nkayaachushera wa athumwanaya, Naisaka, ni ayo nkayaapapelha, nkayeera, “Nlhove ninyu niri thoko na Yakhobo, nansho miono chinyu chiri thoko cha Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Khayaachuwenlhe ukhalhawaya miono chaya chaari cho mapururu menchi thoko a Naesau, onnaya. Paahi etu nkayaachokholha waavaha ibarakha, <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />nansho nkayaakoha tho, “Chani, wo ikekhiaye uweva mwaamwanaka Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Ni ayo Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo thithi, phi mii.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Paahi athumwanaya nkayeera, “Ukiwiihereke etu inama wiivilhe awo iyo kikhure, kuuvahe ibarakha mwaamwanaka.” Nayakhobo nkayaawiha yolhia iyo, ni ayo nkayaalhia. Nkaavahiya tho ni idivai ni iyo nkaawuria. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Amalhihekeru, Naisaka nkayeera, “Uchushereke vaa mwaamwanaka, ukikumbatireke.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaachusherera athumwanaya ni waakumbatira, ni athumwanaya ayo vaanunkhe aya nihiriri no inama nkuwoni mwaya mmo, yahaavaha ibarakha yeeraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Nkoonani, nihiriri no unukhelha no mwaamwanaka nno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">niri thoko imata ivahiye ibarakha ni Apwiiya Nlhuku!<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Nlhuku omichereni ukame wo wiirimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">ovaheni ittaya yo chaayira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">choolhia ni idivai yinchi.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Attu o makosho onkhaye avareke ntheko inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">ni ilhapo chukhoromelheni ni uthimichani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Mwaataware ashihima inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">achishaana ashilhopwana a anumwaninyu oworomelhekeni, othimicheni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Kila noulhavani, alhaviyeke mwanene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">kila nouvahani ibarakha, avahiyeke ibarakha!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naesau ni ayo anoovekelha ibarakha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Naisaka vaamalhinhe aya waavaha ibarakha Nayakhobo, ni ayo vaathama aya va athumwanaya vawo, Naesau onnaya Nayakhobo, ahohokolhia waakenlhe aya ulhupattani. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Naesau ni ayo nkayaapia yolhia yo uchiva ni waarwehelha athumwanaya, nkayeera, “Haya thithi, munkweke etu nkhureke inama kilhupantte aka iyo, wiira nkivahe ibarakha!”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Nansho Naisaka nkayaakoha, “Inyuva apani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Naesau nkayaakhulha, “Mii Esau, mwaamwaninyu o nttara.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Vavawo Naisaka nkayaathukumelha yoovaka chinene, nkayeera, “Phi mpani etu ulhe lhupantte ni ukiwiihera inama ulhe, ni mii nkakaakhura uweva uhinaaya uwa? Tho, kihomalha ummaha ibarakha, eiyo, hopatta ibarakha!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Naesau veewilhe aya malhove a athumwanaya ayo, ahokhuwelha yunlhaka ni weerelha athumwanaya ayo, “Thithi, chonte, nkivaheke ni mii ibarakha chiyo!” <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Nansho Naisaka nkayeera, “Nhima awo ahowa va nkaakithepiacha, hokusha etu ibarakha awo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Naesau nkayeera, “Phi nlhatu etu nineehaniya awe Yakhobo! Hokithepiacha velhi. Achokhonlhe ukusha uyulhupalhe aka wo ukhalha mwaana o nttara, ni vano hokusha ibarakha chaka.” Eera chiicho, ukhalhawaya nchina na Yakhobo maana aya, “Ntu o woothacha.” Paahi nkayaakoha athumwanaya ayo, “Chani khankihalhihenlhe ibarakha iriyoothe?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Naisaka nkayaakhulha, “Kihommaha Yakhobo ikuru yo utawarani, ni ummaha achihima inyu onkhaye akhalhe phi anamitheko awe. Kihommaha ibarakha yo choolhia ni idivai. Kuupangelheke ittu yaani etu, uwe mwaamwanaka?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Naesau nkayeerelha athumwanaya, “Ana kwaani thithi mwaarini ibarakha imoka yeyo tu? Nkivaheke ni mii ibarakha thithi!” Nkayonlha ikutto yulhupalhe.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Paahi Naisaka, athumwanaya, nkayeera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Mapuro awo anowa ukhalha utayi uhiri ichayira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">utayi uhinomicheriya ukame wo wiirimu.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />“Unohalha ukhalha wo ukhulhuvelha uphanga wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Unoorumiya mitheko ni nhima awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">nansho vanohalha awo ukulhuphuwa vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">unowa wuntha nikonkwa no vashikoni wao.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Paahi, Naesau nkayaavenga Nayakhobo wo nlhatu no ibarakha yaavahiye aya ni athumwanaya. Nkayaachukulha munrimani wo wiira, “Mahuku o mattanga a athithi vanohalha aya umalha, phi nowa aka umwiiva nhima aka Yakhobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Nansho Narabeka vaachuwenlhe aya ittu yaachukulha aya Naesau, aheehana Nayakhobo ni weerelha, “Uhiittialhe, munnawo Esau neevaha nrima wo ulhakelha wiira owiive. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Paahi etu mwaamwanaka, ukiiwelhelheke. Uthameke uttawelheke wa arokoraka Nalaabani, Uharani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Waakhalhaneke mpaka ichuku yo munnawo iyo vanohalha aya utondova. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Yatondovaka, vanohalha awe ulhiyalha ittu umpangenlhe awo vawo, kinonruma ntu awe ohokolhosha. Nlhatuni etu kikhwelhiye ni inyu mwaatti o yelhi va nihuku nimoka?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naisaka anowaaruma Nayakhobo arwee wa Nalaabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Narabeka nkayeerelha Naisaka, “Akirina mpuha mena vanokhalha aka va, wo nlhatu wo alha ashithiyana Ahiti elhi a Esau alha. Yakhalhaka etu Yakhobo ni uyo nonthelha nthiyana Nhiti, nambaya kikhwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Paahi Naisaka yaheehana Nayakhobo, nkayaavaha ibarakha, nkaalhehera yeeraka, “Nhinthelhe nthiyana riyoothe Nkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Nrweeke etu Upadan aramu, wa apwiiya inyu Nabethueli, wowo mwanthelheke mwalhi mmoka, mwaamwana a athatha inyu Nalaabani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Apwiiya Nlhuku o machiri ovaherekeni mwaapatteke ashaana enchi ni wunchereria, nkhalhe athumwanaya attu enchi chinene ahinaalhakelhia. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Ovahekeni ibarakha inyuva vamoka ni iyari inyu thoko ibarakha chaavahiye aya Aburahimu, ntaware ilhapo nnokhalha inyu vano thoko nlheto ilha, Nlhuku yaavahilhe aya Aburahimu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Paahi Naisaka nkayaalheha Nayakhobo, ni ayo nkayaarwaa Upadan aramu wa Nalaabani, anaaya Nabethueli, ntu o Uaramu, mwanrokoraya Narabeka, anumwanaya Nayakhobo ni Naesau ayo.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naesau anonthelha nthiyana o neraru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Naesau aheewa wiira Naisaka ahaavaha ibarakha Nayakhobo ni waaruma arwee athelhe Upadan aramu, tho vaalhapelhelha aya ibarakha vawo, ahaachiichiha wiira ahinthelhe nthiyana Nkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Ahochuwelha tho wiira, Nayakhobo aheewelhelha anumwanaya ni athumwanaya, manyanaangoro aya nkayaarwaa Upadan aramu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Paahi Naesau nkayaachuwelha wiira athumwanaya khanaattuna manyaathiyana o Ukanaani ukhalha ahokohi aya. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Chiichammo etu, Naesau ahorwaa wa Naishmaeli anaaya Aburahimu, nkayanthelha Mahalathi biti Ishmaeli, mwanrokoraya Nanebayothi, ukhalha ahanu aya o neraru.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itora i Nayakhobo vaari aya Ubetheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Nayakhobo ahothama Ubeer Sheba, nkayaalhukama Uharani.<verse eid="GEN 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Vaaphilhe aya vakittu, nkayaarupa vavawo ukhalhawaya nchuwa naheelha. Nkayaakusha nlhuku nimoka no vavawo vakittu vawo, nkayeesha wuuthi muru, nkayaarupelha. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Nkayaalhoha itora. Ntorani mmo nkayoona nivato neemeshiye velhaponi, umuru niphiyaka wiirimu. Minepa o wiirimu yaari akhuruwachaka ni uwelha vanivatoni vawo. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Nkayoona Apwiiya Nlhuku, aneemenlhe vakhiviru waya, ni ayo, yeerelhaka, “Mii phi mii, Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a Aburahimu athumwaninyu, ni Nlhuku a Naisaka. Ilhapo inorupelha inyu ilha, kinouvahani inyuva vamoka ni iyari inyu yonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Iyari inyu inookhalha yinchi thoko ntukurukhu no velhaponi. Ni ayo anowa uwanelha kila vakittu, uneelha nchuwa, unosha nchuwa, uchulhu ni uchawa. Wo iphiro inyu, milhoko cha attu chonkhaye cho velhaponi chinoovahiya ibarakha. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Muupuwelheke, mii kiri vamoka ni inyu, kinoushungani uriwoothe unokelha inyu, ni uhokolhoshani ilha ilhapo ilha. Akinoohiyani mpaka vanohalha aka utimiriha malhehano kinouhimeriakani alha.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Yamalhekeru, Nayakhobo nkayonkwa, nkayeera, “Wo ikekhiaye Apwiiya Nlhuku ari vava vakittu va, ni mii kaari kihichuwelhaka!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayoova ni wiira, “Va vakittu va vowoopiha chinene! Wo ikekhiaye va, phi inupa ya Nlhuku ni nlhako wo wiirimu.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Nkayonkwa wichishuru, nkayaakusha nlhuku naarupenlhe aya wuuthi muru nne, nkayeesha ukhalha nipoto no wuupuwelhiya vavawo vakittu vawo, nkaamiinelha makhura vachulhu waya ukhalha no Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Nkayeehana vavawo vakittu vawo, Betheli, maana aya “Inupa ya Nlhuku,” nansho nchina naya no khalhayi naari Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Amalhiheke, nkayeesha ishaani yeeraka, “Yakhalhaka uweva Nlhuku unookhalha vamoka ni mii ni ukishunga munkwahani mwaka, wakivahaka yolhia ni ikuwo <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />wiira kiwe kaahokolhia uwani wa athumwanaka salama, paahi, inyuva Apwiiya Nlhuku nnookhalha phi Nlhuku aka. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Ni va vaneemesha aka nlhuku thoko nipoto no wupuwelha va nna, vanookhalha vakittu wo ulhapelha uwe Nlhuku, ni mii kinouvaha mpatta wo khumi wo chittu chonkhaye chinohalha awo ukivaha.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anoophiya wa Nalaabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Nayakhobo ahothepa weeta nkwaha aya, nkayaaphiya ilhapo cha attu o unosha nchuwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Gafula nkayoona ilhushi uthakoni, ni vachereshere aya mikutiro miraru cho ikhondoro chineettuwilhe. Ikhondoro chaari chiwurihiyaka maashi vavawo valhushi vaakhunelhiye nlhuku nulhupalhe vawo. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Wo ikawaida, mikutiro chonkhaye cho ikhondoro vaakumaanacha aya, achunga ayo phi ikatema yaapirikishacha aya nlhuku nno vamoka, upatakulha valhushi vawo, ni ikhondoro chiyo khuwuriaka maashi. Chamalhaka uwuria, kuhokolhoshaka tho nlhuku nno.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Nayakhobo nkayaakoha achunga ayo, “Ashilhoko aka, nnnokhuma uyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Nkayaakhulhiya, “Ninokhuma Uharani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Nkayaakoha tho, “Chani, nhaachuwelha Nalaabani, uchuulhu wa Nanahori?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Nkayaakhulhiya, “Nihaachuwelha.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Nkayaathepa ukoha, “Chani anowungwelhelha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Tho, nkayaakhulhiya, “Anowungwelhelha, ata mwaamwanaya mwanthiyana, Raheli, ulhe nowa vava ni ikhondoro chawe.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Vavawo Nayakhobo nkayeerelhacha, “Kinoona wiira bado uthana, kuhii ikatema yo uthothokaniha ikhondoro vamoka, paahi etu mwaawuriheke maashi nrweeke mwaalhihacheke.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Nansho manyaattu ayo nkayeeracha, “Khaninooria upanga chiicho mpaka mihuwo chonkhaye chiwe chaakumaana vamoka vaa, nlhuku ninapirikishiye, phi nohalha ihu uwurihacha maashi ikhondoro.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Nayakhobo vaari aya bado olhumanaka achunga o ikhondoro ayo, Raheli ahophiya ni ikhondoro cha athumwanawe, kwaani Raheli uyo phi aari aachunga ikhondoro chiyo. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Nayakhobo vaamwonne aya Raheli, biti Labani, mwaamwana a athatha aya, ni woona ikhondoro chi Nalaabani, ahorwaa ni upirikisha nlhuku nne valhushi vawo, nkaawuriha maashi ikhondoro cha athatha aya, Nalaabani. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Baada yo upanga chiicho, nkayankumbatira Raheli nkayonlha ikutto. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Nkayanhimeria Raheli wiira, yaari mwanchulhaya Nalaabani, athumwanawe Raheli, yaani mwaana a Narabeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Raheli nkaattimakacha nkaahokolhia uwani, uwaahimeriani athumwanawe.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Yeyo ikatema Nalaabani yeeweke mwaha u Nayakhobo, mwanchulhaya, ahottimakacha ni ayo urwaa uwekamelhani, nkayaakumbatira, ni waakharibisha uwannyaya. Nayakhobo nkayaahimiacha mwaha wonkhaye ukhumelhenlhe. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Nalaabani ni ayo nkayeera, “Wo ikekhiaye, inyuva mwa alhoko aka, iphome aka!” Nayakhobo nkayaakhalha wowo mweri mmoka.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anowaathelha achishaana ashithiyana a Nalaabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Nihuku nimoka Nalaabani yaheerelha Nayakhobo, “Inyuva mwa alhoko aka, nansho yeyo khirini maana wiira nnohalha uvara ntheko aka wo chiicho, kinoulhivani. Nhimieke etu, nnothanana kuulhivekenini?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Nalaabani ahanaa ashaana ashithiyana elhi, mulhupalhe eehaniya Lea ni o nkani ehaniya Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea ari o miitho orera, nansho Raheli ahothepa, ari mwalhi orera, o ikhove yorera chinene.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Nayakhobo nkayanttuna chinene Raheli, paahi nkayeerelha Nalaabani wiira, “Kinoovara ntheko uwaninyu iyaakha saba wiira nkivahe Raheli, mwaamwaninyu mwankani ulha, kinthelhe.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Nalaabani nkayeera, “Aye, nambaya kuthelhiheni Raheli, kuliko unthelhiha wa ntu riyoothe nkina. Nthepeke ukhalha ni mii etu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaavara ntheko wa Nalaabani iyaakha saba wo nlhatu no unthelha Raheli, nansho yoonaka chechiyo iyaakha chiyo thoko mahuku vakani, wo nlhatu no unttuna Raheli chinene.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Iyaakha saba chatimireke, Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nalaabani, “Iyaakha chihotimira, nkithelhiheke etu ahanu aka ayo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Paahi Nalaabani nkayaaterekha yolhia ni waalhalhia attu onkhaye o wowo. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Nansho uhiyu, Nalaabani nkayankusha Lea, mwaamwanaya mulhupalhe ni waarwehelha Nayakhobo. Nayakhobo nkayanrupana. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Nalaabani nkayankumiha Zilpa, namitheko aya nthiyana wiira akhalhe namitheko a Lea. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Wichishu washeeke, Nayakhobo nkayaathuthuwa vaachuwenlhe aya wiira kaahiwe Raheli aari Lea! Paahi, ahorwaa wa Nalaabani anathunanlhe, nkayaakoha, “Nkipannge chani! Akaavanre ntheko inyu wo nlhatu no unthelha Raheli? Woonaka nhokithepiacha etu?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Nalaabani nkayaakhulha, “Velhaponi wihu va, khaninopanga chiicho, khavanooria unthelhiha o nkani, munnawe hinaya uthelhiya. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Muntimiriheke Lea mahuku awe saba o ukhalha mpaani ayo thoko chinothaniya aya, ni mii kinouvahani Raheli, nansho wo uvara ntheko wo iyaakha saba chikina.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Nayakhobo nkayaarumelhelha. Ni vaamalhinhe aya utimiriha mahuku saba wa Lea, Nalaabani ahaavaha Nayakhobo Raheli, mwaamwanaya o nkani akhalhe ahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Nalaabani nkayankumiha Bilha, namitheko aya nthiyana akhalhe namitheko a Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Nayakhobo nkayanrupana Raheli ni uyo. Nansho nkayanttuna chinene Raheli umpwaha Lea. Paahi nkayaavara ntheko wa Nalaabani iyaakha saba chikina.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anowaapatta ashaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Apwiiya Nlhuku vonne aya wiira Nalea ari ahittuniyaka chinene, ahaavaha ashaana, nansho Naraheli khaayara. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Nalea nkayaarupalha irukulhu, nkayeethaphulha mwaana mwanlhopwana, nkayammaha nchina nawe Robeni, maana aya “Ahoona uhuva waka.” Ukhalhawaya yeera, “Apwiiya Nlhuku aheewa ichuku aka, wo ikekhiaye vano owannyaka anookittuna.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Nkayaarupalha irukulhu ikina tho, nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, nkayammaha nchina nawe Simeoni, maana aya “Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokivaha mwaana.” Ukhalhawaya yaari yeeraka “Apwiiya Nlhuku aheewa chineera aka wo upangelhiya ichimwa, paahi ahokivaha mwaana nkina mwanlhopwana.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Nkayaarupalha irukulhu tho, nkayeethaphulha mwaana mwanlhopwana nkayammaha nchina nawe Lawi, maana aya “Ulhutaana.” Munrimani mwaya yaari yeeraka, “Owannyaka vano anolhutaana ni mii, ukhalhawaya kihaayarelha ashaana ashilhopwana araru.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Nkayaarupalha irukulhu ikina tho, nkayeethaphulha mwaana mwanlhopwana. Munrimani nkayoopuwelha wiira, “Ulha nkwaha ulha kinowaatotopelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.” Paahi nkayammaha nchina nawe Yuda, nkayaahiya uyara.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Naraheli vonne aya wiira khanaayarelha Nayakhobo ashaana, ahoonelha ihache Nalea, arokoraya. Nkayeerelha Nayakhobo, “Nkivahe ashaana ni mii, yaahirieke chiicho, kinookhwa!”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Nayakhobo nkayaathunalhelha Naraheli chinene wo nlhatu wo nenno nlhove nno, nkayeerelha, “Chani, kwaani mii phi kushilhe ikuru ya Nlhuku othuwilheni ashaana?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Naraheli nkayaakhulha, “Namitheko aka nthiyana Bilha haawo. Munrupaneke etu aayare ashaana, wiira ni mii kaapatte ashaana wo iphiro awe, ni mii kikhalhe ni iyari.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Paahi etu Naraheli nkaavaha Nayakhobo namitheko aya nthiyana, Bilha, akhalhe ahanu aya, ni ayo nkayanrupana. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Bilha nkaarupalha irukulhu, nkaayarelha Nayakhobo mwaana mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Naraheli nkayeera, “Nlhuku hokipangelha ittu yoombone, heewa ichuku aka, hokivaha mwaana mwanlhopwana.” Nkayammaha nchina nawe Dani, maana aya, “hokipangelha moombone.” <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Bilha namitheko nthiyana a Naraheli nkaarupalha irukulhu tho, nkannyara mwaana o nayelhi mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Vavawo Naraheli nkayeera, “Kihaatakana indewo ni mwanrokoraka, ni mii kihonkottolha.” Nkayammaha nchina nawe Naftali, maana aya, “waatakana.”<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Nalea vonne aya wiira ahohiya uyara, ahonkusha Zilpa namitheko aya nthiyana ni waavaha Nayakhobo wiira akhalhe ahanu aya. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilpa nkaayarelha Nayakhobo mwaana mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Nalea nkayeera, “Kihoreeriya.” Paahi nkayammaha nchina nawe Gadi, maana aya, “ureeriya.” <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilpa namitheko a Nalea, ahaayarelha Nayakhobo mwaana nkina o nayelhi mwanlhopwana.<verse eid="GEN 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Nalea nkayeera, “Kihoteelhiya chinene! Vano manyoopani anookihaana o uteelhiya.” Paahi nkayammaha mwaana uyo nchina nawe Asheri, maana aya, “uteelhiya.”<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Ikatema imoka yo nlhalha wo ingaano, Robeni ahorwaa umatani, wowo nkaapatta mwiri weeriya wiira manyoopani awuriaka anoorupalha irukulhu, nkaawiihera anumwanawe. Naraheli vonne aya, nkayeerelha Nalea, “Nkunthelhe mwiri uwiihilhe awe mwaamwaninyu uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Nansho Nalea nkayaakhulha wo uchacha, “Chani nnaanyihera ittu ikani ukithurulha owannyaka, ni vano nnothanana ukithurulha mwiri wo mwaamwanaka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Naraheli nkayeera, “Mwakunthelhaka mwiri wo mwaamwaninyu, Nayakhobo anoorupa lhelho uwaninyu wo malhivo o yoyo mwiri wo mwaamwaninyu uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Paahi uchechilho Nayakhobo vaahokolhia aya umatani, Nalea aheemelha weekamelha, nkayeerelha owannyaya, “Lhelho, lazima nrupe uwannyaka, kwaani kiholhiva, malhivo o mwiri wo mwaamwanaka.” Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaarupa wa Nalea nenno nihuku nno.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Nlhuku nkewelhelha ulhapelha wa Nalea, ni ayo nkayaarupalha irukulhu ni waayarelha Nayakhobo mwaana o nethanu mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Nalea nkayeera, “Nlhuku hokilhiva, ukhalhawaya kahaavaha owannyaka namitheko aka nthiyana.” Nkayammaha mwaana uyo nchina na Isakari, maana aya “Nlhuku hokilhiva.” <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Nalea nkayaarupalha irukulhu tho, nkaayarelha Nayakhobo mwaana o sita mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Nkayeera, “Nlhuku hokivaha izawadi yoombone. Vano owannyaka anookihelhelha, ukhalhawaya kihaayarelha achishaana sita ashilhopwana.” Paahi nkayammaha nchina nawe Zabuloni, maana aya, “izawadi.” <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Kaanyuma nkayannyara mwaana mwanthiyana, nkayammaha nchina nawe Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Baada yo vavawo Nlhuku ahoopuwelha Naraheli, nkayaarumelhelha ulhapelha waya, nkaavahera ashaana. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Naraheli nkayaarupalha irukulhu, nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, nkayeera, “Nlhuku hothamiha ishoni aka.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Paahi nkayammaha mwaana uyo nchina na Yusufu, yeeraka “Apwiiya Nlhuku akuncherereke mwaana nkina mwanlhopwana.” Ukhalhawaya nchina Yusufu maana aya, “nkuncherereke nkina.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anoopatta nhakhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Baada yo uyaria Yusufu, Nayakhobo aherelha Nalaabani, “Nkihiyeke vano kihokolhie uwani etu, wiilhaponi waka.<verse eid="GEN 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />“Nkivaheke manyaahanu aka ni achishaana kaapantte aka wo uvara ntheko uwaninyu, kaarwaane uwani. Ukhalhawaya nhochuwelha wiira, kihovara ntheko inyu rata.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Nalaabani nkayaakhulha, “Nkivaheke nipesha ni mii etu kulhumache. Kihochuwelha wo ulhamulhelhiya wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokivaha ibarakha wo nlhatu winyu. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Nromolheke etu malhivo anothanana inyu kuulhiveni ni mii kinouvahani.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Nayakhobo nkayeera, “Inyu mwaanene nhochuwelha chinre aka wo uvara ntheko inyu, tho nhochuwelha chinre aka wo waashunga ashinama inyu rata. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ukhalhawaya kihinaya uwa, nhakhu inyu waari vakani, nansho toka vaawilhe aka, nhakhu inyu uhonchereria chinene. Ni Apwiiya Nlhuku ahouvahani ibarakha chinene kila waarwelhe aka. Vano etu ni mii kirwee kaashunge ashilhoko aka.”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Nalaabani nkayaakoha Nayakhobo, “Kuulhivekeni ittu yaani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Nhikivahe ittu iriyoothe, nansho mwakipangelhaka ittu imoka ilha, kinoothepa waashunga ashinama inyu. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Nkihiyeke kivire iriyari ya ashinama inyu onkhaye lhelho va, kaahaulhanihe wo kila nkutiro, ikhondoro cho manepanepa ni cho marayirayi, kila ikhondoro yoripa, ni kila ipuri yo manepanepa ama yo manepa. Yayo phi nohalha ukhalha malhivo aka. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Paahi mahuku anowa, ukhulhuvelhiya waka unowoonia mwaari vanohalha inyu woona ittu ikilhivilhe inyu. Ipuri iriyoothe ihiri ni manepanepa ama manepa, ama ikhondoro iriyoothe ihiri yoripa yooniaka munkutironi mwa ashinama aka, yoyo nowa ukhalha o wiiyiya.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Nalaabani nkayeera, “Aye! Yiirieke thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha chiyo.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Nansho nenno nihuku Nalaabani nkayaarwa nkayaahaulhaniha mabeberu o marayirayi ni o manepanepa onkhaye, ipuri chithiyana chonkhaye cho manepanepa ni cho manepa, kila mwannama o telha mwiiruttuni, ni kila ikhondoro yoripa nkeesha alhitelhelhiye ni achishaana aya. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Nalaabani nkayaarwa vakittu wo nkwaha wo mahuku mararu, nkayetenga ni Nayakhobo. Nayakhobo nkayaahalha aashungaka ashinama a Nalaabani yaahalhenlhe.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaakusha ikopo chikithi cho miri cho mlubna, mlozi ni mwaramoni, nkayaatulhacha wiira mistari choteelha choonie kila ikopo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Nkayeemeshacha ikopo chaatunlhe aya chiyo umihoolho wa ashinama valhushi vaawuriacha aya maashi. Ni ukhalhawaya ashinama ayo ahowelhanacha ikatema vaawuriacha aya maashi, ahorupalhacha irukulhu. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Yaarupalhanche irukulhu umihoolho wo ikopo chiyo, paahi etu nkaayaracha ashinama o marayirayi, o manepa ni o manepanepa.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Nayakhobo nkayaahaulhaniha ipuri ni ikhondoro chiyo, nkaaholhelha waari ashinama o marayirayi ni oripa u nkutiro wa Nalaabani. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo, Nayakhobo ahopatta nkutiro wa ashinama wawaya, mena khayaathakanihilhe ni nkutiro wa Nalaabani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Nkawaakhalha wiira, kila vaaphiya aya ikatema yo ashinama o machiri urupalha irukulhu, Nayakhobo aheesha ikopo umihoolho waya vaawuriacha aya maashi, wiira arupalhihiye irukulhu umihoolho wo ikopo chiyo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Nansho khayeenshe ikopo chiyo umihoolho wo ashinama o uhuperiacha ikatema vaawuriacha aya maashi ni urupalhihiya irukulhu. Baada yo vavawo etu ashinama o uhuperiacha ayo nkayaakhalha a Nalaabani, ni ashinama o machiri nkayaakhalha a Nayakhobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Paahi etu, Nayakhobo nkayaakhalha ntu o nhakhu mwinchi chinene, nkayaakhalha ni mikutiro chulhupalhe cho ashinama, anamitheko ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, ingamiya ni iphuta.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anowaatoroka Nalaabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayeewa wiira ashaana ashilhopwana a Nalaabani ahochukulhacha ni wiira, “Nayakhobo ahokusha kila ittu ya athumwanihu, phi nre aya etu wo ukhalha ni nhakhu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Nayakhobo ahochuwelha tho wiira, Nalaabani khayaari yaalhohaka thoko khalhayi vawo. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayakhobo, “Nhokolhieke wiilhaponi wa manyaathumwaninyu ni wa ashilhoko inyu, ni mii kinookhalha vamoka ni inyu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaaruma attu wiira Nalea ni Naraheli yeehanachiye, ni ayo nkayaarwaa uthakoni waalhiha aya ashinama. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Nayakhobo nkayeerelhacha, “Kinoona wiira athumwaninyu khanokilhoha tho thoko khalhayi valhe. Nansho Nlhuku a athumwanaka ri vamoka ni mii. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Nhochuwelha wiira kihovara ntheko wa athumwaninyu wo machiri aka onkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Inakhalhaka chiicho, ahokithepiacha ni urukunusha malhivo aka mikwaha khumi. Nansho Nlhuku kaahiyerenre wiira akipangelhe chittu cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Kila nkwaha athumwaninyu vaakirenlhe aya wiira, ‘Ashinama o manepa phi nohalha ukhalha malhivo inyu,’ paahi etu nkutiro wonkhaye wahaayara ashinama o manepanepa. Ni kila venre aya, ‘Ashinama o marayirayi phi nohalha inyu ulhiviya,’ ashinama onkhaye aayanre ashinama o marayirayi. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Phi iphiro Nlhuku chaakunshe awe ashinama a athumwaninyu, ni ukivaha mii.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Ikatema yo nlhalha wo urupalha irukulhu ashinama kaholhoha, ntorani mmo kahoona mabeberu onkhaye aawenlhe ashinama ashithiyana yaari o marayirayi, o manepanepa ni o manepa. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Tho ntorani mmo, Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Nlhuku wahokulhumana, vaakihanne aya, ‘Nayakhobo,’ ni mii nkakaakhulha, ‘Aah, mii va!’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Nkawaakiirelha, ‘Mwooneke mabeberu onkhaye anaawelha ashinama ashithiyana ayo o marayirayi, o manepanepa ni o manepa. Inopangia chiicho, ukhalhawaya kihoona chinre inyu wo upangelhiya ni Nalaabani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Mii phi Nlhuku okhumelhenlheni Ubetheli ulhe, vakittu veemeshilhe inyu nlhuku no uwupushani, nkamwaamiinelha makhura vachulhu ni weesha ishaani. Vano etu, nthameke ilha ilhapo ilha, nhokolhieke uwani uyarelhe inyu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Naraheli ni Nalea nkayaakhulha Nayakhobo wiira, “Hii nirinani, khanirina ittu iriyoothe yo uhiyeriya unupani wa athumwanihu! <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Yayo vano anonoona hii thoko alheto, ukhalhawaya ahonithumiha. Ni nhakhu upantte aya uyo phi uyo anolhia aya uyo. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Wo ikekhiaye, nhakhu wonkhaye Nlhuku ukunshe awe ukhuma wa athumwanihu phi wawihu hii, vamoka ni achishaana ihu. Paahi etu mpangeke ittu ilheheriye inyu ni Nlhuku iyo!”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaapanganika wo nkwaha, nkayaawelhihacha achishaana aya ni manyaahanu aya vachulhu ingamiya. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Nkaakusha ashinama aya vamoka ni nhakhu wonkhaye waapantte aya Upadan aramu, nkaachokholha nkwaha wo uhokolhia Ukanaani, wa athumwanaya, Naisaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Nansho ahinaya uthama, Nalaabani yaari anakenlhe utturiani mapururu ikhondoro chaya. Paahi Naraheli ahopatta nipesha no wiiya isinyago cho milhuku cha athumwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Wo uthepa vavawo, Nayakhobo ahaathepiacha Nalaabani, ntu o Uaramu, wo uhaalheha vaathama aya. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Paahi Nayakhobo ahokusha nhakhu aya wonkhaye, nkayaatoroka. Baada yo ulhapuwa mwolhoko wo Yufrati aholhukama ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Ugileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nalaabani anowaattwara Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Mahuku mararu kaanyuma, Nalaabani ahohimeriya wiira Nayakhobo ahotoroka. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Paahi Nalaabani ahaakusha ashilhoko aya ni waattwara Nayakhobo wo mahuku saba, nkayaaphwanya umiakoni, Ugileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Nansho uhiyu, Nlhuku ahaakhumelhelha Nalaabani, ntu o Uaramu, ntorani ni weerelha, “Mwiishungeke, nholhumelhe Nayakhobo nlhove nirinoothe, nikhalhe norera ama no uhilhoka.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Paahi Nalaabani nkayaaphiya waari aya Nayakhobo. Yeyo ikatema iyo Nayakhobo yaari anamakilhe umwakoni. Nalaabani ni ayo vamoka ni ashilhoko aya nkayaamaka umiakoni Ugileadi wowo.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Phi vavawo Nalaabani verenlhe aya Nayakhobo, “Mpanngeni? Woonaka nhokithepiacha, nkamwaakusha achishaana aka thoko mateeka avariye ukhotoni? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Nlhatuni etu no utoroka wo nivitho, nkamwaathama wo uhikilheha, wiira kulheheni wo ushangarara ni uwiipelhani ichipo, ikoma ni chikwesha? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Woonaka khankivahilhe nipesha no waavaha moono wo waalheha achishaana aka ni ashichulhu aka? Wo ikekhiaye nihopanga ittu yo uhilhoka! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Kaanooria uthuriani, nansho Nlhuku a athumwaninyu ahokikhumelhelha uhiyu wo lhelho ulha, nkaakamuka eeraka, ‘Mwiishungeke, nholhumelhe Nayakhobo nlhove nirinoothe, nikhalhe norera ama no uhilhoka.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Kihochuwelha wiira nhotoroka wo nlhatu wo nnikwa wo uhokolhia uwaninyu wa athumwaninyu. Nansho nlhatuni etu no wiiya milhuku chaka?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Akohimenrieni ukhalhawaya koova wiira nnokithurulha achishaana inyu alha wo machiri. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Nansho riyoothe nnohalha inyu umphwanya nakunshe isinyago cho milhuku chinyu chiyo, yoyo hihiiye ukhalha nkumi! Mmihoolho wa alha ashilhoko ihu alha, mwooniheke ittu iriyoothe iri yawinyu, mmwiieke.” Nayakhobo khayaachuwenlhe wiira Naraheli ahokusha isinyago cho milhuku chi Nalaabani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Paahi Nalaabani nkayaakelha nnihemani mwa Nayakhobo, nnihemani mwa Nalea ni anamitheko ashithiyana elhi alhe, nkayaakhuriacha waavia nansho khayaaphwannye ittu. Nkayaakhuma nnihemani mwa Nalea ni ukelha nnihemani mwa Naraheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Paahi Naraheli phi ayo yaakunshe isinyago chiyo, nkayaavitha wuuthi ikuwo chaathalhiye vachulhu ingamiya, nkayaakhalhelha vachulhu vaya vawo. Nalaabani nkayaathotha nnihemani mwonkhaye, nansho khayaaphwannye ittu. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Vavawo Naraheli aheerelha athumwanaya, “Pole thithi, nhirushiye, akinooria weemelha umihoolho winyu, kiri mmahukuni mwaka.” Nalaabani nkayaathothathotha isinyago cho milhuku chaya, nansho khayaapantte ittu.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Nayakhobo nkayaarushiya, nkayaachukulha Nalaabani yeeraka, “Kittenkeni? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Nhaandhandhulhacha misigo chaka chonkhaye, chani mpantteni iri yawinyu? Mwooniheke etu, umihoolho mwa ashilhoko aka ni ashilhoko inyu, wiira anaamulhe hii attu elhi va! <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Kihoukhalhanani iyaakha makhumi melhi. Ni ikatema yonkhaye iyo, ikhondoro chinyu ni ipuri chinyu khachinarihariha irukulhu, wala akaahinthe ikhondoro n'dume no nkutiro winyu. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Akouwihenreni ata nkwaha mmoka mwannama eeviye ni nshene. Kila nkwaha yeyo ihasara iyo kaalhivihenre mii kimwanene. Nansho inyuva mwaakilhiviha wo uhiweha wiira yeiye uthana ama uhiyu! <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Kahovilhelha uvia nchuwa ni uririiya uhiyu wo uhirupa ikhove ata vakani.<verse eid="GEN 31:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />“Iyaakha makhumi melhi chonkhaye chi, chikhanlhe aka unupani winyu yaari chiicho. Kahovara ntheko inyu iyaakha khumi ni ncheshe wo nlhatu wo waavekha achishaana inyu elhi ashithiyana, nkakaashunga ashinama inyu iyaakha sita. Nansho inyuva mwahopitikushacha malhivo aka mikwaha khumi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Yakaari Nlhuku a athumwanaka Aburahimu, Nlhuku aapannge athumwanaka Naisaka athukumelhe, khaari vamoka ni mii, wo ikekhiaye mwankihiya kihokolhie uwani mathatharu. Nansho Nlhuku ahoona uhuva waka ni ntheko upannge aka wo miono chaka, nkoochacherani uhiyu wo lhelho ulha.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nalaabani ni Nayakhobo unowiiwananiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Vavawo Nalaabani nkayaakhulha Nayakhobo, “Achishaana ashithiyana alha awaka, ashaana alha awaka, ashinama alha awaka, ni chittu chonkhaye chinoona inyu chi chawaka. Nansho mii kinooria upanga ittu yaani vachulhu wa alha achishaana aka ashithiyana alha ni ashaana aayaranche aya alha?<verse eid="GEN 31:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />“Paahi etu niiwananeke mii ni inyuva, ikhalhe phi iphiro yo uhimiechesha malhehano variyari winyu ni mii.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaakusha nlhuku nkayeesha ukhalha nipoto no wuupuwelhiya malhehano aya.<verse eid="GEN 31:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Tho, Nayakhobo nkayeerelhacha ashilhoko aya wiira, “Nrokottacheke malhuku.” Ni ayo nkayaarokottacha malhuku ni weesha nifungu. Nkaayaakhalhacha ni ulhia yolhia vakhiviru nifungu no malhuku nno. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Nalaabani nkayeehana nenno nifungu no malhuku nno, Yegar sahadutha, maana aya “Nifungu no uhimiechesha.” Ni Nayakhobo nkayeehana Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Nalaabani nkayeera, “Nna nifungu no malhuku nna phi no uhimiechesha malhehano variyari winyu ni mii lhelho.” Paahi Nalaabani nkayeehana Galeedi, <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />tho nkayeehana nipoto nne, Mizpa yeeraka, “Apwiiya Nlhuku anishungeke vanohalha ihu ukhalha utayi wo uhoonana vawo. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Mwaatwarushaka achishaana aka ashithiyana alha, ama mwaathelhaka ashithiyana akina tho, paahi nchuwelheke wiira, khaawo ri o uhimiechesha variyari wihu, ahikhalhe Nlhuku mwanene.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Tho Nalaabani nkayeerelha Nayakhobo, “Mmweheke nna phi nifungu keemenshe aka ukhalha nipoto variyari winyu ni mii. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Nna nifungu nna phi uhimiechesha, ni nipoto nna phi uhimiechesha wiira, mii akinothupha nifungu nna uwa uwaninyu ukipangelha ittu yo uhilhoka. Ni wala inyuva nhithuphe nifungu nna ni nipoto nna uwa uwannyaka ukipangelhani ittu yo uhilhoka. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Nlhuku a Aburahimu ni Nlhuku a Nanahori noonaamulha.” Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaalhupelha wo nchina na Nlhuku a Naisaka, athumwanaya wiira anoovarechesha yayo malhehano ayo. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yamalheke, nkayaakumiha isadaka ya ashinama umwakoni uwo ni waalhalhia ashilhoko aya awe ulhiani yolhia. Baada yo ulhia, nkayaarupacha wowo.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Wichishuru washeekeru, Nalaabani yahonkwa, nkayaakumbatiracha ashichulhu aya ni achishaana aya, Nalea ni Naraheli, nkaavahacha ibarakha. Nkayaathama uhokolhia uwani.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anowiipanganisha ukumaana ni Naesau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaathepa urwaa nkwaha aya. Vaathepa aya urwaa nkayaakumaana minepa cho wiirimu cha Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Nayakhobo voonilhe aya minepa alhe nkeera, “Vaa phi vakittu vamakilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku!” Paahi nkayeehana vavawo vakittu vawo, Mahanaimu, maana aya “miphingo milhi cha Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Nayakhobo ahaaruma akarumiya yaaholhelhe urwaa Useiri, ilhapo yo Uedomu wa Naesau, munnaya. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Nkayaalhehera wiira, “Mwaahimerieke amunna Naesau wiira, Nayakhobo, namitheko inyu aneera, ‘Kihokhalha wa Nalaabani, ulhetoni mpaka nna. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Kihopatta ing'ope, iphuta, mikutiro cho ikhondoro ni anamitheko ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. Kinouwiherani nttenga ulha wiira nkoonelhe ikiriri.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Akarumiya ayo yahorwaa, nkayaahokolhia ni weerelha Nayakhobo wiira, “Nihophiya wa onninyu Naesau, ni ayo ari mphironi vano, anowa ni attu imia ncheshe uwiikamelhani.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Nayakhobo nkayoova chinene ni uchukulha munrimani. Paahi nkayaakawaniha attu yaarina aya ayo, ikhondoro, mihuwo chikina ni ingamiya, milhoko milhi. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Yaari yuupuwelhaka wiira, “Yakhalhaka Naesau anowa ni waatakana ni nlhoko mmoka, paahi nlhoko nkina unohalha uyo, unookulhuphuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Yamalheke, Nayakhobo nkayanlhepelha Nlhuku yeeraka, “Uwe Nlhuku a athumwanaka Aburahimu, Nlhuku a athumwanaka Naisaka! Inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku nkiirenlhe wiira kihokolhie wiilhaponi waka, wa ashilhoko aka, nkamwaakilheha wiira nnokipangelha moombone. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Mii akinophwanelhiya ata vakani, moombone o ukhulhuvelhiya winyu akipangenlhe inyu mii namitheko inyu. Vaalhapuwilhe aka mwolhoko wo Yorodani, kaari mathatharu yaahikhalhe ikopo, nansho vano kihanaa milhoko miilhi chilha. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Kinoulhepelhani wiira nkookholhe vano mmathathani mwa amunna Naesau, kwaani kinowoova wiira anonithuria ni uniiva hii onkhaye va, manyoopani vamoka ni ashaana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Nansho inyuva mwahokilheha wiira, nnookipangelha moombone ni wuncherera ayari aka akhalhe enchi thoko nhaava wo ibahari uhinaalhakelhia wo nlhatu no winchiva waya.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaarupa vavawo yoyo uhiyu uyo. Nkayaahaulha nhakhu aya wiira aavahe izawadi Naesau, onnaya, <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />chikhalhaka ipuri chithiyana imia piilhi ni mabeberu makhumi melhi, ikhondoro chithiyana imia piilhi ni madume makhumi melhi, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ingamiya makhumi mararu ni achishaana aya, ing'ope chithiyana makhumi ncheshe ni madume khumi, iphuta chithiyana makhumi melhi ni madume khumi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Nkayaavaha anamitheko aya, kila mmoka nkutiro awe, nkeerelhacha, “Nkiholhelheke uno nhiyaka inafasi variyari, nkutiro mmoka ni nkutiro nkina mumphingoni mmo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Nkanlhehera nashirongora aholhelhe uyo wiira, “Vanohalha inyu waakumaana amunna Naesau vawo, nkayookohani, ‘Inyuva anamitheko a apani? Nnokelha vayi? Alha ashinama alha a apani?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />inyuva mwaakhulheke, ‘Ulha nhakhu wa ahima inyu Nayakhobo, phi izawadi akuminhe aya uuvahani inyuva, pwiiya Naesau. Tho, Nayakhobo anene ayo arii utulhi uwo anoowa.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Tho, nkayaalhehera thoko chiicho wa nashirongora o nkutiro wo nayelhi ni wo neraru, ni akina onkhaye ayo, wiira, “Mwaahimerieke Naesau malhove thoko yayo vanohalha inyu waakumaana vawo. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Thoni, mwaahimerieke wiira, ‘Namitheko inyu Nayakhobo rii utulhi uwo noowa.’ ” Ukhalhawaya yoopuwelha wiira, “Veekinaka kinowaamaalhiha vanohalha aya upochera izawadi chinoholhelhiha aka chi. Ni vanohalha aka waakumaana vawo, anookipochera.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Paahi nkayaahoolhelhiha izawadi chaya chiyo, nansho anene ayo yoyo uhiyu uyo yaarumpe vaamakilhe aya vawo.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anoophathana Upenieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Yoyo uhiyu uyo, Nayakhobo ahonkwa, nkayaakusha manyaahanu aya elhi alhe, anamitheko ashithiyana elhi ni achishaana aya khumi ni mmoka, nkayaalhapuwa nshepa no Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Vaamanlhe aya waalhapusha mpaka uhito, aholhapusha chittu chonkhaye chaarina aya, <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />nansho anene ayo nkayaahalha vavawo vekha aya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Baada yo vavawo, ahowa ntu mmoka, nkanvarana ni ukottolhana mpaka mapikosha. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Ntu uyo vonne awe wiira khanooria waakottolha Nayakhobo, ahaattindaniha Nayakhobo iyunu vakhaukani, vaaphathana aya vawo. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Phi vavawo ntu ulhe verenlhe awe Nayakhobo, “Nkihiye kirwee, uhosha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Nansho Nayakhobo nkaamwiirelha, “Akinouhiya mena, mpaka ukivaheke ibarakha!” <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Ni uyo nkaakoha, “Nchina ninyu apani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Nayakhobo nkayaamwaakhulha, “nchina naka Yakhobo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Ntu ulhe nkeera, “Khannehaniya Yakhobo tho, nansho nneehaniyeke Israeli. Ukhalhawaya nhophathana ni Nlhuku ni attu, nkamwaakottolha.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Vavawo Nayakhobo nkayankoha, “Chonte, nkihimerieke etu nchina ninyu apani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Nansho uyo nkeera, “Ye ishiyani ukikoha nchina naka?” Nkaavaha ibarakha Nayakhobo. <verse eid="GEN 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Nayakhobo nkayeehana vavawo vakitu vawo, Penieli, maana aya “ikhove ya Nlhuku.” Ukhalhawaya yaari yeeraka, “Kihomwoona Nlhuku ikhove awe, ni mii akaakhwilhe.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Nchuwa nkanaasha ikatema Nayakhobo vaathama aya Upenieli, nkayaatumbelha veeta aya, wo nlhatu no uttindania iyunu. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Paahi phi nlhatu etu mpaka nna attu o Israeli ihinokhura aya nthinga wo nnyununi, ukhalhawaya ntu ulhe aattindaninhe Nayakhobo vayununi nkhaukani mwaya.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anokumaana ni Naesau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Paahi yamalheke vavawo, Nayakhobo ahoweha, nkayoona Naesau awaaka vamoka ni attu imia ncheshe. Vavawo Nayakhobo ahaamianiha achishaana aya, a Nalea ni a Naraheli, ni achishaana a anamitheko ashithiyana elhi alhe. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Nkeeshacha anamitheko ashithiyana ni achishaana aya uhoolho, Nalea ni achishaana aya variyari, Naraheli ni mwaamwanaya Yusufu, nkayaattwara utulhi. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Amalhihekeru, nkayaaholhelha, nansho ahinaya uphiya va onnaya vawo, ahooroma mpaka vathi mikwaha saba wooniha iheshima. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Paahi Naesau nkayaattimakacha ni weekamelha Nayakhobo, nkayaakumbatira, oyelhi nkayonlhacha. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Naesau vaawenhe aya ni woona manyoopani ni achishaana, yahokoha, “Phi apani yalha attu mwaattukanne inyu alha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Alha achishaana aka kivahilhe awe Nlhuku wo nnema wawe, akivahilhe mii namitheko inyu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Yamalheke, anamitheko ashithiyana alhe nkayaachusheracha vamoka ni achishaana aya, nkayooromacha. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Tho, Nalea nkayaawa vamoka ni achishaana aya, nkayooromacha. Nkaamalhihera Naraheli ni mwaamwanaya Yusufu, ni ayo nkayooromacha.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Phi vavawo Naesau vakonhe aya, “Ulha nkutiro wa ashinama ukumanne aka mphironi ulha phi ishiyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Kaawinhe wiira nkoonelhe ikiriri munna.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Nansho Naesau nkayeera, “Kihanaa nhakhu mwinchi mwanhima aka. Nhakhu inyu uyo ukhalheke wawinyu mwaanene.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Nayakhobo nkayeera, “Mena! Yakhalhaka wo ikekhiaye nhokipochera, paahi etu kinoulhepelhani wiira, mpochereke izawadi chaka. Wo ikekhiaye, woona ikhove inyu iri thoko woona ikhove ya Nlhuku, chinre inyu wo ukipochera wo nrima woombone chiyo. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Paahi kinoulhepelhani wiira, mpochereke izawadi kuwihenreakani chiyo, ukhalhawaya ata mii Nlhuku hokivaha nnema, ni mii kihanaa nhakhu mwinchi.” Nkayaakhanyereriha chinene, ni ayo nkayaapochera.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Naesau nkayeera, “Haya! Ngwee etu nirweeke, mii kinooholhelha.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Nansho Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Naesau, “Munna, inyu nhochuwelha wiira, ashaana alha bado ashikani, ni mihuwo chi chinowaamwiha. Vavawo tho, mii phi nothananiya wiira kaawehewehe, naattawihachaka ashinama alha ata wo nihuku nimoka, onkhaye anookhwacha. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Paahi kinoulhepelhani wiira, nholhelheke, ni mii kinouttwarani nrima, nrima, vakanivakani thoko ashinama alha chinohalha ya weeta, ni achishaana alha mpaka vanohalha aka uphiya uwaninyu Useiri uwo.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Vavawo Naesau nkayeera, “Nambaya etu kuhiyereni attu aka akina mwaattukane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Nansho Nayakhobo nkayeera, “Wo ishiyani wiira chiicho? Ihothosha voonelhiye aka ikiriri umihoolho winyu munna.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Paahi nenno nihuku nno Naesau nkayaachokholha nkwaha wo uhokolhia Useiri. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Nansho Nayakhobo nkayaarwaa Usukothi, waathenke aya inupa ni marapatta a ashinama aya. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo, vavawo vakittu vawo nkawehaniya, Sukothi maana aya “marapatta.”<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Ukhuma Upadan aramu, Nayakhobo ahophiya rata iwani yo Ushekemu, ilhapo yo Ukanaani, nkayaamaka vakhiviru ni iwani iyo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Vakittu vaamakilhe aya maheema vawo, ooponlhe wa achishaana a Nahamori, athumwanaya Nashekemu wo nchurukhu makhobilhi imia imoka. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Wowo nkayaathatha malhuku utheka madhubahu ni wiihana El Elohe Israeli, maana aya “Nlhuku phi Nlhuku a attu o Israeli.”<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Nasimeoni ni Nalawi anolhivelhelhiha nlhatu wa mwanrokoraya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Nihuku nimoka, Dina, mwalhi mwaamwana a Nayakhobo annyanre aya ni Nalea ahorwaa weetakacherani manyoopani o ilhapo iyo. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Paahi Shekemu, mwaamwana a Nahamori, ntu o Uhivi aatawara yeyo ilhapo iyo vaamwoonne awe Dina, ahommara, nkanrupana wo machiri. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Nansho Shekemu ahochivelhiya chinene, ni unttuna Dina. Nkaachokholha umwulhumana ni umpepecha wiira Dina anttune. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Paahi nkeerelha athumwanawe, Nahamori, wiira, “Chonte thithi, nrweeke mwolhumaneke wiira kinthelhe mwalhi uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Nayakhobo nkayeewa wiira mwaamwanaya uyo hovariya wo machiri ni Shekemu, nansho ukhalhawaya achishaana aya ashilhopwana yaari umachungani waalhiha aya mihuwo, ahomaalha mpaka vaahokolhelhachilhe aya. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Nahamori athumwanawe Shekemu ahorwaa wa Nayakhobo wiira olhumane, <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />ni yeyo ikatema iyo achishaana ashilhopwana a Nayakhobo yaari ahokolhiachaka ukhuma waalhiha aya mihuwo. Veewanche aya yoyo mwaha uyo, yahorushiya, nkayaathunalhacha chinene, ukhalhawaya Shekemu hopanga ittu yo unanara chinene, unrupana Dina wo machiri, kwaani yeyo ittu iyo yaari mwiikho mulhupalhe wa attu o Israeli. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Nansho Nahamori nkayeerelha, “Mwaamwanaka Shekemu, honttuna chinene mwaamwaninyu mwanthiyana uyo. Chonte, munhiyeke anthelhe. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Nithelhaneke, mwaatti nnithelhiheke achishaana inyu ashithiyana, ni hii nuthelhihekeni achishaana ihu ashithiyana. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Paahi etu, nnokhalha vamoka ni hii, khannokhalha ni nipampa mwiilhaponi mu. Nnookhalha, nnopanga maronda ni upatta nhakhu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Shekemu ni uyo chiicho, aheerelhacha yayo malhove ayo athumwanawe ni ashirokorawe Dina, eeraka wiira, “Chonte, mwaatti nkipangelhe moombone, nkihiyeke kinthelhe, kinoulhivani ittu iriyoothe inohalha inyu uromolha. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Nkihimerieke ittu iriyoothe inophwanelha ukhalha ichitamo ni izawadi, ata inonnuwaka chani. Mii kinookumiha, nansho kimpatte mwalhi ulha.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Paahi achishaana ashilhopwana a Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha Nahamori ni mwaamwanaya Shekemu wo waalhia ikohi, ukhalhawaya Shekemu ahonnanariha Dina, mwanrokoraya. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Yaakhunlhe wiira, “Khaninooria unthelhiha mwanrokorihu wa ntu hiinelhiye unyawo. Ninowuulhiya muru neeraka chiicho. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Ninohalha wiiwanana mwaatti mwarumelhelhaka nna nlhove nna, Mwathananaka, nkhalheke etu thoko hii chiri ihu, wiira nimwiinelhe unyawo kila nlhopwana ri munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Vavawo phi nohalha ihu uthelhihani achishaana ihu ashithiyana, ninookhalha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti, ni inyu nnookhalha ashilhoko ihu. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Nansho mwaahittuneke malhove ihu ni wiinelhiya unyawo, paahi ninonkusha mwaamwanihu uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Nenno nlhove nno nahaateelhiha Nahamori ni mwaamwanaya, Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Ni uyo khaapinche ata vakani upanga thoko cheewananiye, ukhalhawaya ahonttuna chinene mwaamwana a Nayakhobo. Tho, Shekemu phi ntu aari ni ikuru chinene waapwaha attu onkhaye uwannyawe uwo.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Paahi Nahamori ni mwaamwanaya, Shekemu, nkayaarwaa waari nlhako wo ukelha vawani, vaakumaana aya attu, nkoolhumana attu onkhaye wiira, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Alha manyaattu alha, ashilhoko ihu. Naapochereke akhalhacheke mwiilhaponi mwihu mu, naahiyeke apangeke maronda, ukhalhawaya nihanaa ilhapo yulhupalhe yo unithosha hii, ni ayo chiicho. Ninowaathelha achishaana aya ashithiyana ayo, ni ayo anowaathelha achishaana ihu ashithiyana chiicho. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Nansho anohalha urumelhelha ukhalha ni hii narumelhelhaka nlhove naya no wiira, kila nlhopwana munlhokoni mwihu enelhiyeke unyawo thoko chiri aya yayo manyaattu ayo. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Chani mwaatti, khannoona wiira mihuwo chaya ni mihakhu chaya chinookhalha chawihu? Haya etu, naarumelhelheke, akhalheke vamoka ni hii.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Manyaalhopwana onkhaye yaathukumanne vanlhakoni vawo, yahorumelhelhacha nlhove ni Nahamori ni mwaamwanaya, Shekemu. Nkayeenelhachiya unyawo onkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Mahuku mararu kaanyuma, attu yeenelhiye unyawo alhe anari baado makhwata aaweriaka chinene, achishaana elhi a Nayakhobo, yaani Nasimeoni ni Nalawi, ashirokorawe Dina, ahokushacha maphanga aya, nkayaakelhelha wo gafula iwani yo yayo attu ayo, nkayeevakacha manyaalhopwana onkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Nkayeeva Nahamori ni mwaamwanaya Shekemu, nkayaankumiha Dina unupani wa Shekemu, nkayanhokolhosha uwani. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Baada yo nenno niiviho nno, achishaana ashilhopwana akina a Nayakhobo yahokelha vawani vawo nkayaavara mateeka kila ittu vawani vawo, ukhalhawaya mwanrokoraya ahonanarihiya wowo. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Nkayaakusha ikhondoro, ipuri, ing'ope, iphuta, ni kila ittu yaari vawani ni mmamatani. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Yahokusha nhakhu wonkhaye, ashaana ni manyaathiyana onkhaye vamoka ni kila ittu yaariwo mmanupani.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nasimeoni ni Nalawi, “Mwaatti nhokithapaniha, nhaahelha ichuku attu o ilha ilhapo ilha ya Akanaani ni Aperizi ilha, wiira akivenge. Mii akirina attu enchi, yathukumanaka ni uwa ukithuriani, anookilhakalhiha mii vamoka ni ashilhoko aka.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Achishaana aya elhi ayo nkayaakhulha wo wiira, “Yaari ni ikuru ani yo umpanga mwanrokorihu thoko nthiyana o ulhavalhava?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anoothamelha Ubetheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Nihuku nimoka, Nlhuku aheerelha Nayakhobo, “Nchokholheke nkwaha, nthameke, nrweeke mwakhalheke Ubetheli. Wowo mwathatheke malhuku, mwakithekelheke vakittu wo ukivahera isadaka mii Nlhuku inyu, kookhumelhenlheni ikatema vaattawa inyu onninyu Naesau.” <verse eid="GEN 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayeerelhacha ashilhoko aya onkhaye yaarina aya wiira, “Nrihacheke isinyago cho milhuku chilheto chirina inyu, mwiittukurieke ni uwara ikuwo chinyu chikina. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Namalhaka, nithameke nirweeke Ubetheli, kanthekelhe Nlhuku vakittu wo unvahera isadaka, Nlhuku aakilhonhe nihuku no uhuva waka, ni ukhalha ni mii uriwoothe waakenlhe aka.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Paahi nkayaakumihacha isinyago chonkhaye cho milhuku chilheto chaarina aya ni waavaha Nayakhobo, vamoka ni ichipuli chaawaranche aya mmaaruni. Nayakhobo ni ayo nkayaawuhelhacha wuuthi mwiri mulhupalhe vakhiviru ni Ushekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Nayakhobo ni achishaana aya vaari aya munkwahani, Nlhuku ahaahelha nrima wo woova anenchi o iwani chaatamana chonkhaye ata khayaalhikachilhe waattwarelhelha. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaaphiya Uluzu yaani Ubetheli, ilhapo yo Ukanaani, vamoka ni attu onkhaye yaarina aya. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Vavawo nkayaathatha malhuku utheka madhubahu ni wiihana El Betheli, maana aya “Nlhuku o Ubetheli,” ukhalhawaya vavawo phi vakittu Nlhuku vaakhumelhenlhe awe ikatema yaattawa aya onnaya, Naesau. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Nadebora, amwethi aya Narabeka, ahorimelha, nkayaavithiya wuuthi mwiri mulhupalhe uhito wo Ubetheli. Paahi yoyo mwiri uyo nkaweehaniya, Alon bakuthi. Maana aya, “Mwiri mulhupalhe wo wunlhiya.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Nayakhobo vaahokolhia aya Upadan aramu, Nlhuku ahaakhumelhelha tho, nkaavaha ibarakha. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Nlhuku, nkeerelha, “Nchina ninyu Yakhobo, nansho khanneehaniya tho nenno nchina nno, nansho vano nneehaniyeke Israeli.” Paahi Nayakhobo nkayeeehaniya Israeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Tho, Nlhuku nkeerelha, “Mii phi Nlhuku o machiri onkhaye. Mwaayareke achishaana enchi. Uwaninyu unowa ukhuma nikosho, makosho ni mamwene. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Ilhapo kaavahilhe aka Aburahimu ni Naisaka, kinouvahani inyuva vamoka ni iyari inyu inowa.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Paahi Nlhuku vaamalhinhe awe wolhumana Nayakhobo, ahaahiya. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Nayakhobo nkayeesha nlhuku ukhalha nipoto no wuupuwelhiya vavawo vakittu vawo, nkayaaminelha idivai ni makhura o izeituni vachulhu, ukhalha isadaka wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Paahi Nayakhobo nkayeehana vavawo vakittu vamulhumanne aya Nlhuku vawo, Betheli, maana aya “Inupa ya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyaria wa Nabenyamini ni ukhwa wa Naraheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Nayakhobo ni ashilhoko aya onkhaye nkayaathepa weeta nkwaha aya wo uthama Ubetheli. Vaari aya utayi, ahinaya uphiya Uefratha, Naraheli ahowereiya chinene nkuri, athananaka wiithaphulha. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Ni ayo vaari aya eepulhelhaka uweria nkuri uyo, athiyana aayariha ayo aheerelha Naraheli wiira, “Nhoove, nhompatta mwaana nkina mwanlhopwana.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Nansho Naraheli vaari aya akhwaaka, ahommaha mwaana uyo nchina, Ben Oni, maana aya, “mwaana o wunlha waka.” Nansho athumwanawe nkayammaha nchina na Benyamini, maana aya “mwaana nohalha uvaheriya.”<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Paahi Naraheli nkayaarimelha ni uvithiya vachereshere iphiro inokelha Uefratha, yaani Ubethlehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Nayakhobo nkayeesha nlhuku vachulhu nihiye ni Naraheli, ukhalha nipoto no wuupuwelhiya nirii mpaka lhelho nna. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Nkayaathepa weeta nkwaha aya, nkayaamaka ukhopelhelhe ishanja yo Uederi.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Achishaana a Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1Ikat 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Ikatema Nayakhobo vaari aya akhalhaka mwiilhaponi mmo, mwaamwanaya, Robeni, ahonrupana Bilha, nivaasha nikina na athumwanawe. Nayakhobo veewilhe aya yoyo mwaha uyo, ahorushiya chinene. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Achishaana a Nalea yaari Narobeni, mwaana o nttara. Akina yaari, Nasimeoni, Nalawi, Nayuda, Naisakari ni Nazabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Naraheli yaari Nayusufu ni Nabenyamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Achishaana ashilhopwana aayariye ni Bilha, namitheko nthiyana a Naraheli yaari, Nadani ni Nanaftali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Achishaana ashilhopwana yaayariye ni Zilpa, namitheko nthiyana a Nalea yaari, Nagadi ni Naasheri. Yayo phi achishaana ashilhopwana a Nayakhobo, aayanre vaari aya Upadan aramu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhwa wa Naisaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Nayakhobo ahothama nkayaarwaa Umamre wa athumwanaya, Naisaka, Ukiriath arba, yaani Uhebroni. Vakittu Aburahimu ni Naisaka waakhanlhe aya ulhetoni. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Naisaka vaari aya o iyaakha imia imoka ni makhumi nane, <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />ahorimeelha anolhuvanlhe chinene. Achishaana aya, Naesau ni Nayakhobo nkayaavitha athumwanaya.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Achishaana a Naesau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1Ikat 1:34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Alha phi achishaana a Naesau, yaani Naedomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Naesau yahaathelha manyaathiyana Akanaani, Naada abiti Eloni, o Uhiti ni Naoholibama abiti Anaa, o Uhivi, aari uchuulhu wa Nasimeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />O neraru, yaari Nabasemathi abiti Ishmaeli, arokoraya Nanebayothi. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Naada nkaayarelha Naesau mwaana, Elifazi. Ni Nabasemathi ahonnyara Reueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Naoholibama nkaayaracha Yeushi, Yalamu ni Kora. Yayo phi achishaana ashilhopwana a Naesau, yaayarachiye ni manyaahanu aya araru ayo, vaakhanlhe aya ilhapo yo Ukanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Yamalheke, Naesau ahaakushacha manyaahanu aya, achishaana aya ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, attu onkhaye o unupani waya, ing'ope chaya, ashinama aya akina ni nhakhu waya wonkhaye waapantte aya Ukanaani. Nkayaathamelha vakittu vakina, utayi uhaatamanaka ni wa ahima aya, Nayakhobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Yaapannge chiicho ukhalhawaya mihuwo chaya chaari chinchi ahooriaka ukhalha vamoka ni Nayakhobo. Ilhapo yaakhalha aya thoko alheto khayaathosha wo nlhatu no winchiva mihuwo chaya. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Paahi etu, Naesau nkayaarwa ukhalhani ilhapo yo miako cho Useiri. Nchina nikina ni Naesau naari, Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Alha phi achishaana ashilhopwana a Naesau, athumwanaya attu o Uedomu o ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Useiri. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Achishaana ashilhopwana yaari, Elifazi aayariye ni Naada, ni Reueli, aayariye ni Nabasemathi, ahanu aya akina. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Naelifazi yaari, Temani, Omari, Sefo, Gatamu ni Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Naelifazi ahanaa nivasha nikina wa namitheko nthiyana nchina nawe Timna. Yoyo ahaayarelha mwaana, nchina nawe, Amaleki. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Nabasemathi, ahanu a Naesau ahaayara Nareueli. Ashaana ashilhopwana a Nareueli, yaari, Nahathi, Zera, Shama ni Miza. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Ahanu akina a Naesau, Naoholibama abiti Anaa, uchuulhu wa Nasimeoni ahaayarelha Naesau ashaana ashilhopwana araru, Yeushi, Yalamu ni Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Alha vano phi mamwene o mahimo yaakhumme u Naesau. Naelifazi, mwaana o nttara a Naesau ahaayara amwene Natemani, amwene Naomari, amwene Nasefo, amwene Nakenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />amwene Nakora, amwene Nagatamu ni amwene Naamaleki. Kila mmoka aya akhalhaka mwene o nihimo nawe. Yayo onkhaye ayo phi achishaana ashilhopwana a Naelifazi, Uedomu, yaakhumme wi iyari i Naada, ahanu a Naesau.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Nareueli, anaaya Naesau, ahaayara amwene Nahathi, amwene Nazera, amwene Nashama ni amwene Namiza, kila mmoka aya nkaakhalha mwene o nihimo nawe. Yayo onkhaye ayo phi achishaana ashilhopwana a Nareueli, Uedomu, yaakhumme wi iyari ya Nabasemathi, ahanu a Naesau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Naoholibama, ahanu a Naesau, yaari, amwene Nayeushi, amwene Nayaalamu ni amwene Nakora, kila mmoka akhalhaka mwene o nihimo nawe. Yayo onkhaye ayo phi achishaana ashilhopwana a Naoholibama, abiti Anaa, ahanu a Naesau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Paahi etu, yayo phi iyari i Naesau yaani Naedomu, kila mmoka aya nkaakhalha mwene o nihimo nawe.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Achishaana a Naseiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1Ikat 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Naseiri, ntu o Uhori, nnenchi o yeyo ilhapo iyo, yaari, Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni, Anahi, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni, Eseri ni Dishani. Kila mmoka aya akhalhaka mwene o nihimo nawe munlhokoni mwa attu o Uhori o iyari i Naseiri, mwiilhaponi Uedomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Nalotani yaari, Hori ni Hemani, yaari phi mamwene o mahimo aya. Mwanrokoraya Nalotani eeehaniya Natimna. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Nashobali yaari, Alvani, Mahathi, Ebali, Shefo ni Onamu. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Nasibeoni yaari Aya ni Anahi. Anahi phi aavitunlhe marapo o maashi o mooro uthakoni, ikatema vaachunga awe iphuta cha athumwanawe, Nasibeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Achishaana a Naanaa yaari Dishoni ni mwanrokorawe mmoka, eehaniya Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Nadishoni yaari, Hemdani, Eshbani, Nithrani ni Kerani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Naeseri yaari, Bilhani, Zaawani ni Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Nadishani yaari, Usi ni Arani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Paahi etu, yayo phi mamwene a attu o Uhori, amwene Nalotani, amwene Nashobali, amwene Nasibeoni, amwene Naanaa, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />amwene Nadishoni, amwene Naeseri ni amwene Nadishani. Kila mmoka aya akhalhaka mwene o nihimo nawe, mwiilhaponi Useiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Paahi alha phi mamwene yaatawanre ilhapo yo Uedomu, mwene riyoothe hinaya waatawara attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Amwene Nabela, anaaya Nabeori, aatawanre ilhapo yo Uedomu ni iwani yaakhalha aya yaari Udinhaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Vaakhwilhe aya Nabela, Nayoabu mwaaamwana a Nazera o ukhuma Ubosra ahokusha nipuro naya. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Nayobabu ayo vaakhwilhe aya, Nahushamu o ilhapo yo Utemani, ahokusha nipuro naya. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Nahoshamu vaakhwilhe aya, Nahadadi anaaya Nabedadi ahokusha nipuro naya, akhalhaka iwani yo Uavithi. Yayo phi amwene yaatakanne ikhoto ni waakottolha Amidiyani, Umoabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Vaakhwilhe aya Nahadadi, Nasamla o ukhuma Umasreka, ahokusha nipuro naya. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Nasamla ayo vaakhwilhe aya, Nashauli o ukhuma Urehobothi, vakhiviru ni mwolhoko wo Yufrati, ahokusha nipuro naya. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Nashauli vaakhwilhe aya, Nabaal hanani, mwaana a Naakbori, ahokusha nipuro naya. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Vaakhwilhe aya Nabaal hanani, mwaana a Naakbori ayo, Nahadadi ahokusha nipuro naya, ni iwani yaakhalha aya yaari Upau. Ahanu a Naakbori yaari, Namehetabeli, abiti Matredi, uchuulhu wa Namezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Aholhelhi o mahimo yaakhumme u Naesau, wo ulhikaana ni mahimo aya ni iwani chaya yaari, Natimna, Naalva, Nayethethi, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Naoholibama, Naela, Napinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Nakenazi, Natemani, Namisbari, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Namagdieli ni Nairamu. Yayo phi ahoolhelhi o mahimo aakhumme u Naedomu, yaani Naesau, athumwanaya attu no Uedomu, aromolhachiye wo ulhikaana ni iwani chaya, mwiilhaponi mwaatawara aya.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu ni ashilhoko aya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Nayakhobo ahothepa ukhalha ilhapo yo Ukanaani, waakhanlhe aya athumwanaya thoko nlheto. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Ulha phi mwaha unaacha nikosho ni Nayakhobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Nayusufu, vaari aya mmirawo o iyaakha khumi ni saba, yaari achungaka ikhondoro ni ipuri vamoka ni manyonnaya, achishaana ashilhopwana a Nabilha ni Nazilpa, manyaahanu a athumwanaya. Nayusufu, yaari yaahimeriaka athumwanaya chittu cho uhilhoka chaapangacha aya manyonnaya ayo.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Naisraeli, yaani Nayakhobo, ahaattuna chinene Nayusufu waapwaha achishaana aya onkhaye, ukhalhawaya aayarelhe ikatema vaari aya anolhuvanlhe. Nkayaatottelha Nayusufu ikanzu yo urera chinene. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Nansho manyonnaya vonne aya wiira athumwanaya yaattuna chinene Nayusufu, waapwaha ayo, yahochokholha waavenga, ata khayolhumana rata.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Uhiyu mmoka, Nayusufu aholhoha itora, nansho vaahimiachenre aya manyonnaya, yahothepa uvengiya uwo. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Yaahimianche wiira, “Mwiiweke itora kilhohilhe aka iyo. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Kiholhoha wiira hii onkhaye va, naari umatani nittukaka ihiru. Wo uhikhulhuvelhiya ihiru aka nkayeemelha. Ihiru chinyu mwaatti nkachaathukumana, nkachaarukureria ihiru aka, nkachooromelha ihiru aka iyo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Manyonnaya ayo nkayaakohacha, “Chani, nnothanana wiira, nnowa mwaanitawara? Ama, nnookhalha ni ikuru vachulhu ihu?” Paahi uvengiya nkawaathepa wo nlhatu no itora ni malhove aya ayo.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Yamalheke, Nayusufu aholhoha itora ikina, nkaahimiachera manyonnaya, yeeraka, “Mwiiweke, kiholhoha itora ikina tho, kihoona nchuwa, mweri ni ittotwa khumi ni imoka chikooromelhaka.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Nansho vaahimenrie aya athumwanaya ni manyonnaya yeyo itora iyo, athumwanaya ahaachachera yeeraka, “Itora yaani yeyo ilhohilhe inyu iyo? Chani, nnoothanana wiira, mii, anumwaninyu, ni manyonninyu, ninowa nookhoromelhani inyuva?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Manyonnaya nkayoonelha ihache, nansho athumwanaya nkayaakhalha opuwelhaka nenno nlhove nno.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu anoothumihiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Nihuku nimoka, manyonnaya Nayusufu yahorwaacha uchungani mihuwo cha athumwanaya, vakhiviru ni Ushekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Nhochuwelha wiira, manyonninyu akenlhe uchungani Ushekemu. Paahi etu, kinothanana urumani nrwee wowo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Nayusufu nkayaakhulha, “Aye, kiheewa.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Athumwanaya nkayeerelha, “Nrweeke mwaaweheke manyonninyu ni ashinama ayo wiira ari salama? Mwamalhaka, nhokolhieke mmweeke mwaakihimeria.” Paahi Nayakhobo nkayaaruma Nayusufu ukhuma nikoote no Uhebroni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Ikatema Nayusufu vaatameria aya uphiya Ushekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />ntu mmoka ahaaphwanya athemwaka nthakhwani, nkaakoha, “Nnaaviani?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Nayusufu nkayaakhulha, “Kinaavia manyonnaka. Nkakihimerieni vakittu vanaachungelha aya ashinama.”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Ntu ulhe nkeerelha, “Veekinaka ahothamacha, ukhalhawaya kaheewa yeeraka wiira, anokelha Udothani.” Paahi Nayusufu nkayaattwara manyonnaya ayo, nkaaphwanyacha Udothani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Manyonnaya vonne aya awaaka, ahinaya uphiya rata, ahopanga miruku cho uweeva. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Yeerelhanacha ashineneru, “Mmwooneke ntu o ulhohalhoha itora uyo noowa! <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Nngwe nimwiive, ninrihelhe nlhushi, ilhushi yowiisha imoka yo chilha ilhushi chilha. Kaanyuma, niweeke neera, hokhuriya ni ashinama o mwiithuphini. Nooneke etu, itora chawe chiyo chinohalha aya ukhalha.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Nansho Narobeni, veewilhe aya yayo malhove ayo, aholhikacha wookholha. Paahi nkeerelha ashikhunanaya ayo wiira, “Mwaatti, nihimwiive. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Nihirihakache iphome. Nansho muntumbucheriheke munlhikitini uthakoni va, nhinthurie.” Enre chiicho, wo ukhulhuvellha wiira ookholhe mmathathani mwaya, kaanyuma, awe yaahokolhosha wa athumwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Nayusufu vaaphilhe aya wa manyonnaya vawo, ahovariya nkayaarulhiya ikanzu aya yorera yaawanre aya iyo. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Nkaavariya ni urihelhiya nlhushi. Nansho ilhushi yo wiisha iyo yaari yo uhikhalha maashi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Vaakhalhanche aya ulhia yolhia, nkayoona mphingo wa Aishmaeli yaakhuma Ugileadi, arwaaka Umisri. Ingamiya chaya chaari chinakunshe misigo cho ubani, izeri ni manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Vavawo Nayuda nkayeerelhacha ashikhunanaya, “Ninohalha upatta ifaida yaani namwiivaka mwanhima ihu, ni uvitha ukhwa wawe? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Nambaya etu ninthumihe wa Aishmaeli alha, kuliko umwiiva, ukhalhawaya ulha mwanhima ihu, iphome imoka ni hii.” Ashikhunanaya nkayaarumelhelha nenno nlhove nno. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Attu o upanga maronda Aishmaeli ayo ari phi Amidiyani vaaphilhe aya vavawo, manyaattu ayo yahaakumiha Nayusufu nlhushi mmo, nkayaathumihiya wo malhivo o nchurukhu makhobilhi makhumi melhi. Ni yayo Aishmaeli ayo ahaakusha Nayusufu mpaka Umisri.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Paahi Narobeni vaahokolhelhe aya ni uweha valhushi valhe, ni uhoona Nayusufu, ahaahulha ikuwo chaya wo nlhatu no ihuzuni. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Nkayaarwa wa ashikhunanaya, ni weerelha, “Mmirawo khaawo! Vano kiireke chani etu?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Nansho onkhaye khayaari ni nlhove no waahimeria athumwanaya. Paahi nkayaahitha ipuri, nkayaakusha ikanzu ya Nayusufu ni uruwia mphomeni mwo ipuri ilhe. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Nkayaahokolhia wa athumwanaya ni waarwehelha ikanzu ilhe, yeeraka, “Nihorokotta ikanzu ilha. Nkawehani, yakhalhaka yo mwaamwaninyu, ama kihiwe.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Athumwanaya ahochuwelha, nkayeera, “Phi yeyo! Mwaamwanaka hokhuuriya ni nshene. Wo ikekhiaye, Yusufu hopapharulhiya!” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Paahi, vavawo Nayakhobo ahaahulhacha ikuwo chaya wo nlhatu no ihuzuni yaarina aya, nkayaawara majuniya. Nkayonlha, umunlhelha mwaamwanaya wo mahuku menchi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Achishaana aya ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana ahowaacha uwaamaalhihani, nansho nkayaakhota umaalhihiya, yeeraka, “Nkihiyeke, kithepeke umunlhelha mwaamwanaka, mpaka vanohalha aka uwuhelhiya vawo.” Phi chiichammo chaamunlhenlhe aya mwaamwanaya.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Umisri ulhe, Amidiyani alhe yahaathumiha Nayusufu wa ntu eeehaniya Potifa, mmoka a attu o ikuru munlhokoni mwa manyaasikari a Nafarao, amwene o Umisri.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Nayuda ni Natamari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, Nayuda, ahomwalhaana ni achihimaya, nkayaarwa ukhalhani ni ntu mmoka o Uadulami, nchina nawe Hira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Wowo, Nayuda ahomwoona mwalhi eehaniya Shuwa, ntu o Ukanaani, nkayanthelha. Vanrupanne aya <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />ahorupalha irukulhu, nkannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. Nayuda nkayammaha mwaana uyo nchina, Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Nashuwa ahorupalha irukulhu ikina tho, nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. Nkayammaha nchina, Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Nkayampatta mwaana nkina mwanlhopwana, nkayaamwiihana nchina nawe Shela. Ikatema Shela vaayarelhe awe, Nayuda yaari akhalhaka Ukezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Kaanyuma Nayuda ahonthelhiha mwaamwanaya o nttara Eri, nthiyana eehaniya Tamari. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Nansho Eri, nttara ni Nayuda, aari ntu o mitheko cho uhilhoka umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku ahomwiiva. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Nayuda nkayaamwiirelha Onani, “Ukelheke manupa wa munninyu, kwaani phi nothananiya upangiya, munnyarelhe munninyu ashaana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Nansho Onani ahochuwelha wiira, ashaana anohalha uyaria ayo khanowa aakhalha awawe. Paahi etu, vaarumpe awe ni alhamu awe ayo, ahorihelha imbeyu chiyo vathi, haarupalhihe irukulhu, haayarelhe ashaana onnawe. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Yoyo mwaha uyo wahaarusha Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkaamwiiva Onani ni uyo. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Phi Nayuda verenlhe aya Natamari, ahanu o mwaamwanaya, “Nhokolhieke uwani etu, wa athumwaninyu. Mwakhalheke nankhwelhi mpaka mwaamwanaka Shela vanohalha awe wunnuwa vawo.” Nayuda yaari yoovaka wiira Shela ni uyo hiwe aakhwa thoko chikhwilhe aya manyonnawe. Paahi etu, Natamari ahohokolhia wa athumwanaya.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Mahuku menchi avireke, Nashuwa ahanu a Nayuda ni ayo ahokhwa. Baada yo umalhiha mattanga, Nayuda ahothama ni ampwana aya Nahira, ntu o Uadulami, nkawaarweiya Utimna, wa attu aatturia mapururu o ikhondoro chaya. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Ntu mmoka nkaahimeria Natamari wiira, ahokohi aya ari mphironi anokelha Utimna. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Paahi ahorulha ikuwo chaya cho unankhwelhi chiyo, nkayeekhunelha ntandiyo wiira ahichuwelhiye. Nkayaakhalha vaari nlhako wo ukelhelha Uenaimu, iwani yaari mphironi ukelhaka Utimna. Yaapannge chiicho, ukhalhawaya yoona wiira, Shela mwaamwana mwankani a Nayuda uyo ahonnuwa, nansho khankelhihiya manupa.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Paahi etu, Nayuda vaaphwannye aya Natamari vavawo, nkayaanyihera wiira aari nthiyana o ulhavalhava, ukhalhawaya yaari anekhunenlhe wiitho. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Vavawo wo uhichuwelha wiira yaari ahanu a mwaamwanaya, yahorwaa vachereshere iphiro vawo, nkayeerelha, “Kinothanana urupa ni inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Natamari nkayaakoha, “Nnohalha ukivaha ittu yaani karumelhelhaka?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Nayuda nkayaakhulha, “Kinouvahani mwaapuri o nkutironi waka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Natamari nkayeera, “Nkivaheke etu ittu yo uvarelha, uhimiechesha wiira nnowa mwaakivaha.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Nayuda nkayaakoha, “Kuuvahekeni ittu yaani wiira nvarelhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Natamari nkayaakhulha, “Nkivaheke pete uyo vamoka ni ikopo inyu iyo.” Paahi Nayuda nkayaavaha chittu chonkhaye chiyo, nkayaarupana. Natamari nkayaarupalha irukulhu. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Paahi Natamari ahohokolhia uwani, nkayaarulha ntandiyo wekhunenlhe aya, nkayaawara tho ikuwo chaya cho unankhwelhi.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Ikatema Nayuda vaarumilhe aya Nahira, ampwana aya, wiira anrwehelhe nthiyana ulhe mwaapuri wiira ahokolhosheriye chittu chivarelhiye chilhe, khayamphwannye nthiyana uyo. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Nahira nkaayakoha anenchi o Uenaimu vawo, “Ri vayi nthiyana o ulhavalhava aakhanlhe vachereshere iphiro vakhiviru ni vaa ulhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Nkayaakhulhiya wiira, “Khanapacha va ukhalha nthiyana o ulhavalhava.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Paahi nkaahokolhia wa ampwana aya, Nayuda, nkeerelha, “Akimpantte! Tho, anenchi o wowo ayo ahokihimeria wiira, khanapacha ukhalha nthiyana o ulhavalhava riyoothe wowo.” <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Nayuda nkayeera, “Munhiyeke awieke chittu chiyo, nihiwe noolhihiya muru. Inyu mwaanene nhoona, kihonrwehelha mwaapuri ulha, nansho khamumpantte.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Baada yo uvira mieri miraru, Nayuda nkayaahimeriya wiira, “Ahokohi inyu, Natamari aholhuva, ahorupalhihiya irukulhu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Paahi Nayuda nkayaalhehera wiira, “Akumihiye vathe, apahiye mooro akhwe.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Natamari vaakumihiya aya vathe, ahoruma nttenga wa ahokohi aya, Nayuda, yeeraka, “Mwanene chi chittu chi, phi kirupalhinhe irukulhu. Paahi etu, kinoulhepelhani wiira, mmwaavieke mwanene ulha pete ulha ni nripwe aya, ni ikopo ilha.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Nayuda nkayaachuwelha chittu chaya chiyo, nkayeera, “Natamari, ahanaa ikekhiaye ukipwaha mii. Eiyo, ukhalhawaya akankelhinhe manupa mwaamwanaka Shela.” Toka nenno nihuku nno, Nayuda khayarupanne tho Natamari.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Nihuku no wiithaphulha Natamari vaaphilhe aya, nkayaachuwania wiira, irukulhu iyo yaari yo ashaana mavata.<verse eid="GEN 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Paahi nkuri vaahachuwanche aya, mwaana mmoka ahokumiha nthatha nawe vathe, ni oopani o uyariha ayo ahonttuka nttoche no khwilha, eeraka, “Ulha holhenlhe uyaria ulha, phi nttara.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Nansho mwaana uyo vaahokolhoshilhe awe moono awe nhina, nhima awe nkaayaria wo uchokholha. Oopani o uyariha nkayeera, “Mbona uwe uhovira wo machiri?” Paahi nkeehaniya, Peresi, maana aya, “ukhuma wo machiri.” <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Kaanyuma aya munnawe nkaayaria nari ni nttoche nawe mmoononi, nkeehaniya nchina nawe Zera, maana aya, “usha.”<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wa Nayusufu ni ahanu a Napotifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Paahi Nayusufu ahokushiya mpaka Umisri. Wowo ntu mmoka o ikuru upuwani u Nafarao, nholhelhi o mphingo aya wo manyaasikari, eehaniya Potifa, ahoopolha Nayusufu ukhuma wa Aishmaeli yaarwehilhe Umisri ayo. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaareeriha Nayusufu, nkayaavara mitheko chaya rata. Nkayaakhalha unupani wa nkunya aya, Mmisri uyo. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Yoyo Mmisri uyo nkaachuwelha wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku aari vamoka ni Nayusufu, ni wiira phi uyo aavahera wo kila ittu yaapanga aya. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Paahi Nayusufu nkayaattuniya chinene ni Napotifa. Nkayaakhalha phi namitheko nkavihi aya, tho namitheko o weemelhelha inupa yonkhaye ni nhakhu waya wonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Toka ikatema Napotifa vaavanhe aya Nayusufu ntheko wo weemelhelha inupa aya ni weemelhelha nhakhu aya wonkhaye, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahohelha ibarakha chaya yeyo inupa ya yoyo Mmisri uyo wo nlhatu wa Nayusufu. Ibarakha cha Apwiiya Nlhuku nkachaakhalha vachulhu inupa iyo, kila ittu yaarina aya, toka nnupani mpaka mmamatani. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, Napotifa ahaavaha Nayusufu ikuru yo weemelhelhelha chittu chaya chonkhaye, ni Napotifa nkayaahiya uwehaweha ittu iriyoothe yaahikhalhe yolhia aya anene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Nayusufu yaari mmirawo orera ikhove ni o ushichira. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Paahi baada yo uvira mahuku, ahanu a Napotifa nkayaamirielha ishenye Nayusufu ni weerelha, “Nngwe mwakirupane.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Nansho Nayusufu nkayaakhota ni uweerelha ahanu a nkunya aya ayo, “Mena! Nkunya aka ulha va, hokivaha ikuru wo kila ittu vawani va, ni ukhalhawaya mii kihaawo, khanopanga ittu iriyoothe tho. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Vawani va khaawo mulhupalhe nokipwaha mii. Khanakichiichiha uvara ittu iriyoothe, yaahikhalhe inyuva, ukhalhawaya inyuva ahanu aya. Kinoorieke chaani etu uwonya thoko chommo, ni unttekelha Nlhuku?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Inakhalhaka yahokhota, oopani ayo yahothepa waattwarattwara Nayusufu kila nihuku. Nansho Nayusufu khayewelhenlhe, mena waarumelhelha wiira aarupane.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Nkanaakhalha nihuku nimoka Nayusufu naakenlhe aya mpaani uvarani ntheko waya thoko chaapanga aya, ni mmo khaariwo anamitheko akina. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Paahi ahanu a Napotifa ahaavara Nayusufu mwiinjiro aya ni weerelha, “Nkirupane!” Nansho Nayusufu nkayaakulhuphuwa, nkayaahiyera mwiinjiro aya uyo anavarenlhe mmathathani, nkayaattawelha vathe. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Vavawo oopani alhe vonne aya wiira Nayusufu ahohiya mwiinjiro aya, ahottawelha vathe, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />aheehanacha anamitheko akina o unupani waya, nkayeerelhacha, “Nkoonani! Muebraniya niwiiheriye ihu ulha chinre awe wo unulhiha muru. Ahokelha uchumbani waka athananaka ukivara wo machiri wiira kinrupane, nansho nkakaakhuwelha. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Vaakiiwa awe kikhuwelhaka vawo, ahottawa, nkaakihiyera mwiinjiro awe ulha!”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Paahi oopani alhe yahoshunga mwiinjiro uyo mpaka owannyaya, vaahokolhelhe aya uwani. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Nkayaatangachera mwaha ulhe yeeraka, “Ipotta inyu Muebrania mummwihilhe inyu vawani ulha, ahowa nkaathanana ukiruwaniha. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Nansho vaakonne awe kikhuwelhaka, ahohiya mwiinjiro awe nkaattawelha vathe.” <verse eid="GEN 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Paahi owannyaya ayo veewilhe aya yayo malhove a ahanu aya ayo, wiira Nayusufu aheera chiicho, ahorushiya chinene. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Nkaakusha Nayusufu ni waattuka ujerani, waattukachiya aya attu yaattekilhe wa amwene. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Nansho ata ujerani uwo, Apwiiya Nlhuku yaari vamoka ni Nayusufu, nkayaapangelha moombone, mpaka nkayaattuniya umihoolho wa olhupalhe o weemelhelha ijera iyo. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Paahi etu olhupalhe o weemelhelha ijera ayo nkayaathanlha Nayusufu ukhalha anyapara a attu attukiye onkhaye njerani mmo, kila ittu nkayaapangia wo ulheheriya ni Nayusufu. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Olhupalhe o weemelhelha ijera ayo khayaavanre ntheko uriyoothe nkina wenshe aya mmathathani mwa Nayusufu, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku yaari vamoka ni ayo ni ahaareeriha wo kila ittu yaapannge aya.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu anoolhamulha itora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Baada yo uvira yoyo mwaha uyo, anamitheko elhi o ikuru yulhupalhe unupani u Nafarao yahopanga ittu yo uhilhoka wa amwene. Namitheko mmoka aari ntu o ukoorosha chittu cho uwuriya, ni nkina ntu owaapia mikatte cha amwene. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Nafarao yahorushiya chinene, nkayaathunalhelha yayo manyaattu elhi ayo, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />nkaattukacha u ningome no mulhupalhe a manyaasikari yaalhitelhelha attu attukiye, wowo waattukiye aya Nayusufu uwo. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Mulhupalhe o manyaasikari o ulhitelhelha ijera iyo ahaathanlha Nayusufu wiira avare ntheko wa waashunga yayo manyaattu ayo, yaakhanlhe mwommo wo mahuku menchi.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Paahi uhiyu mmoka, ntu o ukoorosha chittu cho uwuriya ulhe ni nkhunanawe o waapelha mikatte amwene ulhe, aholhohacha kila mmoka itora awe. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Nayusufu vaarwelhe aya wichishu uwaashikuriachani, oyelhi yaari anakelhachiye nipampa. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Nayusufu nkaakohacha, “Mbona lhelho mwaatti, nnonia wiitho uwo thoko ihaawo ittu inouhuvihani?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Nkayaakhulhacha, “Nihokelhiya nipampa wo nlhatu no itora chilhohilhe ihu, ni khaawo ntu owooria unilhamulhelha itora chihu chiyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Nayusufu nkayeera, “Chani, ulhamulha itora kuhii ntheko wa Nlhuku? Haya etu nkihimerieke itora chinyu chiyo mwaatti.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Ntu o ukoorosha cho uwuriya cha amwene nkaahimiachera Nayusufu itora awe, eeraka, “Ntorani mwaka kahoona nzabibu uhoolho waka, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />ni uyo waari ni iphata ttaru. Vaachokholha aya uphuwa, ituva chaya chahemma, ni ikhuche chaya chaari cho izabibu cho utokotta. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Mmathathani mwaka kaari kinavarenlhe ikikombe ya Nafarao, paahi nkakaakusha izabibu, nkakaamelha nkikombeni mmo, nkakaavaha Nafarao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Nayusufu nkaamwiirelha wiira, “Maana aya phi alha, Iphata ttaru chiyo, mahuku mararu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Ukhalhawaya aviraka mahuku mararu, Nafarao anoukumihani ujerani uno, ni uhokolhoshani unthekoni winyu. Nnokowaavaha tho Nafarao ikikombe mmathathani mwaya thoko cheera inyu khalhayi vawo. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Nansho chonte, nhikelhe mwakilhiyalha chittu vanohalha aya uweetelhani rata vawo. Mwaakipangelheke ittu yoombone, mwakiromolhacheke u Nafarao uwo, kikhume ujerani uno. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Ukhalhawaya mii, kaakushiye wo uhittuna ukhuma uwani ilhapo yo Aebraniya, ni Umisri uno akipannge ittu iriyoothe yo unanara yo uttukiya ujerani uno.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Ntu o waapia mikatte ulhe vonne awe wiira itora iyo yaholhamulhiya rata, nkeerelha Nayusufu wiira, “Ata mii kaholhoha! Itora aka iyo kechonne kinakushilhe ithokwa ttaru cho mikatte vamuruni. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Ithokwa yo uchulhu iyo, yaari ni choolhia chinchi chaapeiye wo nlhatu no warwehelha Nafarao. Nansho ashinuni yaari alhiachaka nthokwani mwaakushilhe aka vachulhu iyo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Nayusufu nkayaakhulha, “Itora inyu iyo, maana aya phi alha, Ithokwa ttaru chiyo, mahuku mararu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Baada yo uvira mahuku mararu, Nafarao anoutheshani ukhuma ujerani uno, anoutupulhani muru inyu, ni uthomia iruttu inyu vamwirini, ni ashinuni anoowa uthowolhacha iruttu inyu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Nihuku no neraru, naari nihuku no wupuwelhiya uyaria u Nafarao, Nafarao ahoterekha ikaramu ni waalhalhia anamitheko aya olhupalhe onkhaye. Nkaakumiha ujerani ntu o ukoorosha cho uwuriya chaya ni ntu o waapia mikatte mulhupalhe ulhe, nkeemeshacha umihoolho wa anamitheko olhupalhe ayo. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Nkanhokolhoshera ntheko awe ntu o ukoorosha cho uwuriya cha amwene ulhe, ntheko wo waarwehelha ikikombe yo uwureria Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Nansho ntu o waapia mikatte mulhupalhe ulhe, ahotupulhiya muru nkaathomeiya vamwirini, thoko Nayusufu chenre aya wo waalhamulhelha itora chaya. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Ata ineeraka chiicho, ntu o ukoorosha cho uwuriya mulhupalhe ulhe ahaalhiyalha Nayusufu.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu umihoolho u Nafarao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Iyaakha piilhi chavirekeru, Nafarao aholhoha itora, yaalhonhe aneemenlhe vachereshere mwolhoko wo Naili. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Nkayoona ing'ope chorera saba, chaari tho cho uneneva, chikhumaka mmaashini ni ulhia manyashi ntendeni. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Tho, baada yo ing'ope saba chiyo, ing'ope chikina saba cho unanara, cho woota chinene, chahokhuma mmaashini, nkachaawa ni weemelha vakhiviru ni ing'ope chorera cho uneneva chilhe, vachereshere mwolhoko vawo. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ing'ope cho woota chinene chiyo nkachaakhura ing'ope chorera cho uneneva saba chilhe. Vavawo Nafarao nkayonkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Nkayaarupa tho, nkayaalhoha nkwaha wo neyelhi. Nkayoona machashi saba molhupalhe, orera chinene, athaphuruwaka nthathi mmoka. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Baada yo vavawo, ahoona machashi makina saba o uyevayeva aanyaalhihiye ni iphioo yo uviha yo uthakoni, athaphuruwaka. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Machashi saba o unyaalha ayo nkayaamiria machashi saba molhupalhe akhomanlhe alhe. Paahi Nafarao nkayonkwa, nkayaachuwelha wiira aaneraka ulhoha. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Waashelhe waya, Nafarao anakelhiye nipampa chinene, aheehanacha akhwiri onkhaye o Umisri, ni attu o uchuwelha chittu, nkayaahimiachera itora chaalhonhe aya chiyo. Nansho khaariwo ata ntu mmoka onrie ulhamulha chechiyo itora chiyo.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Phi vavawo etu, ntu o ukorosha cho uwuriya cha amwene mulhupalhe ulhe venre awe wa Nafarao wiira, “Lhelho, kihoopuwelha makosa aka! <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Ikatema vaarushiye inyu valhe, mii ni namitheko nkhunanaka o waapia mikatte ulhe, mwahonittuka uningome no ulhitelhelhiya ni manyaasikari ulhe. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Uhiyu mmoka naholhoha itora, kila mmoka itora awe ihinolhikaana ni ya nkhunanawe. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Woulhe ahaawo mmirawo mmoka Muebraniya, namitheko a olhupalhe o manyaasikari, aari vamoka ni hii muuttukiyani. Vanhimenrie ihu itora chihu, yoyo ahooria unilhamulhelha kila mmoka wo ulhikaana ni itora awe. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Chenre awe wo ulhamulha chiyo, phi chiichammo chenre aya wo ukhumelhelha kaanyuma. Mii kahohokolhoshiya unthekoni waka, ni ntu o waapia mikatte ulhe, ahothomeiya mmwirini.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Paahi Nafarao nkayaalhehera wiira Nayusufu awiihiye. Nkayaakumihiya ujerani chitemachitema. Baada yo uhama ikharari chaya ni uwara ikuwo chikina, Nayusufu ahowiihiya umihoolho wa Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Nafarao nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Mii, kiholhoha itora, nansho khaawo ntu onrie ukilhamulhelha. Kiheewa mwaha inyu, wiira inyuva mwahimeriyaka itora, nnowooria ulhamulha.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Nayusufu nkayaakhulha Nafarao, “Akirina yeyo ipilhi iyo, nansho Nlhuku nouthaphulhelhani ittu yoombone.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Vavawo Nafarao nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Kilhonhe wiira, kaari kineemenlhe vachereshere mwolhoko wo Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />nkakoona ing'ope saba chorera, cho uneneva chinene chikhumaka mmwolhokoni ni ulhia manyashi ntendeni. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Nkachaattwariya ni ing'ope chikina saba cho uhuperiacha, cho unanara, cho woota chinene. Mii akinapacha mena woona ing'ope cho woota thoko chechiyo, Mmisri mu. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Paahi ing'ope cho unanara, cho woota chinene chiyo nkachaakhura ing'ope cho uneneva chilhe. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Nansho ata baada yo ukhuura ing'ope cho uneneva chilhe, ntu riyoothe khooria uchuwelha wiira chihaakhuura ashikhunanaya, kwaani bado chaari chinootilhe thoko mapachero vawo. Vavawo nkakonkwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />“Kaanyuma, kaholhoha itora ikina tho, konne aka machashi saba o melhe o ukhomalha rata athaphuruwaka nthathi mmoka. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Tho, nkaattwariya ni machashi saba iphepuwa, o nyaalha aanyaalhihiye ni iphioo yo uviha yo uthakoni. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Machashi saba o iphepuwa ayo, nkaamiria machashi saba o ukhomalha alhe. Paahi, kahaahimiachera akhwiri ni achuwelhi o itora aka, nansho khaawo ntu onrie ukilhamulhelha.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Phi vavawo Nayusufu verenlhe aya Nafarao wiira, “Itora chonkhaye piilhi chiyo, ulhamulhiya waya unolhikaana. Nlhuku houpatakulhelhani ittu inothanana awe upanga. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ing'ope saba cho uneneva chilhe, phi iyaakha saba. Machashi saba o ukhomalha alhe, ni ayo phi iyaakha saba. Itora chiyo ulhamulhiya waya, umoka. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ing'ope saba cho woota chinene chilhe, chaattwanre ing'ope cho uneneva chilhe ni machashi saba anyaalhihiye ni iphioo yo uviha yo uthakoni alhe, maana aya iyaakha saba cho ikuruna. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Thoko chinre aka wo uhimeriani, pwiiya Nafarao, Nlhuku houpatakulhelhani chittu chinohalha awe upanga phiyaru. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Chinookhalha iyaakha saba cho nnema wo uruweriya choolhia ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nansho uhoolho uwo, chinoowa iyaakha saba cho ikuruna, mpaka nnema wo uruweriya uyo unowa ulhiyalhiya. Ikuruna iyo inoowalhawalhiha ilhapo ilha. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Nnema wo choolhia uyo unowa ulhiyalhiya kabisa, ukhalhawaya ikuruna inowa uttwara iyo, inowa ukhalha yulhupalhe chinene. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Itora inyu yaahokolhelhiye velhi wo ulhikaanacha, uwoonihani wiira Nlhuku holhakelha, ni uyo nootimiriha yoyo mwaha uyo phiyaru.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Paahi etu, pwiiya Nafarao, munthanlheke ntu o irusho, mummaheke ntheko wo weemelhelha ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Tho, pwiiya Nafarao, mwaathanlhe attu o weemelhelha ilhapo, ntheko aya ukhalheke uvira apocheraka mpatta wo nthanu wo choolhia chonkhaye chinokumihiya, wo iyaakha saba cho nnema wo uruweriya chiyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Mwaalhehereke akhunguracheke choolhia chonkhaye iyaakha saba cho nnema wo choolhia chinchi chiyo. Choolhia chiyo chithokoreriyeke, ni weemelhelhiya ni ikuru inyu, pwiiya Nafarao, wiira chikhalhe akhiba yo iwani chonkhaye. Chithokoreriyeke rata chinene. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Chechiyo choolhia chiyo chinowa ukhalha akhiba yo waalhamiha attu ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri, ihiwe yaawalhawalha wo nlhatu wo ikuruna yo iyaakha saba chinowa uttwara kaanyuma chiyo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu anoovahiya ikuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Nlhove naakuminhe aya Nayusufu nahoonia ukhalha norera umihoolho wa Nafarao ni akavihi aya onkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Paahi etu Nafarao aheerelhacha akavihi aya, “Yolha ntu ulha hanaa Iphumu ya Nlhuku! Chani, ninowooria umpatta ntu nkina thoko yolha?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Nkeerelha Nayusufu wiira, “Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku houpatakulhelhani alha onkhaye alha, khaawo ntu nkina o irusho ni o wuupuwelha chittu choombone thoko inyuva. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Inyuva phi nohalha weemelhelha ilhapo aka, ni attu aka onkhaye anoowiwelhelhani inyuva. Mii vekha aka, phi mulhupalhe upwahani, ukhalhawaya kinokhalhelha ihiche yo imwene. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Paahi, kihothanlhani vano ukhalha ntu o weemelhelha ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri!” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Phi vavawo Nafarao vanrunlhe aya pete o nhuri vanikokhoni waya ni waawariha Nayusufu, nkayaawariha ni ikuwo chaya cho imwene ni nkufu aya wo idhahabu waawara aya nshikoni. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Nafarao nkayaawelhiha Nayusufu nkukuta aya wo imwene waapurulhiya ni ifarasi, akhalhaka nholhelhi nkavihi aya. Manyaasikari nkayaaholhelha akhuwelhachaka, “Mweemelheke amwene anoovira!” Phi Nafarao chenre aya wo waavaha Nayusufu ikuru yulhupalhe yo weemelhelha ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Wo uthepa vavawo, Nafarao nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Mii, phi amwene o Umisri! Kineera, ntu riyoothe mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye Umisri, hitheeshe moono wala mweto awe wo uhivahiya iruusa ni inyuva.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Nafarao nkayaavaha Nayusufu nchina no Imisri, Safenath panea. Nkayanthelhiha Asenathi, mwaamwana a Napotifera, yaari opochera ishaani o iwani yo Uoni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 41:45">Baada yo vavawo, Nayusufu ahochokholha nkwaha wo weetakachera ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Nayusufu yaari o malhipa o iyaakha makhumi mararu vaachokhonlhe aya uvara ntheko u Nafarao, amwene o Umisri. Ahothama unupani u Nafarao, nkayaarwaa nkwaha wo weetakachera ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri.<verse eid="GEN 41:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Nkayaakhalha wiira, iyaakha saba cho nnema wo uruweriya choolhia, imata chonkhaye cho Umisri chahoruweriya choolhia chinchi chinene. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Nayusufu nkayaakhungura choolhia chonkhaye chaaruweriye iyaakha saba cho nnema chiyo, nkayaathokoreria ni ushunga akhiba kila iwani yo Umisri. Kila iwani ahotheka nikhupi no akhiba yo choolhia cho mmamatani, vakhiviru ni vawani. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Ahothokoreria akhiba yinchi chinene yo choolhia, nkayaakhalha yinchi thoko nhaava wo ubaharini, ata khayooria waalhakelhiya.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Iyaakha cho ikuruna chihinaya uwa, Nayusufu yaari anaayanre achishaana elhi wa ahanu aya Naasenathi, abiti Potifera, mwaamwana a opochera ishaani o iwani yo Uoni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Mwaamwanaya o nttara ammanhe nchina nawe Manase, maana aya “ulhiyalhiha” ukhalhawaya yaari yeeraka, “Nlhuku hokilhiyalhiha uhuva waka wonkhaye, ni waalhiyalha ashilhoko aya athumwanaka onkhaye.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwaamwanaya o nayelhi, ammanhe nchina nawe Efraimu, maana aya “waapatta ashaana.” Ukhalhawaya yaari yeeraka, “Nlhuku hokivaha ashaana mwiilhaponi mwaattwarushiya aka.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Iyaakha saba cho nnema wo uruweriya choolhia chinchi chilhe nkachaavira. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Nkachaachokholha iyaakha saba cho ikuruna, thoko chenre aya wo uhimia Nayusufu katashi vawo. Ilhapo chikina chonkhaye nkachaawolhiya ithalha, nansho ilhapo yo Umisri yonkhaye yaari inachanre choolhia. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Ikatema attu o Umisri vaachokhonlhe aya uwolhiya ithalha, yahonlhelha Nafarao wiira avahiye choolhia. Nafarao, nkayeerelhacha attu o Umisri onkhaye wiira, “Nrweeke u Nayusufu, inohalha aya uhimeriani, mwapangeke yeyo.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Ikuruna nkayaathepa chinene, nkayaawanelha mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye Umisri. Paahi etu, Nayusufu nkayaahulha makhupi onkhaye, nkaathumiheracha attu o choolhia. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Wo uthepa vavawo, attu o ukhuma ilhapo chikina ahowaacha Umisri, uuthumani choolhia u Nayusufu, kwaani ikuruna yaari yo uweria chinene ilhapo yonkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Manyonnaya Nayusufu anoorwaa Umisri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Nayakhobo yeeweke wiira, chihawo choolhia Umisri, aheerelha achishaana aya wiira, “Chani woonaka nnokhalha chiicho mmwehanachaka thuu? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Kiheewa wiira, Umisri uwo choolhia chihawo. Nrwaacheke etu mwathumacheke choolhia nihiwe naakhwa ithalha.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Paahi manyonnaya Nayusufu khumi yahorwaa Umisri uthumani choolhia. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Nansho Nayakhobo khayanhiilhe Benyamini, nhima aya Nayusufu, wiira arwee vamoka ni yayo manyaattu ayo, ukhalhawaya yoova wiira aanokelha ntatakoni. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Paahi achishaana a Nayakhobo nkayaaphiyacha Umisri akhalhaka amoka munlhokoni mwa attu yaarwelhe uthumani choolhia, kwaani ata ilhapo yo Ukanaani ni iyo yahokelhiya ikuruna.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Nayusufu phi ari olhupalhe anene ilhapo yo Umisri. Yayo phi emelhelha mitheko cho waathumihera attu choolhia. Paahi manyonnaya nkayaawacha ni nkayaakhoroma wo heshima wa Nayusufu. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Nayusufu vonanche aya manyonnaya, ahaachuwelhacha, nansho nkayeepanga thoko khaachuwenlhe, nkoolhumana wo uchacha. Nkaakoha wiira anokhuma vayi yayo manyaattu ayo. Ni ayo nkayaakhulha wiira anokhuma Ukanaani, awiilhe uthuma choolhia. <verse eid="GEN 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Inakhalhaka Nayusufu ahaachuwelha manyonnaya, ayo khayaachuwenlhe. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Nayusufu nkayoopuwelha itora chaalhohilhe aya khalhayi chaachaka manyonnaya, nkayeerelha, “Mwaatti attu o uhotelha, mmwiilhe uno uwehaweha mwoone uhiichoria wo ilhapo ihu ilha.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Nansho ayo nkayaakhulhacha wiira, “Kuhii chiicho, nansho niwiilhe uthumani choolhia. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Hii achishaana a ntu mmoka, athumwanihu amoka. Hii attu o mitheko choombone, kahii attu o uhotelhacha.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Nayusufu nkayaaminda yeerelhaka wiira, “Mena, mwaatti mmwiilhe uhotelhani mwoone uhiichoria wo ilhapo ihu ilha.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Nkayaathepa manyaattu ayo uhimia wiira, “Hii anamitheko inyu naari achishaana khumi ni elhi, achishaana a ntu mmoka, nnenchi o ilhapo yo Ukanaani. Mwanhima ihu mwankani hohalha uwani ni athumwanihu, nhima ihu nkina ahorimelha khalhayi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Nansho Nayusufu nkayeerelhacha wiira, “thoko chinre aka wo uhimia, mwaatti attu o uhotelhacha. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Iphiro inohalha aka ulhikacherani phi ilha. Kinoolhupelha wo nchina ni Nafarao, wiira khannothamacha vaa, mpaka vanohalha inyu ummwiiha mwanhima inyu mwankani uyo wono. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Munrumeke mmoka inyu arwee ammwiihe nhima inyu uyo, uno mwaatti akina va, nttukiyaka ujerani. Vavawo phi nohalha aya uchuwania wiira malhove inyu ayo arii e ikekheene. Mwaahipangeke chiicho, kinolhupelha wo nchina ni Nafarao wiira, wo ikekheene mwaatti attu o uhotelhacha!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Amalhihekeru, nkaattuka onkhaye ujerani mahuku mararu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Nihuku no neraru Nayusufu nkayeerelha wiira, “Ukhalhawaya mii ki ntu nomwoova Nlhuku, mpangeke choo wiira mwoopwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Yakhalhaka we ikekhiaye mwa attu o mitheko choombone, mmoka inyu ahalheke ujerani, ni akina nhokolhiacheke mwarwehelheke choolhia ashilhoko inyu anowolhiya ithalha ayo. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Yamalhaka, mummwiiheke mwanhima inyu mwankani uyo. Yeyo phi nohalha uhimiechesha ikekheene yo malhove inyu ayo, ni mena khannowa mweeviya.” Paahi nkayaarumelhelha nenno nlhove nno.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Nkawaakhalhiya ntemera ashineneru achukulhachaka wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye ninohuva vano wo nlhatu wo ittu yo unanara yampangenlhe nhima ihu ilhe! Ukhalhawaya inakhalhaka nahomwona vaachukulha awe munrimani, khananlhonhe, ata vaanishontelhelha awe, khanaattunne umwiiwelhelha.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Narobeni nkayeerelhacha ashikhunanaya, “Chani, akolhumanche wiira nihimpangelhache ittu yo unanara nhima ihu ulhe? Nansho khakeewelhelhiye. Vano etu uttwaruwa wihu ulha uri wo nlhatu wo iphome awe ilhe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Manyaattu ayo yaari ahichuwelhaka wiira Nayusufu ahochuwelha chonkhaye chopuwelhacha aya, ukhalhawaya ikatema volhumana aya, olhumana wo iphiro yo ulhamulhelhiya ni ntu nkina. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Nayusufu nkayaarwa uchereshere, nkayaamoriha miithori. Vaamanlhe aya, ahohokolhia ni woopana mwaha. Baada yo vavawo nkaalhehera wiira Simeoni attukiye ipingu uno akina ayo yoonaka.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manyonnaya Nayusufu anohokolhiacha uwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Nayusufu nkayaalhehera wiira majuniya aya acharihiye choolhia, ni kila mmoka aya ahokolhosheriye nchurukhu awe nnijuniyani mwawe, tho avahachiye yolhia yo ulhia mphironi. Nkayaapangelhachiya chittu chonkhaye chiyo. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Yamalheke, nkayaathathiha iphuta majuniya o choolhia chiyo, nkayaathamacha. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Nkayaaphiya vakittu venshe aya nipuro no urupelha veelhelhiye aya nchuwa. Mmoka aya nkaathaphulha nsigo awe wiira akumihe ittu yo ulhiha iphuta awe, nansho nkaashanga uphwanya nchurukhu awe unari vamalhakuni vachulhu nijuniya nawe. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Nkeerelhacha ashunnawe wiira, “Nchurukhu aka uhohokolhoshiya. Uri vamalhakuni wo nijuniya va!” Ashikhunanawe ayo veewilhe aya chiicho, nkayaaririyacha, machiri nkayaamalhelha. Nkayaawehanacha, athukumelhachaka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Nkayaakohanacha, “Phi nlhatu waani yolha Nlhuku unonipangelhacha awe ulha?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Vaaphiyanche aya Ukanaani, wa athumwanaya, Nayakhobo, yahaatangachera mwaha wonkhaye waaphwannye, nkayeerelha wiira, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Mulhupalhe o ilhapo uyo anulhumanne wo uchacha chacha, ni unaanyihera wiira naari attu o uhotelha ilhapo aya. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Nansho naheevarangacha ni umwiirelha wiira khanaari attu o uhotelha, nansho attu o mitheko choombone. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Tho, nahonhimeria wiira naari ashaana o yaraana khumi ni elhi, athumwanihu amoka, nhima ihu mmoka horimelha, nkina mwankani ri uwani Ukanaani, hohalha ni athumwanihu. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Tho, Mulhupalhe o ilhapo uyo ahoniirelha wiira, ‘Cho, phi nohalha aka uchuwelha wiira mwaatti attu o mitheko choombone. Munhiyeke nhima inyu mmoka uwannyaka, ni akina va, nrweeheke choolhia wa ashilhoko inyu, ahiwe yaakhwa ithalha. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Mwamalhaka, mummwiiheke wono mwanhima inyu mwankani uyo, phi vavawo vanohalha aka uhimiechesha wiira mwa attu o mitheko choombone, kanhii attu o uhotelha. Vanohalha inyu upanga chiicho, nhima inyu nohalha uvarelhelhiya uyo, noohiyereriya. Ni inyu nnohiyereriya wiira mpange maronda mwiilhaponi mu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Ikatema veetta aya choolhia mmajuniyani mwaya, yahoshangacha woona kila mmoka aya hohokolhosheriya nrupa waahenlhe awe nchurukhu munsigoni mwawe. Vonne aya chiicho, onkhaye vamoka ni athumwanaya yahokelhiya woova. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Nayakhobo, athumwanaya, nkayaakhulha wiira, “Nnothanana ukithurulha achishaana aka onkhaye! Yusufu khaawo, ni Simeoni khaawo, vano tho nnothanana unkusha ni Benyamini. Onkhaye ayo anokipatta mii!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Vavawo Narobeni nkayeerelha athumwanaya, “Kaahinhokolhosheke Benyamini, mweeveke etu achishaana aka elhi ayo. Munhiyeke Benyamini uyo mmathathani mwaka, ni mii kinomwinkelha ni uhokolhosherani.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Nansho Nayakhobo, athumwanaya, nkayaakhulha wiira, “Mwaamwanaka ulha khanorwaa wowo, kwaani munnawe horimelha, yoyo vekha awe phi hanlhe, ni mii kiholhuvalha. Benyamini ulha athuriyaka mwommo munkwahani mwinyu mmo, kinookhwa wo nlhatu no ihuzuni inohalha aka uthepa upatta iyo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Nabenyamini anoorwa Umisri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Ikuruna nkayaathepa chinene mwiilhaponi Ukanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Baada yo umalha choolhia chaathumme aya Umisri chilhe, Nayakhobo yaheerelha achishaana aya, “Nrweeke tho Umisri mwanithumelhe choolhia chikina vakani.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Nansho Nayuda nkayeerelha athumwanaya, “Ntu ulhe ahonaamuka chinene, eeraka, ‘Akinoupocherani tho mwaahiweeke ni mwanhima inyu mwankani.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Mwarumelhelhaka etu univaha nhima ihu mwankani uyo wiira ninttukane, ninoorwaa uthumelhani choolhia etu. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Nansho mwaahittuneke wiira ninttukane, khaninorwaa wowo, ukhalhawaya ntu ulhe aaniirenlhe wiira, ‘Khannokoona mwaahimmwaaneke mwanhima inyu mwankani uyo.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Nayakhobo nkayaakoha, “Nlhatuni no ukihelha ihuzuni wo unhimeria ntu uyo wiira nhanaa mwanhima inyu nkina?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Nkayaakhulha, “Ntu ulhe ahonikohakoha rata mwaha unonaacha hii ni ashilhoko ihu, eeraka, ‘Chani, athumwaninyu akumi nanlhelho? Chani, nhanaa mwanhima inyu nkina?’ Paahi naamwakhunlhe thoko chenre awe wo unikoha. Vavawo nikonrie chani etu uchuwelha wiira aanoniirelha, ‘Mwammwiiheke mwanhima inyu’?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Nayuda nkayeerelha athumwanaya, “Nkihiyeke mii kinttukane, nirwee wowo nathume choolhia, nihiwe naakhwa ithalha vamoka ni inyu ni achishaana ihu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Mii kimwanene kinoomwemelhelha. Kahinhokolhosheke nkamwaamwoona, paahi etu unyoholhiya uwo ukhalheke wawaka, mahuku onkhaye o uhimalha. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Yakaari khanaapinche, naari ninarwelhe mikwaha milhi ni uhokolhia.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Vavawo Nayakhobo, nkayeera, “Haya! Ukhalhawaya ihokhalha ilazima yiirie chiicho, paahi etu munkushereke izawadi yo chittu chorera cho mwiilhaponi mwihu mu. Nkusheke makhura o mmwepa vakani, urawo vakani, ubani, manemane, ikungu ni ilozi, munrwehelheke.<verse eid="GEN 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />“Nkusheke nchurukhu wo uthumelha choolhia, tho nhilhiyalhe uhokolhosha nchurukhu mweesheriye inyu mmajuniyani mwinyu ulhe, veekinaka mweesheriye mwommo wo ukoseriya. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Munkusheke ni nhima inyu uyo, nrweeke wa yoyo ntu uyo.<verse eid="GEN 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />“Nlhuku ri O Machiri, ovaherekeni mwoonelhiye ikiriri umihoolho wa yoyo ntu uyo, wiira anhiyerere mwanhima inyu nkina ulhe, vamoka ni Benyamini, ahokolhiache vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. Ukhalhawaya kaapoterihaka, baasi kihaapoteriha.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Vavawo nkayaakushacha izawadi chilhe ni nchurukhu mikwaha milhi, wiira ahokolhoshe ni nkina weesheriye aya mmajuniyani mwaya katashi valhe. Nkayaarwaa Umisri vamoka ni nhimaya, Benyamini. Vaaphilhe aya, ahorwaa ni wiichooniha umihoolho wa Nayusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Nayusufu vaamwonne aya Benyamini nari vamoka ni manyaattu ayo, ahomwiirelha ntu owemelhelha inupa aya wiira, “Mwaarweeheke alha manyaattu alha unupani waka, mwanhitheke mwannama mmoka, mwaapieke yolhia yoombone. Ukhalhawaya lhelho kinothanana ulhia yolhia ni alha manyaattu alha.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Ntu owemelhelha inupa uyo nkaapanga thoko chaalheheriye awe, nkaarweehacha alheto alhe unupani wa Nayusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Manyaattu ayo vaarwehiya aya unupani wa Nayusufu, ahokelhiya woova, nkayolhumacha ashineneru, “Niwiihiye wono wo nlhatu wo nchurukhu waahokolhosheriye ihu mmajuniyani mwihu nkwaha wo upacha ulhe, wiira apatte nlhatu wo uniithelha anaatakache ni unithurulha iphuta chihu, nikhalhe ipotta chaya.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Paahi etu nkaayarwa wa ntu owemelhelha inupa ya Nayusufu ulhe, nkayaamulhumana vaakelha aya vawani vawo, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />nkayaamwiirelha, “Munna! Hii nahowa va nkwaha wo upacha uthumani choolhia. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Vaaphilhe ihu nipuro naarupenlhe ihu mphironi mmo, nahothaphulha majuniya ihu, nkanaashanga woona nchurukhu wo kila mmoka ihu unari nhina vachulhu nsigo awe, thoko chaari aya vaalhinve awe. Vano etu, nihowaana nchurukhu uyo wiira nihokolhoshe. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Nihowaana ni nchurukhu nkina wiira nithume choolhia. Khanichuwenlhe mpani etu aneeshenre nchurukhu uyo mmajuniyani mwihu mmo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Ntu owemelhelha inupa ulhe nkaakhulha, “Nhikelhiye nipampa, wala nhoove. Veekinaka Nlhuku inyu, Nlhuku a athumwaninyu, phi uyo ohokolhoshenreni nchurukhu mmajuniyani mwinyu. Mii kahopochera nchurukhu inyu.” Nkammwiiha Simeoni, munnaya.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Ntu owemelhelha inupa uyo nkaakharibisha unupani wa Nayusufu, nkaavacha maashi o ukhucha mmietoni, ni ulhiha iphuta chaya. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Manyaattu ayo nkayaakumihacha izawadi chaya weesha tayari waavaha Nayusufu, ukhalhawaya yaheewa wiira, anowa ulhia yolhia vamoka ni ayo.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Nayusufu vaahokolhelhe aya uwani, manyaattu ayo ahokushacha izawadi chaya chilhe, nkayaakhoromelhacha. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Nayusufu nkaakohacha, tho ni waakoha, “Chani athumwaninyu anowungwelhelha? Akumi nanlhelho?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Nkayaakhulhacha, “Eiyo, namitheko inyu, athumwanihu, anowungwelhelha, akumi nanlhelho.” Nkayaakhoromacha tho.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Nayusufu vennuwilhe aya miitho aya ni umwoona nhima aya, Benyamini, yarelhe wa anumwanaya amoka, nkayeera, “Ulha phi nhima inyu mwankani mwanhimianche inyu?” Ahinaya waakhulhiya, nkayeera, “Nlhuku ovahere mwamunnaka!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Wo uhikhulhuvelhiya, Nayusufu ahothama vavawo vakittu vawo, kwaani miithori chaari chaamoraka wo nlhatu wo umwoona nhima aya, nkayaakelha uchumbani waya ni wichunlhelha. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Baada yo ukhucha wiitho, nkayaakhuma ekayaka, nkayaalhehera yolhia iwiihiye. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Nayusufu nkayeesheriya yolhia vekha aya, ni ashunnaya nkayeesheriya wo vekha aya. Tho ni attu o Umisri yaari vavawo ayo nkayesheriya wo vekha aya, kwani attu o Umisri khayaari alhiaka yolhia vamoka ni Aebraniya.<verse eid="GEN 43:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Ashunnaya Nayusufu nkayaakhalhihachiya umihoolho wa Nayusufu wo uttwarana iyaakha chaya, uchokholha o upacha mpaka o ittiako. Nkayaahalha awehanachaka, anashangilhe. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Yolhia nkayaakawiya ukhuma vamezani wa Nayusufu ni urwehelhiya manyaattu ayo, nansho Benyamini aavahiye mikwaha nthanu upwaha chaavahiye aya manyonnawe. Paahi etu, nkawaawuriya ni ushangarariya vamoka.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Ikikombe yaapotenre inoophwanyiya wa Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Yamalhekeru, Nayusufu nkayanlhehera namitheko owemelhelha inupa aya wiira, “Nchariheke majuniya a alha attu alha choolhia chinohalha aya wooria ukusha. Mwamalhaka, nhelheke nchurukhu umalhakuni wo majuniya o kila mmoka. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Vachulhu nsigo wa mwankani chinene uyo, mweesheke ikikombe aka ikooroshiye wo isiliva, vamoka ni nchurukhu awe.” Ni uyo nkaapanga thoko chilheheriye awe ni Nayusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Washeekeru, nkayaalhehachiya wiira athamache vamoka ni iphuta chaya. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Vaari aya mphironi aneetilhe vakani uthama vawani vawo, Nayusufu ahomwiirelha ntu owemelhelha inupa aya ulhe wiira, “Mwaakuvie! Mwaattware attu alhe, mwaaaphwanyaka mwaakoheke, ‘Chani woonaka moombone mpangelhiye inyu ayo nnolhivihera wo upanga chittu cho uhilhoka? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Nlhatuni etu no wiiya ikikombe ya anene ilhapo? Ikikombe inowureria aya, ni ikatema ikina anomoopelha aya nttiti? Vavawo mwaatti nhopanga ittu yo unanara chinene!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Ntu owemelhelha inupa ulhe nkaattwara. Vaaphwannye awe, nkoolhumacha malhove thoko chaahimeriye awe. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Nansho manyaattu ayo nkayaakoha, “Munna, nri ni maana ani unulhumachera yayo malhove ayo? Hii anamitheko inyu va, khaninoria mena upanga ittu thoko yeyo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Muupuwelheke wiira, nahouhokolhosherani nchurukhu waaphwannye ihu Ukanaani, mmajuniyani mwihu ulhe. Inohalha wooria chani wiira niiye isiliva ama idhahabu unupani wa anene ilhapo inyu ayo? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Paahi etu mwamphwanyaka mmoka ihu ni ikikombe iyo, eeviyeke, ni hii onkhaye akina va, nikhalheke ipotta chinyu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Ntu owemelhelha inupa uyo nkaakhulha, “Aye, ikhalheke etu thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha chiyo. Ntu riyoothe nohalha uphwanyiya nakunshe ikikombe iyo, nookhalha ipotta aka, nansho akina khannokhalha ni nlhatu uwannyaka.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Paahi etu kila mmoka nkaakuvia ukurusha nsigo awe vathi ni uthaphulha. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Ntu owemelhelha inupa ulhe nkaakukhuriacha majuniya onkhaye, achokholhaka wa mulhupalhe aya ni umalhihera wa mwankani chinene uyo. Ikikombe nkayaaphwanyiya munsigoni mwa Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Vavawo nkayaahulhacha ikuwo chaya wo nlhatu no ukelhiya ihuzuni. Kila mmoka nkaawelhiha nsigo awe vachulhu iphuta awe, nkayaahokolhia tho vawani.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Nayuda ni achihimaya nkayaaphiya unupani wa Nayusufu, ni Nayusufu yaari bado vanupani waya vawo. Vaaphiyanche aya, yahokhoromacha mpaka vathi, waakhoromelha Nayusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Nayusufu nkayaakoha, “Mpanngeni mwaatti? Khanchuwenlhe wiira ntu thoko mii kinowooria ulhohera chittu?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Nayuda nkayaakhulha, “Naakhulheke ittu yaani munna? Nulhumacheke nlhove naani no wooniha wiira khanittenke? Nlhuku hopatakulha milhatu chihu cho uwonya, hii anamitheko inyu va. Vano hii onkhaye va nihokhalha ipotta chinyu, hii vamoka ni ntu phwanyiye ni ikikombe inyu uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Nansho Nayusufu nkayeera, “Mena! Mii akinooria upanga chiicho. Ntu phwanyiye ni ikikombe aka uyo, phi yoyo nohalha ukhalha ipotta aka. Inyu mwaatti onkhaye va, nhokolhiacheke wo mpuha wa athumwaninyu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayuda anomunlhelha Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Phi vavawo Nayuda vaarwelhe aya ni waatameria Nayusufu ni weerelha, “Munna, kinoulhepelhani wiira nkihiyeke mii namitheko inyu kulhumache malhove vakani o wiivaranga, kinoulhepelhani wiira nhikithunalhelhe, kwaani inyuva nri thoko Nafarao anene ayo. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Munna, inyuva mwahonikoha yakhalhaka wiira nihanaa athumwanihu ama achihima ihu, <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />ni hii nkanouhimeriani wiira nihanaa athumwanihu, ni ayo o wulhuvalha chinene, ni uhimeriani wiira nihanaa mwanhima ihu nkina mwankani yarelhe ikatema athumwanihu anolhuvanlhe. Munnawe yoyo mmirawo uyo horimelha khalhayi, ni yoyo mwankani uyo phi halhenlhe vekha awe wa anumwanawe, ni athumwanihu ayo yoyo phi nonttuna aya chinene. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Ni inyu munna, mwahonilhehera hii anamitheko inyu wiira, nimmwiihe nhima ihu uyo mmwoone. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Nkanouhimeriani wiira, yoyo mwammirawo uyo khanooria uthama waahiya athumwanawe, athamaka, athumwanawe ayo anokhwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Nansho inyuva munna nkamwaanirelha wiira, naahiweeke ni mwanhima ihu mwankani uyo, khannonipochera tho.<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Vaahokolhelhe ihu uwani wa namitheko inyu, athumwanihu, nahaahimeria chenre inyu wo unilhehera. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Kaanyuma etu, vaanirenlhe aya wiira niwe uno tho, niwe naathuma choolhia, <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />naheerelha wiira, ‘Khaninooria uwa uno, naahinttukaneke mwanhima ihu mwankani uyo, inyuva khannowa mwaanipochera.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Paahi namitheko inyu, athumwanihu, nkayaanirelha, ‘Nhochuwelha wiira, ahanu aka Naraheli aakiyarenlhe achishaana elhi ashilhopwana, <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />mmoka ahopotera, ni mii nkakeera, veekinaka hopapharulhiya ni nshene, ukhalhawaya akimwonne tho. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Mwankushaka ni ulha ni wowo athuriyaka, ihuzuni inohalha ukipatta iyo, nnokiwuhelha kinolhuvanlhe thoko chiri aka.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Paahi etu munna, ukumi aya uri mmathathani mwa ulha mwammirawo ulha. Kahokolhiaka etu wa namitheko inyu, athumwanaka, kinanhilhe ulha uno, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />yaahimwooneke ninanttukanne, anookhwa! Paahi etu hii anamitheko inyu ninowauhelha athumwanihu ayo wo nlhatu no ihuzuni inohalha waapatta iyo.<verse eid="GEN 44:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />“Wo uthepa vavawo, mii kimwanene va, kaheekumiha wa athumwanaka wiira kinomwinanelha mmirawo ulha kiiraka, ‘Kaahinhokolhosheke Benyamini uwannyu, milhatu chikikhalhelheke mii, mahuku onkhaye o uhimalha.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Vano munna, kinoushontelhelhani wiira, mii kihalheke va, kikhalheke ipotta inyu vanipuroni vawe vawo. Munhiyeke uyo arwee ahokolhie uwani vamoka ni manyonnawe ayo. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Ukhalhawaya kinohalha wooria chani uhokolhia wa athumwanaka kihinttukanne mmirawo ulha? Akinooria uvilhelha woona ittu yo uhilhoka inohalha waaphwanya athumwanaka iyo.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu anowiichuwelhiha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Vavawo Nayusufu nkayoochelha wiikaya umihoolho wa attu onkhaye yaari vavawo ayo, nkayoomolhacha akhuwelhaka wiira, “Ukhumachiye vathe.” Paahi Nayusufu vaari vekha aya aheehimiacha wa manyonnaya. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Nansho yaari onlhaka wo ukhuwelha mpaka anenchi o Umisri nkayeewa, mpaka ata Nafarao yaheewa yoyo mwaha uyo. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Nayusufu nkayeerelha manyonnaya wiira, “Mii Yusufu. Chani athumwanaka akumi nanlhelho?” Nansho manyonnaya ayo nkayaahalha anoomiye uwanoni, yoochelhaka nlhove no waakhulha. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Phi vavawo Nayusufu veerenlhe aya manyonnaya, “Nchushereke wono uri aka va.” Vaachusheranche aya nkeerelhacha, “Mii, Yusufu, mwanhima inyu mwanthumihilhe inyu wa attu o Umisri ulhe. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Nansho vano nhikelhiye nipampa wala wiichukulhelha wo nlhatu no ukithumiha uwo. Nlhuku phi kiwiihilhe uno kuholhelheni, wiira kokholhe ukumi wa attu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Ilha iyaakha yo nayelhi yo ikuruna velhaponi va, nansho bado iyaakha nthanu chikina, attu vahinowa aya wooria ulhima mena uruweria choolhia. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Nlhuku aakiwiihilhe uno wiira kiholhelhe, kookholhe ukumi inyu, wo iphiro yo ushangiha ilha, ikhalhe wiira, mwaattiva ni iyari chinyu nkhalhe akumi velhaponi. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Paahi etu, mwaatti kanhii nkiwiihilhe uno, nansho Nlhuku. Phi yoyo kipannge mii ukhalha ntu o waakavihera ntheko Nafarao, kikhalhe ntu o wemelhelha inupa aya yonkhaye ni utawara ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Paahi mwaakuviheke, nrweeke wa athumwanaka ni weerelha wiira, ‘Mwaamwaninyu Yusufu neera, Nlhuku hokipanga ukhalha nkavihi a amwene o ilhapo yo Umisri. Paahi, nhicherewe uwa uwannyaka. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Nnookhalha ilhapo yo Ugosheni, uhiri utayi ni mii. Inyuva mwaanene, achishaana inyu ni ashichulhu inyu, mihuwo chinyu ni nhakhu inyu wonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Vanohalha inyu ukhalha Ugosheni vawo, mii kinoushungani inyuva, ashilhoko inyu onkhaye vamoka ni mihuwo chinyu nhiwe mwaakhwa ithalha, kwaani bado chihohalha iyaakha nthanu chikina cho ikuruna.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Nayusufu amalhihekeru wulhumacha, nkayeera, “Mwaattiva nhoonechesha mwaashinene wo miitho inyu, ni ata nhima aka Benyamini, hoona mwanene wiira, phi mii Yusufu kinowulhumanani mwaatti. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Mwaahimiachereke athumwanaka mwaha wo ikuru irinaka Umisri uno, ni chittu chonkhaye chonne inyu mwaashinene. Paahi etu, mwaakuviheke, nrwe mwaawihe athumwanaka uno.” <verse eid="GEN 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Yamalhekeru, Nayusufu yahonkumbatira Benyamini, nhima aya, nkayonlha, Benyamini ni uyo nkonlha, uno anakumbatiranne. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Tho, ahaakumbatiracha manyonnaya, uno yonlhaka. Baada yo vavawo nkoopana mwaha manyonnaya ayo.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Yoyo mwaha uyo vaaphilhe aya wa amwene wiira ashilhoko aya Nayusufu ahowaacha, wahaateelhiha Nafarao chinene, vamoka ni anamitheko aya. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Paahi etu Nafarao nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Mwaahimerieke ashilhoko inyu ayo athatheke iphuta chaya chiyo misigo, ahokolhiache Ukanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />yaakushe athumwaninyu ni ashilhoko inyu onkhaye, awaache wono. Mii kinowaavaha ilhapo yoombone chinene yo ukhalha Umisri uno, vakittu vanohalha aya ukhalha wo upuha chittu chonkhaye cho mwiilhaponi mu. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Mwaahimerieke wiira awiacheke mikukuta cho upurulhiya ni ashinama, yaakusheke achishaana aya ashinkani ni manyaahanu aya, mena ahilhiyalhe waawiiha athumwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Ahilhohe chittu chinohalha aya uhiya wowo, ukhalhawaya ilhapo yoombone phi nowa ukhalha yawaya Umisri uno.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Paahi achishaana a Nayakhobo nkayaapanga thoko chenre aya wo ulheheriya. Nayusufu nkayaavahacha mikukuta thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Nafarao, ni yolhia aya yo ulhia munkwahani. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Ahaavahacha kila mmoka ikuwo chikina cho uwara munkwahani, nansho Benyamini ammanhe ikuwo nthanu cho uwara mphironi ni nchurukhu makhobilhi imia ttaru. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Tho, aharwehelha athumwanaya misigo cho izawadi yo chittu chorera cho Umisri, wo nlhatu wo nkwaha aya uyo. Izawadi chaakushihiye iphuta khumi, ni iphuta chithiyana khumi chaakushihiye choolhia, mikatte ni choolhia chikinachikina. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Paahi Nayusufu nkaalhehana ni manyonnaya. Vaathamacha aya ahaamukacha yeeraka, “Nhaanache indewo mphironi mmo!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Paahi, nkayaathamacha Umisri ni uhokolhia uwani Ukanaani, wa athumwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Vaaphilhe aya, nkayaahimeria athumwanaya wiira, “Yusufu, nkumi! Yoyo phi vahiye ikuru yo utawara ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri!” Vavawo athumwanaya ahoomiya uwanoni, kwaani khayonrie urumelhelha malhove yaahimiacha aya yayo manyaattu ayo.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Nansho vaahimeriye aya mwaha wonkhaye ulheheriye aya ni Nayusufu, ni vonne aya mikukuta chaarwehelhiye aya wiira chaakushe chiyo, nrima aya wahokhalha mmapuroni, nkayaateelhiya wo upwaha chinene. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Nkayeera, “Vano nrima aka uhokhalha rata, wo ikekhiaye mwaamwanaka Yusufu, nkumi! Kinoorwa wowo, kamwoone kihinaya ukhwa.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anoorwaa Umisri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Paahi Nayakhobo ahochokholha nkwaha wo uthama vamoka ni mihakhu chaya chonkhaye. Vaaphilhe aya Ubeer Sheba, ahokumiha isadaka yo ummaha Nlhuku a Naisaka, athumwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Nlhuku nkoolhumana Nayakhobo ntorani uhiyu, vehanne awe, “Nayakhobo! Nayakhobo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Aah, mii va.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Nlhuku nkeerelha, “Mii phi Nlhuku, Nlhuku a athumwaninyu. Nhoove urwaa Umisri, ukhalhawaya kinokowaapanga achishaana inyu ukhalha nikosho nulhupalhe wowo. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Mii kimwanene kinouttukanani Umisri uwo, ni uhokolhoshani uno tho. Vanohalha inyu urimelha, Nayusufu phi nohalha uwa uphilhihani miitho inyu.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Paahi etu Nayakhobo nkayaathama Ubeer Sheba. Achishaana aya yahaawelhiha Nayakhobo, athumwanaya, achishaana aya ashinkani, ni manyaahanu aya mmikukutani chopurulhiya ni afarasi yaarwehelhiye aya ni Nafarao wiira chaakushe. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Tho, ahokushacha mihuwo ni mihakhu chaya chonkhaye chaapattilhe aya Ukanaani, nkawaarweiya Umisri. Nayakhobo yaathamme vamoka ni iyari aya yonkhaye, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />achishaana aya, ashichulhu aya ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, onkhaye nkayaawiihacha Umisri.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Achishaana a Nayakhobo yaarweelhe Umisri vamoka ni athumwanaya yaari, Narobeni, nttara naya, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />vamoka ni achishaana a Narobeni, yaani Henoko, Palu, Hesroni ni Karmi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Achishaana a Nasimeoni yaari, Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohari ni Shauli, annyanre aya ni nthiyana Nkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Achishaana a Nalawi yaari Gershoni, Kohathi ni Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Nayuda ni achishaana aya, Eri, Onani, Shela, Peresi ni Zera. Nansho Eri ni Onani yaarimenlhe vaari aya Ukanaani. Achishaana a Naperesi yaari Hesroni ni Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Achishaana a Naisakari yaari, Tola, Puva, Yashubu ama nchina nikina Yobu, ni Shimroni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Nazabuloni ni achishaana aya yaari, Seredi, Eloni ni Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Yayo phi achishaana ayanre aya Nalea waayarelha Nayakhobo Upadan aramu ulhe, tho ni mwaamwanaya nkina mwanthiyana Dina. Attu onkhaye, achishaana aya ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana ni ashichulhu yaakhumme wa Nalea yaari attu makhumi mararu ni araru.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Achishaana a Nagadi yaari, Sifioni, Hagi, Shuni, Esboni, Eri, Arodi ni Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Achishaana a Naasheri yaari, Imna, Ishva, Ishvi, Beriya ni Sera, mwanrokoraya. Beriya ni achishaana awe, Heberi ni Malkieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Yalha attu khumi ni sita alha, phi ashaana ni uchuulhu wa Nayakhobo ni Nazilpa, namitheko nthiyana Nalaabani avanhe aya anaaya, Nalea.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Naraheli aayarenlhe Nayakhobo achishaana elhi ashilhopwana, Yusufu ni Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Umisri uwo, Nayusufu ahaayara ashaana elhi ashilhopwana, Manase ni Efraimu. Anumwanaya yayo achishaana ayo yaari Naasenathi mwaamwana a Napotifera, opochera ishaani olhupalhe o iwani yo Uoni. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Achishaana a Nabenyamini yaari, Bela, Bekeri, Ashbeli, Gera, Naamani, Ehi, Roshi, Mupimu, Hupimu ni Adi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Yayo attu khumi ni acheshe ayo phi ashaana ni uchuulhu wa Nayakhobo ni ahanu aya, Naraheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwaamwana a Nadani aari Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Achishaana a Nanaftali yaari, Yaseeli, Guni, Yeseri ni Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Yayo attu saba ayo yaari phi achishaana ni uchuulhu wa Nayakhobo ni Nabilha, namitheko nthiyana Nalaabani avanhe aya anaaya, Naraheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Attu onkhaye yaarwelhe ni Nayakhobo Umisri, wo uhalhakelhiya manyaahanu a achishaana aya, yaari attu makhumi sita ni sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Umisri uwo Nayusufu ahaapatta ashaana ashilhopwana elhi. Paahi etu attu onkhaye o nlhoko wa Nayusufu Umisri uwo, yaari attu makhumi saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anoophiya Umisri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Nayakhobo nkayaahoolhelhiha Nayuda yaalhepelhe Nayusufu wiira yeekamelhe Ugosheni, ni ayo vaaphilhe aya Ugosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Nayusufu ahowelha munkukutani mwaya mwaapurulhiya ni ifarasi, nkayaarwaa uwekamelhani Nayakhobo, athumwanaya, Ugosheni uwo. Vaaphilhe aya vawo, yahaakumbatira athumwanaya, nkayonlha chinene. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Ata khakhwaaka vano, khave ittu ukhalhawaya kihoona ikhove inyu, ni uchuwelha wiira bado mwa akumi!”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Nayusufu nkayeerelha manyonnaya aya, “Kinokelha uwahimeriani Nafarao wiira, manyonnaka aka ni ashilhoko aya athumwanaka yaakhalhacha Ukanaani, ahowaacha uwannyaka. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Kinokowaahimeria wiira, mwaati mwa attu o uhuwa mihuwo, yoyo phi ntheko unopanga inyu, ni waahimeria wiira mmwiilhe vamoka ni ipuri, ikhondoro, ing'ope ni mihakhu chinyu chonkhaye. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Paahi Nafarao yowiihanakani ni ukohani, ‘Ntheko waani nnopanga inyu?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Mmweeke mwaakhulha, ‘Pwiiya, hii ntheko ihu uhuwa mihuwo, toka unamwane ihu mpaka nna, ukhalhawaya phi ntheko waavara aya manyaapwiiya ihu.’ Mweereke chiicho wiira nvahiye mapuro o ukhalha wi ilhapo yo Ugosheni.” Nayusufu yolhumacha chiicho ukhalhawaya attu o Umisri, yaari yaavehachaka attu o uhuwa ikhondoro.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Paahi Nayusufu nkayaarwa wa Nafarao ni weerelha, “Athumwanaka ni ashunnaka ahowaacha ukhuma Ukanaani. Awanche vamoka ni ipuri, ing'ope ni mihakhu chaya chonkhaye. Nna arii Ugosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Nayusufu ahaakusha manyonnaya athanu wiira oonihe u Nafarao, vavawo volhumana aya vawo.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Nafarao nkayaakoha, “Nnovara nthekoni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Nkayaakhulhacha, “Pwiiya, hii anamitheko inyu va, ntheko ihu uhuwa mihuwo, thoko chaavara aya manyaapwiiya ihu o khalhayi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Tho, nkayaathepa uhimia wiira, “Hii anamitheko inyu va, niwilhe uukhalhani uno thoko alheto, ukhalhawaya ukhumilhe ihu Ukanaani uwo, ikuruna ihothepa ukhalha yinchi, khiiwo ata ittu yo ulhiha mihuwo chihu. Paahi etu pwiiya, ninoulhepelhani hii anamitheko inyu wiira, nnivahe mapuro o ukhalha ilhapo yo Ugosheni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Nafarao nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Athumwaninyu ni ashilhoko inyu awilhe uttwarani inyuva. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri iri mmathathani mwinyu, mwaavaheke athumwaninyu ni ashunninyu ayo ilhapo yorera ukhalha mwiilhaponi mu. Mwaahiyacheke akhalheke Ugosheni. Ni yakhalhaka nhaachuwelha attu anooria uwehaweha mihuwo munlhokoni mwaya mmo, mwaathanlheke akhalheke o uwehaweha mihuwo chaka.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Yamalhekeru, Nayusufu nkayaakusha athumwanaya, Nayakhobo, awe yaashikuria Nafarao. Nayakhobo nkayaalhapelhelha ibarakha Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Nafarao nkayaakoha Nayakhobo, “Nri ni iyaakha nchani?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Nayakhobo nkayaakhulha, “Iyaakha cho uthamathama chivaheriye aka munkwahani mwaka mu, chiri iyaakha imia ni makhumi mararu. Chechiyo iyaakha chiyo chiri vakani, ni chiyo chiri cho uhuvahuva, tho khachinaphiyelha iyaakha chaakhanlhe aya manyaathumwanaka, munkwahani mwaya velhaponi va.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Baada yo vavawo, Nayakhobo yahaalhapelhelha ibarakha Nafarao, nkayaathama. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Paahi Nayusufu nkayaavaha athumwanaya ni manyonnaya mapuro mwi ilhapo yo Umisri. Ilhapo yo chayira chinene vakhiviru ni Uramesesi, yeeshe mapuro aya thoko chaalhehenre aya Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Nayusufu nkayaakhalha aavahaka choolhia athumwanaya, manyonnaya ni ashilhoko aya athumwanaya wo ulhikaana ni attu chaari aya mmanupani mwaya.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu ikatema yo ikuruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Baada yo mahuku, choolhia chahochokholha uthwaa kabisaa wiilhaponi wonkhaye. Ikuruna yaari yo uweria chinene mpaka attu onkhaye o Umisri ni o Ukanaani ahothommwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Nayusufu nkayaapochera nchurukhu wonkhaye wo ilhapo cho Umisri ni Ukanaani, waapattiye wo uthumiha choolhia, nkaarweha wa amwene Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Baada yo attu onkhaye o Umisri ni o Ukanaani umalhiha nchurukhu waya wonkhaye, attu o Umisri yahowa wa Nayusufu ni weerelha, “Nnivahe yolhia! Nikhweeke chani uno nnoonaka? Nchurukhu ihu wonkhaye uhonimalhelha!”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Nayusufu nkeerelhacha, “Yakhalhaka nchurukhu inyu uhomalha, nkivaheke etu mihuwo chinyu, ni mii kinouvahani yolhia.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Attu nkayaawiha mihuwo chaya u Nayusufu, ifarasi, Ikhondoro, ing'ope, ipuri ni iphuta. Ni ayo nkaavahacha choolhia. Yeyo iyaakha iyo Nayusufu ahopanga maronda o waakakhana choolhia ni mihuwo cha attu chonkhaye.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Iyaakha yaattwanre, yahowaacha tho ni uhimia wiira, “Pwiiya, wo ikekhiaye, nchurukhu ihu wonkhaye uhomalha, ni ashinama ihu onkhaye ahokhalha awinyu. Paahi etu pwiiya, hii anamitheko inyu va, khanirina ittu iriyoothe yo uvahani, yaahikhalhe hii naashinene chihu ni imata chihu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Nikhweeke chani etu uno nnoonaka ni imata chihu chitanganyie? Nnithumeke hii vamoka ni imata chihu nikhalhe ipotta chi Nafarao, nansho nipatte tu yolhia nihiwe naakhwa. Nnivaheke ni imbeyu cho waalha mmamatani mwihu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Paahi chiicho etu Nayakhobo nkayaathuma ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri ikhalhe yawaya Nafarao. Kila ntu o Umisri ahothananiya uthumiha imata awe, wo nlhatu wo ikuruna yo uweria chinene iyo. Ilhapo yonkhaye nkayaakhalha i Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Attu onkhaye nkayaakhalha ipotta chi Nafarao, athamihiyaka ukhuma nthelha mmoka wo ilhapo mpaka nthelha nkina, wiilhaponi Umisri uwo. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Ilhapo yahaathumiye ni Nayusufu yaari ilhe ya attu o upochera ishaani ilhe. Yayo manyaattu ayo khayaathananiye uthumiha imata chaya ukhalhawaya yaakhalhacha wo ukhulhuvelha upochera mahalha yaavahiya aya ni Nafarao. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Nayusufu nkayeerelhacha attu, “Mwooneke, kihouthumani mwaatti onkhaye ni imata chinyu ukhalha nhakhu u Nafarao. Nnoovahiya imbeyu ni inyu mwaalheke mmamatani mwinyu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Ikatema yo nlhalha, nnowa waavaha Nafarao kila mpatta mmoka wo kila mipata nthanu chinohalha inyu uruweria. Chinohalha ncheshe chiyo chinowa ukhalha yolhia inyu ni ashilhoko inyu vamoka ni achishaana inyu, ni imbeyu cho waalha mwaahiino.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Attu nkayaakhulha, “Pwiiya, nhookholha ukumi ihu! Ukhalhawaya nhonooniha urera wo nrima winyu, hii etu ninookhalha ipotta chi Nafarao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Phi vavawo Nayusufu vaatangachilhe aya nlheheriyo nimoka niri nivarelhiyaka mwiilhaponi Umisri toka vavawo mpaka nna. Kila ntu lazima akumihe wa Nafarao mpatta mmoka wo kila mipatta nthanu cho choolhia chinoruweria awe. Ilhapo yaakhalha opochera ishaani vekha aya phi iyo yahaathumiye ukhalha i Nafarao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikano cho umalhihera chi Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Paahi attu o Israeli nkayaakhalhacha ilhapo yo Ugosheni wiilhaponi Umisri. Wowo yahopatta mihakhu chinchi, nkayaaranacha ni wunchereria chinene. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Nayakhobo nkayaakhalha Umisri iyaakha khumi ni saba, mpaka vaaphihilhe aya iyaakha mia ni makhumi ncheshe ni saba.<verse eid="GEN 47:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Ikatema yo urimelha waya vaatamenrie aya, Nayakhobo aheehana anaaya, Nayusufu ni weerelha wiira, “Vano, yakhalhaka etu nnookittuna, mweesheke moono wuuthi mweto aka, nlhupelheke wiira nnookipangelha ikekheene. Kinoulhepelhani wiira, nhikivithe Umisri uno, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />nansho mwakaathalhelheke urupilhe aya manyaapwiiya aka. Nkikusheke ukhuma Umisri uno, mwakivitheke umahiyeni urupilhe aya uwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Nayusufu nkayaakhulha wiira, “Kinoopanga thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha chiyo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Nkilhupelhelheke etu!” Nayusufu nkayaalhupelhelha. Yamalhekeru, Nayakhobo ahooromelha umuruni wo nkori aya nkayanlhapelha Nlhuku.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anowaalhapelhelha ibarakha Efraimu ni Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Baada yo vavawo, Nayusufu ahohimeriya wiira athumwanaya areta. Paahi ahaakushacha achishaana aya elhi, Manase ni Efraimu, nkaarwaana wa athumwanaya uwo. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Nayakhobo vaahimeriye aya wiira, Nayusufu ahowa uwaashikuriani, aheemananiha ni wunkwa nkayaakhalha vankorini. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Nlhuku o Machiri ahokikhumelhelha vaari aka Uluzu, ilhapo yo Ukanaani, nkaakivaha ibarakha. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Aakirenlhe, ‘Mwooneke, kinouvahani inyuva iyari yinchi, kinoupangani ukhalha athumwanaya makosho molhupalhe a attu. Ilha ilhapo ilha kinowa waavaha achishaana inyu, ikhalhe yawaya mahuku o uhimalha.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Nayakhobo nkayaathepa weerelha Nayusufu, “Achishaana inyu elhi mwaapattilhe inyu Umisri uno, kihinaaya uwa, achishaana aka. Efraimu ni Manase anookhalha achishaana aka thoko chiri aya Narobeni ni Nasimeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Nansho ashaana nnohalha inyu waapatta mahuku anowa, awinyu. Ni ayo anowa ukawelhiya ilhapo yo uhiyeriya wo nchina na manyonnaya alha. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Kinolhamulha chiicho wo nlhatu wa anumwaninyu, Naraheli. Vaahokolhia aka ukhuma Upadan, ahorihiaa ilhapo yo Ukanaani, vaatameria ihu uphiya Uefratha, nkaakihiyera ihuzuni yulhupalhe. Kaavinthe vavawo, vachereshere iphiro inokelha Uefratha.” Alha mahuku alha vaneehaniya Ubethlehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Nayakhobo vonne aya achishaana a Nayusufu, ahokoha, “Phi apani yalha ashinganya alha?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Nayusufu nkayaakhulha wiira, “Alha achishaana aka, Nlhuku kivahenre awe vari aka Umisri uno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Nayakhobo nkayeera, “Mwaawiiheke uno, kaavahe ibarakha.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Miitho a Nayakhobo khayoona rata wo nlhatu no wulhuvalha waya. Paahi Nayusufu ahaachushereriha achishaana aya wa apwiiyaya, ni ayo ahaakumbatiracha.<verse eid="GEN 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Amalhihekeru, Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Akaanyihenre wiira kinoowa kowoonani tho, nansho Nlhuku hokivahera woona ata achishaana inyu!” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Vavawo Nayusufu ahaathamiha vaapakatachiye aya ni apwiiyaya vawo, nkayaakhoroma wo heshima.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Nayusufu nkayeeshacha Efraimu wiimushi wa Nayakhobo ni Manase wiimonono waya. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Nansho Nayakhobo nkayaatindaniha miono chaya, nkayeesha moono aya wo wiimonono vamuruni wa Efraimu, inakhalhaka aari phi mwankani, ni moono aya wo wiimushi vamuruni wa Manase, mulhupalhe uyo. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Yeeshekeru, ahaalhapelhelha ibarakha Nayusufu yiiraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Nlhuku aathimichiye ni manyaathumwanaka, Aburahimu ni Naisaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Nlhuku kiholhenlhe mii mu ukumini mwaka mpaka nna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">aavahe ibarakha alha ashimirawo alha!<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Ni nnepa wo wiirimu waakokhonlhe mwo uhilhoka mwonkhaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">aavahe ibarakha alha ashimirawo alha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Nchina naka ni machina a manyaapwiiya aka, Aburahimu ni Naisaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">alhokelhihiye nhina mwaya alha ashimirawo alha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">onchererie ni ukhalha enchi velhaponi va!”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Nayusufu vonne aya wiira athumwanaya ahotindaniha miono, aheesha moono aya wo wiimonono vamuruni wa Efraimu, khayaateelhiye. Paahi nkayaavara moono wa athumwanaya, athananaka uthamiha vamuruni wa Efraimu, eeshe vamuruni wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Nkayeerelha athumwanaya, Nayakhobo, wiira, “Kuhiwe chiicho thithi! Ulha va phi o nttara. Mmweeshereke ulha moono inyu wo wiimonono vamuruni vawe vawo.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Nansho athumwanaya ayo nkayaakhota yeeraka, “Kihochuwelha, mwaamwanaka, mii kihochuwelha. Achishaana a Manase ni ayo anowa ukhalha nikosho nulhupalhe no uchuwania. Inakhalhaka chiicho, mwankani ulha phi nowa uthepa ukhalha ni ikuru yulhupalhe umpwaha munnawe, ni achishaana awe anowa ukhalha makosho menchi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Paahi etu Nayakhobo nkaalhapelhelhacha ibarakha nenno nihuku nno yeeraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">“Attu o Israeli anowa uromolha machina inyu uvahera ibarakha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">anowa wiira, ‘Nlhuku ovaherekeni thoko Efraimu ni Manase!’ ” Wo wiira chiicho, ahonholhelhiha Efraimu umihoolho wa Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Baada yo vavawo, Nayakhobo nkayeerelha Nayusufu, “Thoko chineera inyu wo woona chi, mii kihaatameria vanokhwa aka. Inakhalhaka chiicho etu, Nlhuku nookhalha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti, nouhokolhoshani wiilhaponi wa manyaapwiiya inyu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Wo uthepa vavawo, kihouvahani inyuva, kahii manyonninyu ilhapo imoka yo umiakoni, kaathurunlhe aka attu o Uamori, vaakottonlhe aka wo uphanga ni muura aka.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Nayakhobo anowaavahacha ibarakha achishaana aya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Nayakhobo nkayeehana achishaana aya, nkayeera,<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Nthukumaneke mwiiwe chittu chinohalha ukhumelhelhani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Achishaana a Nayakhobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Nkiiwelhelheke mii, athumwaninyu, Israeli.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Narobeni inyuva phi nttara naka, machiri aka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">uchokholha no mwiiruttuni mwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">inyuva phi thepilhe ikuru ni machiri wa achihima inyu.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Inyuva nri thoko maashi o uvilhuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Nansho khannokhalha tho mulhupalhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">ukhalhawaya mwahowelha vankorini waka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">eiyo, nhonyalhiha nkori aka!”<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Nasimeoni ni Nalawi, inyu mwaatti ntu ni munnawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Ikerero chaya chiyo phi nopangelha aya chittu cho ushilhilhi.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Akinottuna uttwara miruku chaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">nrima aka uhittune ukhalha nnokumaana aya mmo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">ukhalhawaya, vaathunanlhe aya ahomwiiva ntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">wo utelhiya waya uwo, ahothikilhacha nthinga wo ing'ope.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Urushiya waya ulhaviye, ukhalhawaya uhothepa woopiha chinene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">ni urushiya waya uhiri ni ikiriri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Kinowaakawanihacha mu ilhapo i Nayakhobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Kinowaamwarushacha mu ilhapo yo Israeli.”<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“Inyuva Nayuda, nnoototopelhiya ni achihima inyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Nnoowa mwaama vammilho amalhaponi inyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Ashunninyu anowa uworomelhani.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Inyuva Nayuda, anaaka, nri thoko mwaakharamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">thoko kharamu o vara, wenlhe nchulhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Nneechokolha thoko kharamu rumpe vathi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Khaawo ntu nooria ummusha.<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Ntonto wo umwene khunowa waathama u Nayuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mena ikopo yo utawarelha khinowa yaathama vamietoni waya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Mpaka vanohalha aya uwa ulhe ri mwanene ulhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">nohalha urumelhelhiya ni makosho onkhaye ulhe.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Nowa uttukelhelha iphuta awe vanzabibuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">ni mwaaphuta aya vanzabibu worera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Noochahunya ikuwo chawe ndivaini, idivai yo khwilha.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Miitho awe ari o khwilha thoko idivai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">miitho awe oriipa thoko idivai, miino awe oteelha thoko mapelhe.”<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Nazabuloni anowa ukhalha umbwaani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Ichengwe aya inowa ukhalha nipuro no weemesheriya imeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Ilhapo aya inowa waatamana ni ilhapo yo Usidoni.”<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Naisakari ari thoko iphuta yo machiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">inechathalhelha variyari misigo chawe.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Ahoona nipuro no wiittuwa, ukhalha vakittu vorera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">ni woona wiira ilhapo iri yorera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Nkayooroma nikhatha naya akushe nsigo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">nkayaakhalha ipotta, inopanga mitheko wo ukhanyererihiya.”<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Nadani anowa ukhalha o waamulha rata attu aya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">Ari thoko makosho makina o attu o Israeli chinopanga aya.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Nadani anowa ukhalha thoko ivilhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">thoko inwaa yo uhapalha iri vachereshere iphiro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">inolhuma ikotokotto cho ifarasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">ni ummulhusha ntu nowelha uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Pwiiya Nlhuku, kinouwehererani, wiira nkoopolhe.”<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Nagadi anowa waananiya ni attu o uvara makhuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">nansho yayo anowa waattwara utulhi ni woomolhacha.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Ittaya i Naasheri inowa uchara choolhia chinchi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">Ni ayo anowa ukumiha yolhia yo waaphwanelha amwene.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Nanaftali ari thoko naahe o ukwatulha nttavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">naayara ashaana orera.”<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Nayusufu ari thoko mwiri wo wimma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">mwiri umenlhe vanraponi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">maritta aya anovira vachulhu ishiri.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Anamiupa ahomwaanana chinene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">nkayammwonyera miupa ni unthemwiha venchi.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Nansho muura ni muupa aya bado uri wo machiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">ni miono chaya chihovahiya machiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">wo wooria wa Nlhuku O Machiri a Nayakhobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">wo nchina no Nshunga, Mwalha o Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Nlhuku a athumwaninyu okavihereni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Nlhuku o Machiri ovahekeni ibarakha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mpatte ibarakha cho urupelhiya ipulha yo ukhuma uchulhu wiirimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">ibarakha cho milhiwi cho maashi cho wiisha chinene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">ibarakha cho manyoopani waayara ashaana enchi ni cho mihuwo uyara chinene,<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Ibarakha cha athumwaninyu chihothepa ibarakha chinokhuma umiakoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">chorera upwaha ibarakha cho miako cho khalhayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Chechiyo ibarakha chiyo chikhalheke vamuruni wa Nayusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">vayuchini waya ayo yaapangelhiye ichimwa ni manyonnaya.”<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Nabenyamini ari thoko mwiichi wo uchacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">wichishu unokhura inama yiivilhe aya uhiyu, ni ukawaniha yaahanlhe iyo uchechilho.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Yayo phi machokholhelho o makosho khumi ni melhi o Israeli. Ni ayo phi malhove yolhumanche aya Nayakhobo athumwanaya, vaalhapelhelha aya ibarakha achishaana aya, kila mmoka thoko chaaphwanelhiye awe.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhwa ni uvithiya u Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Baada yo vavawo, Nayakhobo ahaalhehera achishaana aya wiira, “Mii kihaatameria ukhwa, karupe ni manyaapwiiya aka aholhenlhe. Mmweeke mwaakivitha vamoka ni ashulhupalhe aka, unikhukuni umatani wa Naefroni, ntu o Uhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Umakpelha ulhe, nthelha unosha nchuwa iwani yo Umamre, ilhapo yo Ukanaani. Yeyo imata iyo yaathumiye ni Aburahimu wa Naefroni, Nhiti, wiira vakhalhe vakittu wo uvithelhiya attu. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Wowo phi waavithiye aya Aburahimu ni ahanu aya Asara, ni wowo phi uvithiye aya Naisaka ni ahanu aya Narabeka. Ni wowo phi uwo waavithilhe aka Nalea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Yeyo imata iyo ni nikhuku naya nno, chaathumiye ukhuma wa Ahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Nayakhobo vaamalhinhe aya waalhelhacha achishaana aya, aheechaathalhelha vankorini, nkayaahiya nrima, nkayaalhutaana ni ashulhupalhe aya aholhenlhe.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Vavawo Nayusufu ahaawulhuwelha athumwanaya makukhu, nkayonlha ni waakumbatira. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Nkaalhehera anamirete aya wiira yaahike makhura Naisraeili, athumwanaya, ahunte. Ni anamirete ayo nkayaapanga thoko chaalheheriye aya. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Thoko chaalhemalhelhiya aya, mahuku makhumi ncheshe o mattanga ahovira. Attu o Umisri ni ayo aheesha mattanga o mariro a Nayakhobo wo mahuku makhumi saba.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Mahuku o mariro ayo vaamanlhe aya, Nayusufu aherelhacha attu o upuwani u Nafarao wiira, “Yakhalhaka kihorumelhelhiya umihoolho winyu mwaatti, paahi kinoulhepelhani wiira kuurumeni nrwe u Nafarao mwolhumane wiira, athumwanaka yahokilhupelhiha yeeraka, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘athumwanaka yahokilhupelhiha yeeraka, “Mii kihaatameria vanokhwa aka. Mwakivitheke etu unihiyeni kihemme aka Ukanaani.” Paahi etu kinaalhepelha wiira akivahe nipesha kirwee kaavithe athumwanaka, kamalhihaka kinoohokolhia.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Nafarao nkayaakhulha, “Nrweeke mwaavitheke athumwaninyu thoko chenre aya wo ulhupelhihani.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Paahi etu Nayusufu ahothama nkayaarwa uwaavithani athumwanaya yaattukanaka ni anamitheko a Nafarao, ashulhupalhe o upuwani u Nafarao, vamoka ni ahoolhelhi o ilhapo yonkhaye yo Umisri. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Chiicho tho, Nayusufu ahaattukana ashilhoko aya onkhaye, achihima aya, ni ashilhoko a athumwanaya, Nayakhobo, onkhaye. Ugosheni uwo yaahalhanche achishaana aya vekha ni ipuri, ikhondoro ni ing'ope chaya. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Tho ahaattukana attu yaawenlhe ifarasi ni mikukuta cho ifarasi. Waari mphingo mulhupalhe chinene.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Vaaphilhe aya ipuwa yo weepettelhiya choolhia yo Uatadi, ukhopelhelhe mwolhoko wo Yorodani, wahonlhachiya chinene. Nayusufu nkayeesha mattanga o woopuwelha athumwanaya mahuku saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Attu o Ukanaani, anenchi o vavawo ayo, vonne aya attu akhalhaka mattanga vapuwani vawo, yaheera, “Wo ikekhiaye alha mariro a attu o Umisri alha, molhupalhe!” Paahi nkayeehana vavawo vakittu vawo, Abel Misri, varii mpaka nna, ukhopelhelhe mwolhoko wo Yorodani ulhe.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Nayakhobo yahopanga thoko chaalhehenre aya athumwanaya. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Yahaakusha mpaka Ukanaani, nkayaavitha unikhukuni Umakpelha ulhe, unosha nchuwa, iwani yo Umamre. Nikhuku vamoka ni imata iyo yaathumiye ni Aburahimu ukhuma wa Naefroni, ntu o Uhiti, wiira vakhalhe vakittu vo uvitheliya attu. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yamalheke waavitha athumwanaya, Nayusufu ahohokolhia vamoka ni manyonnaya ni attu onkhaye yaattukanne aya vaarwelhe aya uwaavithani athumwanaya.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayusufu anowaahelha nrima ashilhoko aya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Baada yo urimelha wa athumwanaya, ashilhoko aya Nayusufu aholhumacha yeeraka, “Veekinaka Nayusufu vano anonipangelha ichimwa ni ulhivihera chittu cho uhilhoka chaapangenlhe ihu.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Paahi etu yahorweha nttenga wa Nayusufu, yeeraka, “Athumwaninyu vaari aya akumi yalhehenre wiira, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Mwaahimerieke Nayusufu wiira, kineera, mwaalhevelheke manyonninyu chittu cho uhilhoka chonkhaye chaapannge aya upangelhani.’ Vano etu, chonte ninoulhepelhani wiira, nnilhevelhelhe chittu cho uhilhoka chonkhaye chaapannge ihu hii anamitheko a Nlhuku a athumwaninyu.” Nayusufu vaapantte aya nttenga ulha, yahonlha.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Manyonnaya ayo yahowa, nkayaakhoromacha ni wiira, “Nnooneke hii thoko ipotta chinyu.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Nansho Nayusufu nkayerelhacha wiira, “Nhoove. Chani mii kihokhalha Nlhuku? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mwaatti mwahothanana ukipangelha chittu cho uhilhoka, nansho Nlhuku aholhakelha moombone wiira attu alhame thoko chinoona inyu lhelho va. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Paahi nhoove ittu. Mii kinoushungani vamoka ni achishaana inyu.” Nkoolhumana rata ni waahelha nrima.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhwa wa Nayusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Nayusufu ahothepa ukhalha Umisri vamoka ni ashilhoko a athumwanaya onkhaye. Ukumi aya wonkhaye waari iyaakha mia ni khumi mpaka vaakhwilhe aya.<verse eid="GEN 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Nayusufu ahovaheriya woona achishaana ni uchuulhu wa mwaamwanaya, Efraimu, ni tho ahoonacha achishaana a Makiri, anaaya Namanase. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Paahi Nayusufu aherelhacha ashilhoko aya, “Mii vano mahuku aka ahophiyelha. Nansho Nlhuku wo ikekhiaye noowa ukaviherani. Noukumihani ilha ilhapo ilha ni urwehani ilhapo yaalhupenlhe awe Aburahimu, Naisaka ni Nayakhobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Yavireke vavawo, Nayusufu ahaalhupelhiha achishaana a Naisraeli, yeeraka, “Nlhuku vanohalha awe uwa uhokolhoshani vawo, mmweeke mwaakusha makhuva aka ukhuma uno.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Paahi Nayusufu nkayaarimelha Umisri ulhe, anari ntu o iyaakha mia ni khumi. Ni ayo manyaattu ayo yahohika nrete iruttu aya iyo wiira ihunte, nkayaathalhelha mmachiirani, Umisri ulhe.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>